window.FWN_MADAMS_IDENTITIES_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_MADAMS_IDENTITIES_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":701,"title":"Chapter 701 - I Will Be Back Before the College Entrance Examination","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","She raised her wrist and put the chalk on the blackboard.","Line after line, the girl’s handwriting was not cursive but full of personality. It was as freestyle as it could get.","In less than five minutes.","The girl put down the chalk in her hand, turned her head, and looked at him with a light expression. She said politely, “Teacher Liu, I’m done. You can see if it’s right.”","The Physics teacher was speechless.","He didn’t need to look. He watched the whole process, and what she wrote was the correct answer.","And it was even simpler than the standard answer he knew.","“That’s correct.” The Physics teacher was convinced by this girl. He turned around, looked at the large group of people in Class A, and said, “The one on the blackboard is the correct answer, you guys remember to copy it and study this question type carefully. You may see this type of question in the College Entrance Examination this year.”","“Okay.” Their voices sounded before they started scribbling.","He looked at the dozens of impatient eyes and picked up the textbook, tucking it under his arm. He then joked. “I guess you are not in the mood to listen to my class. There are still three minutes left, so I will dismiss you early today. There’ll be a test next lesson, you guys better perform well!”","“Okay!”","Liang Bowen and friends shouted the loudest.","The Physics teacher shook his head with a laugh, then turned to speak to Qiao Nian politely. “Then, I’ll get going first. Remember to ask them to copy down the answer.”","“Mm. See you, Teacher.” Qiao Nian responded respectfully.","In a good mood, the physics teacher hummed a song and walked out of the classroom without looking back.","As soon as he left.","The students in Class A were all like wild horses, crowding around the podium.","Their faces were full of excitement.","Liang Bowen reacted the fastest, staring at the girl who left the chalk on the podium. He smiled and asked, “Sister Nian, why did you come to school?”","Qiao Nian put one hand in her pocket, raised her eyes casually, and said, “There’s something on.”","“What’s on?” Liang Bowen blinked and said immediately, “Is it related to the admissions teachers who came to school today?”","Qiao Nian didn’t think about hiding it from them. She nodded and said, “Almost.”","The Class A students were so envious...","Almost all of the top-tier colleges and universities in the country had come, but Sister Nian did not see it as a big deal.","Shen Qingqing was more concerned about other things. She looked at her intently and asked, “Then... Sister Nian, will you come back to class and have lessons with us this time?”","This question was in the minds of everyone in Class A, and everyone was looking forward to it, hoping that Qiao Nian would come back.","Suddenly stared at by dozens of expectant eyes, Qiao Nian pulled down the brim of her cap and said with a somewhat helpless expression, “No. I’m here to apply for leave.”","Although everyone knew in their hearts that Qiao Nian no longer needed to come to school, they couldn’t help but feel disappointed when they heard that she had come to apply for leave.","Shen Qingqing responded very quickly, and immediately said, “It hasn’t been long since you came back from Beijing, it’s good to apply for leave and get some rest...”","But, she really wanted to study hard with Sister Nian in the final stretch before the College Entrance Examination.","Everyone in Class A must have felt the same.","But everyone, like Shen Qingqing, was more happy and proud of Qiao Nian than they were disappointed!","Qiao Nian scanned everyone’s faces. She rubbed her temple and said, “I’ve applied for a month’s leave. I will be back before the College Entrance Examination to take the exams with you guys.”","Once she said this, all the heads that had been hanging low snapped up and looked at her in disbelief."]},{"number":702,"title":"Chapter 702 - Sister Nian: An Expression to Describe You—Idiot!","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","“Sister Nian, you’re taking the College Entrance Examination?”","“Eh, Sister Nian, are you not going to Qing University?”","“College Entrance Examination...”","Everyone had heard about Qiao Nian’s selection of the Chinese Medicine Faculty in Qing University. Now that she suddenly said she would take the Chinese Medicine Faculty, the first reaction of the Class A students was shock. It was a pity for her. After all, Qing University was the most prestigious school in China. Qiao Nian was already promised a spot there, and she still wanted to take the Chinese Medicine Faculty. If she didn’t do well... she might end up in a less ideal school.","But on second thought, Sister Nian had chosen the Chinese Medicine Faculty, the worst faculty in Qing University. They now felt that it would be good for her to take the College Entrance Examination and re-select her school and major.","That was what Chen Yuan thought. Looking at her with a pair of steady, black eyes, he said calmly, “Have you considered it? Do you really want to take the College Entrance Examination?”","Just as Qiao Nian was about to get back to him, her cell phone vibrated.","Annoyed, she took it out from her pocket and looked down at it. It was an unread text message from an unfamiliar number.","While pressing the button, she replied to Chen Yuan, “I’ve thought about it. I have just told Principal Yu and Teacher Shen about this. I’m taking the College Entrance Examination but won’t fill in my options. This is just a formality...”","Taking the College Entrance Examination but not filling in her options!","Everyone was stunned.","What kind of nonsense was this?","Then again, they understood everything almost instantly.","This was probably the outcome after Qing University had discussed it with Sister Nian...","Everyone was thinking about what to say about this.","Qiao Nian glanced at the message on her cell phone. It was from Qiao Chen.","The tone of her message was one of annoyance.","[Wu Jie’s postings on the school forum and online platforms were instigated by you, right? Qiao Nian, what are you trying to do! Didn’t you break Wei Qi’s ribs? I’m not lying, you just turned to a few people you knew and used scheming means to suppress this matter. You also deleted the post in the First High School forum. You forced me to apologize to you last time at school. What are you trying to do by letting Wu Jie post on the Internet again?]","She was just done reading this message when the next message came in.","[My school promotion party tomorrow is canceled, are you happy now?]","Qiao Nian half-squinted her eyes, restrained the coldness in them. She picked up her cell phone impatiently, typed on the screen, and replied to her.","She then blacklisted the number.","...","At the same time.","Qiao Chen had already smashed everything that could be smashed in the room onto the ground. The whole room was a mess, and Shen Qiongzhi kept knocking on the door outside, but Qiao Chen was unwilling to open the door.","Exhausted, she slumped on the bed and saw her cell phone light up.","She picked it up angrily and opened the message.","[QN: Idiot!]","Qiao Chen felt hot blood rush from the back of her head to the sky. She felt as if a taut string in her brain was almost broken. She was so angry that she immediately dialed the number.","Who knew.","In the next second, a mechanical female voice came from the phone: “Sorry, the user you dialed is temporarily unavailable. Please call again later.”","There was only one possibility that she could be hung up on without hearing a sound—she had been blacklisted!","Qiao Chen’s face turned blue. She gritted her teeth and couldn’t hold it any longer as she slammed her cell phone on the ground.","Her cell phone came apart into several pieces!","“Qiao Nian!”","She thought that after she had gone to Beijing and was admitted to Qing University, she had successfully escaped the mess in Rao City. It wasn’t until today that she received several slaps on the face, and she realized that she had not...","Qiao Nian was like a nightmare, still pressing on top of her head, making her breathless."]},{"number":703,"title":"Chapter 703 - It Should Be Beijing","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Qiao Chen clenched her hand tightly and her chest heaved violently, gasping for breath. Her eyes were dark and unclear.","Fortunately...","Fortunately, Qiao Nian’s brain wasn’t good, and she was used to doing things as she wished. She was the top scorer but did not follow Liang Lu to learn under her, and instead chose the Chinese Medicine Faculty...","She had Cheng Wu to guarantee her a promising future, and the Shen family would be her backing. As long as she worked harder, one day she would truly enter the Beijing circle.","By then... she no longer had to care about these people from Rao City!","She remembered Wei Ling’s tone on the phone just now, and her heart was enveloped in a haze. She pursed her lips bitterly, thinking about how to regain her heart...","It didn’t matter whether they held the school promotion party or not. Anyway, Qiao Nian’s results would be announced by Qing University tomorrow. Her results were destined to be a sensation.","Even if her entrance banquet was held, it was nondescript and would be a slap in her face.","She might as well not hold it!","But she must please Wei Ling. Otherwise, without her help in the music exchange conference, she wouldn’t be able to get the international masters to notice her.","...","After replying to her message and blacklisting her number, Qiao Nian looked up again at the Class A students and said, “I’ll be leaving Rao City for a while in a few days. I’m thinking of putting together a practice booklet for you guys, based on the questions I predict for the exams. What do you guys say?”","She spoke lightly as if it was nothing much.","However, Chen Yuan knew how good she was at predicting questions. In the past, Qiao Chen was able to maintain her top position in the school because of Qiao Nian’s predictions.","“Yes!” Although Liang Bowen didn’t know whether Qiao Nian’s predictions were good or not, he was the first to raise his hand. His handsome face was filled with a wide grin. “Hey, Sister Nian, I’m depending on you for my dreams!”","“Me too!”","“Me too.”","With him taking the lead, everyone raised their hands.","Qiao Nian glanced around and took a mental note of the number of people. She then put her hands in her pockets and said coolly, “Okay. I’ll give it to Chen Yuan when I’m done, and whoever wants it can make a copy.”","“No problem.” Liang Bowen made an OK gesture.","Jiang Tingting and the others also had no objection.","The focus then shifted to what to eat tonight.","Chen Yuan paid more attention to the first half of what she said. When everyone was discussing where to eat after school, he took the opportunity to ask the girl in a low voice, “You’re leaving? Where are you going this time?”","Qiao Nian was originally leaning on the edge of the podium, with her elbows on the podium and one leg on the edge of the podium. She casually listened to everyone’s chatting.","She looked up at him, rubbed her temple, and said slightly hoarsely, “I don’t know yet, it should be Beijing.”","She had heard of the Ninth Branch before.","It was one of the most powerful organizations in China, and many rare resources and cutting-edge unreleased technologies were in their hands.","But where exactly was the Ninth Branch located, she had no idea and was never concerned enough to check it out before.","“You don’t know?” Chen Yuan was stunned by her answer and didn’t react for a while, but he instinctively believed in her ability, so he pursed his lips and said, “Then, when will you come back?”","Qiao Nian lowered her eyes and pondered for a moment before giving an approximate time. “If it is fast, it will be a week. If it is slow, I don’t know, but it shouldn’t be too long.”","“That’s good.” Chen Yuan smiled. “Let me know when you’re back. My mother has been talking about how you haven’t come to my house for dinner in a long time. She brought an old hen from her hometown a few days ago, and she has been raising it all the time, unwilling to eat it. She’s waiting for you to come so she can cook chicken soup for you. I’ll tell her when you come back. She can cook it, and I’ll send it to you.”","Qiao Nian thought about it and said, “Wait for me to come back. I haven’t visited Aunt Chen for a long time.. I’ll go directly to your house when I get back.”"]},{"number":704,"title":"Chapter 704 - Sister Nian’s So Popular Without Entering the Entertainment Industry","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","The corner of Chen Yuan’s mouth involuntarily curled up. He nodded and said calmly, “Okay. Let me know in advance before you get back, and I will get my mother to cook it first.”","Afraid that Qiao Nian didn’t understand, he explained, “The old hen has been raised for several years, and I’m afraid that it won’t be stewed properly in just an hour or two. If you want to eat it, it needs to be stewed for at least half a day.”","In fact, he didn’t need to explain, as Qiao Nian did not think too much about it. She agreed readily, her dark eyes as beautiful as ink. She then pulled down her cap and said sassily, “I see. I’ll tell you in advance when I’m about to come back.”","“Okay.” Chen Yuan smiled sincerely as he looked at the girl’s fair side profile. He pursed his lips and said seriously, “Sister Nian, I’ve thought about it. I want to take the college entrance examination and apply to Nanjing University, for their Computing faculty.”","Qiao Nian didn’t expect that he would also want to go to a university in Beijing, much less Nanjing University which was next to Qing University.","Come shock could be seen on her face, but she didn’t say much. She simply raised her eyes, gave him the same serious expression, and asked, “Have you thought about it carefully?","“Nanjing University is hard to get into, especially the Computing faculty, which is regarded as their best major. If you want to enter through the College Entrance Examination, you must at least score over 700 points.”","The full marks for the College Entrance Examination was 750 points.","150 points each for Chinese, Mathematics, and Second Language, and 300 points for the Sciences and Humanities combined.","The annual admission score of Nanjing University was similar to that of Qing University, which was above 650 points. But this score was only enough for one to be admitted into the school. If they wanted to study Computing, they had to stand out from a large number of candidates who were also admitted with a score of 650 points or above. That would be about 30 points above the cut-off point, at the very least.","She knew how well Chen Yuan did in school.","He could get into a top-tier school quite easily, but to get into Nanjing University or Qing University, in particular, was a bit difficult.","Qiao Nian looked at him and asked, “Are you confident?”","Chen Yuan leaned against the podium like she did and chuckled in a lazy but humorous tone. “I’m not.”","He was as honest as he could get!","Qiao Nian was speechless.","He saw some rare surprise on her face. He smiled and was a little less serious than before as he shrugged his shoulders and showed some vigor that an 18-year-old hardly displayed. “My current grades would give me about 630 points in the College Entrance Examination, 20 points away from Nanjing University’s previous admission scores. So, if you ask me if I’m confident, I’ll have to say I’m definitely not confident...","“But I’ve already made up my mind. Either I study for another year instead of going to college, or I go to the best university to study the best major!”","The conditions of his family did not allow him to waste four years in college. If he completed the four years and graduated like just another student, he would rather not attend college at all.","Qiao Nian raised her brows and said nothing.","Chen Yuan said slowly and calmly, “There’s still more than two months before the College Entrance Examination. I will use my time wisely and study hard, maybe I’ll have a chance. If I don’t succeed, then I’ll think about it again.”","After speaking, he turned to look at her again and smiled. “Sister Nian, you don’t know this, but after you confirmed that you were going to Qing University, everyone in the class decided to go to a university in Beijing as well.","“Liang Bowen and Shen Qingqing have already decided to try for Qing University, and Jiang Tingting and the others also want to be admitted to a university in Beijing. The few people in the class who did not choose a university in Beijing also chose a nearby school...” He squinted and smiled. “Sister Nian, given your charm, are you sure you won’t consider the entertainment industry?","“If you’re willing to enter the entertainment industry, I think you can become quite popular.”","He was somewhat joking with his words.","He had no idea that the girl standing in front of him was Big Boss Zhui Guang, whose popularity had shot to the stars recently."]},{"number":705,"title":"Chapter 705 - Master Wang Personally Sent Them Off","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Qiao Nian looked away and said lazily, “I won’t, I’m not interested!","“As for university matters, you can just think about it yourself. There are still two or three months left. With your intelligence, if you try harder, you may be admitted to the Computing faculty of Nanjing University. You have to have confidence in yourself. If you don’t believe in yourself, you won’t even have a chance at it.”","Chen Yuan didn’t think she would encourage him and was stunned for a while. After all, his idea was too ambitious. After he mentioned it to Shen Hui, the other party called him to the office several times to convince him to change to a safer, more achievable school and major.","Qiao Nian didn’t ask him to change his mind. She simply got him to think about it carefully.","The light in his eyes gradually lit up. He took a deep breath as something stirred in his chest, and he seemed to have the courage to face difficulties.","Just at this time, Liang Bowen, who had already decided with a group of people what to eat for the evening, walked over. He leaned on his shoulder and asked familiarly, “What are you talking about with Sister Nian? I see you guys have talked for a long time.”","Chen Yuan did not want to tell others about the conversation just now, so he shook his head and said, “It’s nothing.”","Liang Bowen glanced at him, but didn’t ask any further questions. He turned his head and said to the girl in high spirits, “Sister Nian, we have discussed it. We will have steamboat at night, are you coming?”","Qiao Nian came to find them to have a meal together in the first place. Moreover, steamboat was one of her favorite foods, so there was definitely no objection. “I am!”","“Nice!” Liang Bowen immediately laughed. “We’re having steamboat tonight!”","...","Three days later.","At Rao City Airport.","Ye Wangchuan personally sent them off.","As soon as they arrived at the airport, Gu San very wisely left to buy breakfast, leaving only Qiao Nian and the man who had just been discharged from the hospital.","“Call me when you arrive in Beijing.” Ye Wangchuan lowered his head, the coldness on his face turned into the warmth amidst the spring breeze, with deep eyes focused and seductive.","Qiao Nian didn’t sleep well all night and got up early in the morning to catch a plane. She felt cold, and her temple was sore.","She pulled up the hood of the sweater, took out her earphones, and gave a casual “Mm”. She then said, “Even if I don’t call you, Gu San would.”","This was true.","Ye Wangchuan curled his thin lips. In a very good mood, he leaned back his neck slightly, saying with a chuckle, “... But I’d rather hear you tell me personally.”","Qiao Nian was speechless.","The warm feeling she got in his ward the other day was back.","Qiao Nian raised her eyes to look at him, then pursed the corners of her mouth and frowned slightly. “You...”","Ye Wangchuan raised his hand and rubbed the top of her head before she could finish, cutting her off. “Tell me when you get to Beijing, and tell me when you go to the Ninth Branch as well. You don’t have to worry about the Ninth Branch. Besides Gu San following you, I also told Bo Jingxing to look out for you. Luo Qing will also be there at that time. You know them, anyway.”","“I’m not worried about this.” Qiao Nian’s attention was diverted by him, and she didn’t notice his reckless intimacy and small gestures as she said nonchalantly.","“I’m worried.” The man’s tone was low. Almost as soon as she finished speaking, he lowered his eyes and said, “Call me if you need anything in the next two days. My phone will be turned on 24 hours a day.”","He was required to go somewhere else for something urgent. Otherwise, he would definitely accompany Qiao Nian to the Ninth Branch.","Even though he had asked Gu San to follow her and had even spoken to Bo Jingxing about it, he didn’t want to leave her alone, for fear that she wouldn’t be used to it...","She was his precious, of course, he had to be there to not worry for her!"]},{"number":706,"title":"Chapter 706 - Flight to Beijing","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Just at this time, the airport broadcast sounded a voice urging boarding.","Qiao Nian came back to her senses, pulled at her shoulder bag, and said coolly, “Time to board the plane. I’ll go first.”","Gu San also came back from “buying breakfast”. He was empty-handed, having obviously bought nothing but loneliness!","Seeing her, Gu San touched his nose and explained in embarrassment, “There were too many people queuing for KFC. I waited 20 minutes, but it still wasn’t my turn yet. So I came back upon seeing that the plane was about to take off.”","He looked at Ye Wangchuan with the meaning: ‘Have you finished chatting with Miss Qiao?’","But that man did not look back at him.","Qiao Nian didn’t mind it. She pulled down her hoodie, revealing a delicate and beautiful profile. She then said, “It’s fine. There’s breakfast on the plane, anyway.”","Ye Wangchuan had booked first-class tickets for them, and the food provided had much variety and was of high quality.","“Mm...” Gu San scratched his head a little awkwardly. He looked up at the man who was here to send them off and said, “Master Wang, in that case, Miss Qiao and I will board the plane first?”","The second announcement was made.","Qiao Nian turned to look at the snaking queues and then said, “We really have to get going.”","“Remember to call me.”","He had said this at least thrice before. Qiao Nian looked up and finally responded obediently, “Mm, I got it. I’ll let you know when we arrive in Beijing.”","With that, she called Gu San along and waved her hand coolly. “We’re going!”","Gu San watched as she left without turning back.","He hesitated for a moment and looked at the unmoving man. He then said, “Master Wang, I’ll get going. You should get back and rest, too.”","“Go on. Help me take good care of her.”","“Mm.”","He didn’t have to remind him about this. Gu San was well aware and would not forget about it. After some goodbyes, he hurried to catch up with the girl.","The flight from Rao City to Beijing was three and a half hours.","...","Three hours later.","A crowd was waiting at the arrival hall of the airport in Beijing.","Zhou Wei, Luo Qing, and Bo Jingxing were around.","Besides them, a few other Ninth Branch members were present as well.","Other than the three of them who had seen Qiao Nian before, the rest of them had no idea what she looked like. They only knew they were here to receive the doctor who would treat Master Cheng.","They looked at the board; the plane would land in about 10 minutes.","Somebody couldn’t help but say curiously, “I wonder what kind of person Miss Qiao is. She must be an impressive doctor.”","Zhou Wei’s arms were crossed, and her expression was cold. She sneered and said sarcastically, “Ha, it’s best you don’t expect too much. You might get disappointed when you see her.”","“Uh... it can’t be that bad, right? Leader Zhou, you’ve met Miss Qiao before?” That person asked in shock.","Zhou Wei’s mocking expression got thicker. “Of course I have.”","The few of them who hadn’t met Qiao Nian looked at Zhou Wei with much interest.","“What kind of person is Miss Qiao like?” The person speaking was a square-faced guy named Chen Zhu.","Zhou Wei looked at him and said, “You want to know?”","Chen Zhu was a serious man with a great personality. He immediately said, “Of course. She was picked by Master Wang to treat Master Cheng.. Of course, I’m curious.”"]},{"number":707,"title":"Chapter 707 - Biased Against Sister Nian","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","The corner of Zhou Wei’s mouth pulled down, and a hint of jealousy flashed in her eyes as she said dismissively, “She’s just a high school student! She’s a boastful girl with no real ability, but she’s pretty mad on her own.”","Several Ninth Branch members who had never seen Qiao Nian were stunned. They didn’t expect her to say such a thing.","Luo Qing couldn’t hear her go on anymore and looked at her with a frown. “Leader Zhou, you don’t have to say it like that.”","He had no idea what was going on in Zhou Wei’s mind.","That day when she talked meanly about Miss Qiao in Master Wang’s ward, he had not flared up at her. He only told her to copy the Ninth Branch rules and regulations a hundred times over.","The Ninth Branch rules and regulations spanned two full pages. A hundred times that was 200 pages. Zhou Wei had been at it for a few days now.","In addition, a project that Zhou Wei was working on was also handed over to others by Master Wang. This was equivalent to his punishing her.","She had just been punished and had completed her task, and now she was back at it again.","Luo Qing didn’t understand. Could she not tell that Master Wang treated Miss Qiao differently, that she was his precious!","Now that Miss Qiao was coming, Master Wang even called Young Master Bo and got him to receive her personally.","This was never before seen in the Ninth Branch!","He couldn’t understand why Zhou Wei had to ram her head against the wall!","Bo Jingxing now gave her a warning glance as well. It was calm but meaningful.","Zhou Wei bit her lip in embarrassment, raised her chin, and continued looking arrogant. “I didn’t say anything wrong! Didn’t she say she could solve the programming issue in two days? Now what? It’s been three days, where is it?","“If she couldn’t do it, why brag!”","Luo Qing couldn’t speak for Qiao Nian on this matter. He only frowned and quickly said, “Gu San said that Miss Qiao is very busy these days. She’s busy getting revision materials for her classmates. Maybe she’s too busy and didn’t make time for...”","“Haha.” Zhou Wei sneered, a look of disbelief evident on her face.","She really didn’t believe that Qiao Nian could solve the problem of the source code. What she couldn’t solve in three months, could not possibly be solved by a high school student.","Since Luo Qing insisted on speaking up for Qiao Nian, she couldn’t be bothered with him. Anyway, Qiao Nian’s plane would land very soon, and when she arrived, Zhou Wei would see how Luo Qing would be slapped in the face!","Seeing that the atmosphere was tense, the Ninth Branch members tried to ease the situation. Chen Zhu digressed and talked about some gossip he had heard recently.","“By the way, speaking of doctors, I remember one thing.","“Didn’t Old Master Wei fall ill some time ago? There was no improvement even after they looked for many doctors locally and abroad. The situation back then was very similar to that of Master Cheng now, and Liang Lu couldn’t do anything about it either. Everyone thought that Old Master Wei wouldn’t make it that day, but who knew that Young Master Wei appeared with a genius doctor. Then, Old Master Wei woke up without surgery, and it is said that the doctor only used acupuncture and moxibustion according to Traditional Chinese Medicine...”","“So effective? Which miracle doctor is that?” someone asked.","Luo Qing was also very interested and didn’t have any more time to quarrel with Zhou Wei. “Is there any news about this miracle doctor?”","“No.” Chen Zhu shook his head. “I haven’t heard of the doctor before. This person is said to be very mysterious, but there’s news about this doctor on the black market. It’s just that the black market has always kept their information tight, and it is difficult to find people without the help of the middleman. After that day, the Wei family didn’t spread much information about the miracle doctor, but I vaguely heard people say that the miracle doctor seems to have come from Rao City.”","Rao City again?","Zhou Wei was annoyed to hear about Rao City. But upon hearing this, a glint appeared in her eyes, and she revealed a thoughtful expression.","“If only I could find this miracle doctor...”"]},{"number":708,"title":"Chapter 708 - I See Them","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Nobody said anything, but everyone felt the same.","The flight arrived punctually.","As soon as Qiao Nian got off the plane, Gu San dutifully reminded her, “Miss Qiao, don’t forget to call Master Wang.”","Qiao Nian slept on the plane and just woke up with her earphones plugged in. However, because she didn’t like listening to music when sleeping, she actually did not turn on the sound. So, she happened to hear what Gu San said.","With tired eyes, she took off one earphone, scrolled to someone’s phone number, then paused. She looked up at him with her dark, bottomless eyes and asked, “I can’t send a message?”","A message seemed to suffice if she just wanted to let him know she had arrived safely.","Gu San pretended not to understand and said in a low voice, “Miss Qiao, didn’t you promise to call Master Wang? Sending a message seems... like a bad idea?”","“Forget it.” Qiao Nian didn’t know if it was really a bad idea to send a message. She rubbed her temple and said, “I’ll just call.”","The call was picked up almost instantly.","“Hello.”","The man’s voice was low and sultry, and he sounded so present despite not being physically in front of her. “Are you in Beijing?”","Qiao Nian walked out with the crowd and put one hand in her pocket. “Mm, just got off the plane, ready to go out.”","The man on the other end of the phone chuckled lightly, his low-mellow voice sounding like a harp—almost lazy, but with an inexplicable extravagance. “The weather in Beijing is colder than that in Rao City, so be careful not to catch a cold...”","Qiao Nian raised her head and found that the people passing by were wearing padded coats. It really looked like Beijing was a lot colder than Rao City. She lowered her eyes, collected the warmth that flashed in them, and said in a low voice, “I know, I was in Beijing just a few days ago.”","She had come when Wei Lou got her to have a look at his grandfather. That wasn’t too long ago.","However, compared to half a month ago, the temperature in Beijing seemed to have dropped a few degrees. Qiao Nian almost stopped to buy a bottle of hot coffee when she passed the vending machine, but Gu San was already walking ahead of her, so she pursed her lips and said nothing. Giving up on coffee, she followed Gu San out.","“...I almost forgot that you were there before.”","While she was distracted, the man’s voice came through the earphones, as if deliberately provocative. “I asked Bo Jingxing to pick you up at the airport. He should be outside, you will see him later. Luo Qing is also there, and also some people from the Ninth Branch. You may not know them... but Gu San is there, just follow him.”","Qiao Nian felt an itch in her ears, frowned, and kept her eyes forward. Soon, she saw Luo Qing and the others not far away.","Luo Qing, Bo Jingxing... and also some unfamiliar faces that she had never seen before. There were about seven or eight people.","She slowly retracted her gaze, her tone sloppy and ruffian. “Oh, I see them.”","...","On the other side, Luo Qing also saw the girl coming out of the terminal.","It had been a few days since he last saw her.","The girl was still dressed up in a cool fashion, except that her previous sweater was now replaced by a white hoodie. She was still wearing a cap, hiding her hair, and with her earphones plugged in as if she was talking to someone. The carefree and indifferent laziness in her bones was unconcealable!","He pointed in Qiao Nian’s direction, turned his head, and said to Bo Jingxing, who had been replying to his messages, “Young Master Bo, it’s Miss Qiao and Gu San. They’re out.”","They’re out?","The Ninth Branch members couldn’t help but look in the direction he pointed—","They knew Gu San.","He was Master Wang’s right-hand man and was always with him."]},{"number":709,"title":"Chapter 709 - Did You Forget Something?","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Besides, there was only one other person with Gu San. A girl with one hand in her pocket and the other hand holding her cell phone as she was on a call.","The cap covered her delicate brows and eyes, only revealing a cold chin. Her whole person looked cool.","But in terms of figure and age, the girl was not too mature. She was at most 18 or 19 years old...","This was Miss Qiao?","The doctor who Master Wang looked for to treat Master Cheng?","She really was a high school student?","The Ninth Branch members were stunned, and they all showed expressions of amazement and consternation. They looked at each other, but the looks on their faces were not very good.","Only Zhou Wei hugged her chest with both hands with cold eyes. “Hmph, pretentious!”","Her voice wasn’t too loud or too soft, just enough for everyone to hear her.","Luo Qing frowned reflexively and glanced in her direction, intentionally reminding her not to do this after Qiao Nian came over.","But it was too late, Qiao Nian had already come over.","“Young Master Bo, Leader Luo...” Gu San was relatively familiar with the people from the Ninth Branch and greeted them. When it was Zhou Wei’s turn, he automatically pretended not to see her and skipped her, directly greeting Chen Zhu who was next to her. “It’s been a while.”","“Haha, it has been long.”","“Brat, you’re finally willing to come back!”","The people from Ninth Branch had a good relationship with him. Everyone gathered around him, surrounded him, playfully shoved him with their hands, and hooked their arms around him.","After saying hello to most of the people, Gu San didn’t forget his mission. He pulled the hand of the person who was shouldering with him, turned his head, and introduced her to everyone.","“Oh right, let me introduce someone to you guys.”","He smiled and pointed at the girl who had just walked over, saying with an intimate attitude, “This is Miss Qiao. I’m here mainly to accompany Miss Qiao to see Master Cheng.”","The people from the Ninth Branch were still laughing with him at first, but when they saw Qiao Nian, their expressions became unnatural again.","Although they greeted Qiao Nian one after another, they were mostly being civil, and not much real welcome and happiness could be seen in their eyes.","Master Cheng was too important to the Ninth Branch!","Even if the girl in front of them was someone whom Master Wang found, to be honest, being so young was still unacceptable to them.","This girl did not look like she understood Medicine, either.","Even Chen Zhu, who had expectations for Qiao Nian at the beginning, couldn’t hide his doubts at this moment. Could Master Wang really have been cheated by her, as Leader Zhou mentioned?","Qiao Nian hadn’t hung up the phone yet and could feel that after Gu San introduced her to everyone, the eyes that fell on her were suspicious.","She didn’t feel anything special. At that moment, she simply pulled down her cap, raised her eyes, and looked over. She introduced herself concisely, “Qiao Nian. Hello.”","Her introduction was too simple. Several people from the Ninth Branch were stunned for a while. She was so cool?","Only Zhou Wei sneered at this time and suddenly said, “Did Miss Qiao forget something?”","She suddenly said these words, and everyone looked at her.","Luo Qing seemed to have guessed what she wanted to say and stopped her in a low voice. “Leader Zhou!”","Master Wang had already punished her, what was she trying to do again!","Zhou Wei looked arrogant and pretended not to hear him. She said calmly, “I remember that Miss Qiao mentioned that the problem of automated programming can be solved in one day. It has been three days, has Miss Qiao solved it yet?”","Originally, everyone was happy to receive her following her flight.. Even when others saw that Qiao Nian was so young and felt more or less uncomfortable about it, no one wore this suspicion and disapproval on their faces."]},{"number":710,"title":"Chapter 710 - Asking to Be Slapped With Humiliation","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Zhou Wei was practically interrogating her.","No matter what the situation was, her tone was extremely disrespectful.","Even Bo Jingxing, a Buddhist who kept his cool, frowned at this point. He turned to her with a warning glance.","Zhou Wei pretended not to see it. She kept her eyes fixed on the girl with her cap on, and continued pushing her way. “I’m not rushing you, but Miss Qiao, back then you were the one who told the few of us that you could solve it in one day. It’s been so long and you were so confident about it, so I thought I’d ask.”","Taking one day to solve the automated program?!","The few Ninth Branch members exchanged shocked glances.","Luo Qing and Zhou Wei had just argued in front of them while they were talking about the program, but nobody knew what program it was exactly.","Now that Zhou Wei mentioned “automated”, everyone was stunned.","Automated technologies were one of the most popular technologies currently.","Every country wanted a share of this technology as soon as possible.","But the technology was too advanced and difficult to work with!","The Ninth Branch had been researching it all this time, but the progress was abysmal. Previously, when they heard that something was wrong with the source code, Zhou Wei and the two teams she was leading spent three whole months trying to figure it out. Yet, this Miss Qiao actually said she could solve it in a day?","Everyone kept quiet, but deep down they agreed with what Zhou Wei had said previously, that Qiao Nian was too wild.","She wasn’t just wild, she was overboard!","How could a high school student solve a problem with an automated program source code in a day?","This...","Zhou Wei saw how the rest of the Ninth Branch members were looking at Qiao Nian now and sneered. She tipped her chin up and said proudly, “Miss Qiao, the source code, are you done with it?”","She sounded calm and mild as if she was just asking a casual question, but everyone could tell she was finding trouble with Qiao Nian.","Gu San was getting angry. He warned her coldly, “Zhou Wei, don’t go too far!”","“Ha, I’m going too far? Miss Qiao said that herself. She said that she could solve the code in one day, I’m just here to ask about it. Why? I can’t even bring it up?” She chuckled as disdain filled her eyes. “Since I can’t bring it up now, then Miss Qiao shouldn’t have mentioned it back then. Given that she’d said it herself, it’s no surprise that someone’s going to ask her about it...”","She was basically already saying that Qiao Nian was embarrassing.","Gu San almost lost his cool.","Everyone felt the awkward and tense atmosphere.","They hadn’t expected Zhou Wei to establish her position in front of Qiao Nian so quickly.","This... was a bit too much.","Qiao Nian didn’t increase the volume on her cell phone.","The man on the other end of the line could hear some sounds but did not know what was going on.","Ye Wangchuan asked hoarsely, “What’s going on, why aren’t you saying anything?”","“Mm? Say what?” Qiao Nian appeared to not have heard Zhou Wei’s provocation as she put her hand to her earphone.","“Have you gathered with Luo Qing and the rest?” The man’s voice was warm and flirtatious.","Only then did Qiao Nian look up and catch Zhou Wei’s gaze. Qiao Nian’s eyes were rather cold as usual. “Mm.”","She didn’t tell him that most of the Ninth Branch members did not seem to welcome her. She just squinted her eyes in some annoyance and said, “I’ll hang up first.”","With that, she ended the call.","Zhou Wei’s expression had turned awful when she realized that Qiao Nian was still on the phone. She brought up the same old matter in an unpleasant tone and said, “Miss Qiao, have you come up with the code? It’s fine if you haven’t.. You can just tell the truth, there’s no need to hide it.”"]},{"number":711,"title":"Chapter 711 - Sister Nian Taking Out a USB Drive","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","“Ha.” Qiao Nian chuckled and took off her earphones, then turned to her irritatedly. “Did I say I was hiding anything?”","“Didn’t you...” Zhou Wei almost said ‘Didn’t you fail to come up with the code?’","At this point, the girl walked right past her and approached Luo Qing. She took a USB drive out of her pocket and handed it to him.","“This is?” Luo Qing took the USB drive from her, a little confused.","What was Miss Qiao giving him a USB drive for?","“You guys’ stuff.” Qiao Nian’s eyes were slightly red from her lack of sleep, making her look wilder than usual. “Didn’t you guys ask me to have a look at a code? I’ve sorted it out.”","“You mean this is the source code?” Luo Qing’s agitation was unconcealable. A look of disbelief flashed across his face.","“Mm.”","Luo Qing was speechless now. He could produce no words at this point.","Zhou Wei and her team spent three months and did not find a solution to this problem. Meanwhile, she solved the problem of the automated program in just three days?","“Miss Qiao, when did you come up with it? I-I had no idea.”","Qiao Nian’s look was eye-catching, to begin with. She squinted her eyes and said calmly, “The day before yesterday. I was busy with some other matters thereafter and forgot to inform you.”","The day before yesterday?","This meant that she had only taken a day to solve it.","Luo Qing opened his mouth but was at a loss for words. He could barely calm down as he looked at her.","This was incredible!","Taking just one day to settle the hottest automated technology problem in the world.","Since there were others around, he didn’t want to reveal Qiao Nian’s private matters. Otherwise, he would be repeating his words from before.","Given Qiao Nian’s talent and capability, wouldn’t she be doing well in the Computing industry?","Why would she study Chinese Medicine? What a pity!","If she really did solve this problem, Miss Qiao was more than qualified to join the Ninth Branch!","“You said you solved it? How is that possible?” Zhou Wei’s expression was dark and awful. She doubted her intuitively.","She hadn’t expected Qiao Nian to really have brought a USB drive with her, let alone hand it to Luo Qing in front of everyone else only after Zhou Wei herself was done mocking her.","What a slap to her own face!","But she simply did not believe that Qiao Nian had the ability to solve the source code problem in one day. After all, given someone who researched this area, she was clear just how complicated the technology was.","However, she didn’t carry a laptop around and so couldn’t verify on the spot. She had to swallow her anger for now, but she was still indignant. “... Don’t you just use a random USB drive to fool us.”","Qiao Nian couldn’t be bothered with her. Her eyes had already turned cold with annoyance.","But on the account of Ye Wangchuan and Gu San, she did not flare up.","Bo Jingxing walked over, passing Zhou Wei and approaching Qiao Nian. He said to her, “Sister Qiao must be tired after sitting on the plane for so many hours. Let’s go, I’ll take you to the Ninth Branch first.”","Qiao Nian pursed her lips and looked up calmly. She nodded. “I’ll have to trouble you.”","Bo Jingxing smiled and said politely, “You’ve come all the way to have a look at Master Cheng. We’re the ones troubling you.”","Qiao Nian smiled casually. “Is that so, I thought I was gatecrashing.”","Otherwise, why was the atmosphere here so unfriendly?","“Of course, that is so.” Bo Jingxing knew just what she was referring to. He shot Zhou Wei a deep glance and then smiled at Qiao Nian. “I’ll give Miss Qiao an explanation regarding this matter.. We’ll have to depend on you to help Master Cheng out.”"]},{"number":712,"title":"Chapter 712 - Did You Really Think That She Came Here Begging to Attend to Master Cheng?","paragraphs":["“Don’t ask me for help. I have to see some patients first, and it may not be possible for me to see you.” Qiao Nian stuck one hand in her pocket and spoke coolly.","She spoke very directly.","Bo Jingxing chuckled. He relaxed a little and spoke with a smile. “Master Cheng is in the Ninth Branch. I will take you there first.”","While he was speaking, he seemed to remember something. He said, “This should be your first time at the Ninth Branch, right?”","“Huh?” Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows and looked at him with her black eyes.","Did it look like she came here before?","If it wasn’t for Master Cheng’s treatment, she probably wouldn’t even need to visit the Ninth Branch at all.","Bo Jingxing looked at the girl’s beautiful eyes and then put his hand on his forehead. He smiled dumbfoundedly. “I thought that Wangchuan had brought you here before.”","“He did not.” Qiao Nian quickly denied it as she held onto her earphones. She was a little flustered.","“Hmm... He’s more innocent than I thought.”","Qiao Nian was speechless. She frowned and wondered what innocence had to do with him bringing her to the Ninth Branch.","Bo Jingxing turned his head and smiled, asking the large group of people standing around in the room, “Who would like to accompany Miss Qiao and show her around the Ninth Branch?”","This...","Zhou Wei had a dark expression on her face. She did not speak.","Luo Qing’s attention was on the USB that Qiao Nian had given him, and he kept on looking at it. He couldn’t wait to find a computer and see its contents.","The other people all hesitated after they saw Qiao Nian’s young face.","No one answered.","Since no one replied, Bo Jingxing simply called on someone. “Wang Jian, do you have the time to show her around?”","The man who was called on had a beard. He wordlessly pointed at himself, not believing what was happening. “Young Master Bo, are you referring to me?”","Bo Jingxing nodded.","He quickly glanced at the thin girl standing there and lowered his head reluctantly. He hesitated. “I’m afraid I don’t have time. I’m still working on a project with Team Leader Luo. The project needs to be handed in next week. My part hasn’t been completed yet.”","He was really unwilling.","Miss Qiao looked too young, and he did not want to waste his precious time showing her around.","He would prefer to use that time to learn from the team leaders in the institute. Even if they weren’t free, he would prefer to research by himself. He didn’t want to take care of a young girl.","Bo Jingxing didn’t expect him to refuse, and his smile faltered.","Some color returned to Zhou Wei’s complexion, and a mocking smile curled up on her lips. She looked at Qiao Nian mockingly.","Qiao Nian didn’t care, and she also did not want to embarrass Bo Jingxing. She spoke calmly. “There’s no need. Gu San is here, that’s enough. In any case, I’m only here to attend to a patient.”","She didn’t intend to visit the Ninth Branch.","Although the Ninth Branch had a great reputation in the country and many people dreamed of working here, it was only average in her eyes.","She had seen many places that were more mysterious and more powerful than the Ninth Branch.","“Miss Qiao...” Angry, Gu San clenched his fists. He couldn’t bear to watch it. He felt very uncomfortable. He was about to tell Qiao Nian to forget about this and to just go home.","He didn’t expect the people in the Ninth Branch to have such an attitude.","If it weren’t for Master Cheng, he would have stuck up for Miss Qiao!","Gu San swept his gaze across the people who were shrinking in their seats. They were afraid of being called on by Bo Jingxing to show Qiao Nian around.","Although many people on the black market begged Miss Qiao to attend to their sickness, in such a long time, Miss Qiao had only attended to Old Master Wei.","Liang Lu said that Old Master Wei had no choice but to undergo craniotomy, but Miss Qiao managed to save him without operating on him.","If it wasn’t because of Master Wang’s plea, did they really think that Miss Qiao would come to take a look at Master Cheng?"]},{"number":713,"title":"Chapter 713 - Someone Stood Up","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","“All of you don’t have the time?” Bo Jingxing glanced at them one by one. Everyone reluctantly met his gaze.","He didn’t expect everyone to be unwilling to show Qiao Nian around the Ninth Branch. His heart sank slightly, and he rubbed his eyebrows. He didn’t know how to explain this situation to Qiao Nian.","“How about...”","Ye Wangchuan called him specially to tell him that he had to welcome her properly. However, as soon as she had arrived, he had already embarrassed her.","Regardless of her ability to treat Master Cheng, this situation was not ideal.","Bo Jingxing was very busy. He had a lot of things to take care of. He was just about to offer to show her around personally when someone in the crowd stood up.","The person weakly raised his hand. “Young Master Bo, I have some time. How about I show Miss Qiao around?”","Qiao Nian didn’t care if anyone showed her around. She never expected anyone to volunteer themselves. The edges of her eyes raised a little, and she looked over with surprise. An unassuming man had raised his hand.","The man met her gaze and nodded politely. He greeted her and spoke with a friendly attitude. “I don’t have many things to take care of. If Miss Qiao is alright with me, I have the time to show you around.”","Bo Jingxing was worried that no one would want to show her around. If someone was willing, he had no opinions against their decision. He turned his head and checked with Qiao Nian. “Sister Qiao, are you okay with Chen Zhu showing you around?”","He knew that Chen Zhu was also from the research department. He joined the Ninth Branch at the same time as Zhou Wei, and their abilities were comparable. However, he didn’t have any results to show for it in the past few years.","Comparatively, Zhou Wei had been involved with the Ninth Branch since young.","Chen Zhu didn’t stand out.","Qiao Nian narrowed her black eyes and retracted her gaze. She spoke casually. “I’m fine with it.”","“Okay, Chen Zhu will show you around. If you face any problems, you can ask him or me.”","The cars heading to the Ninth Branch were parked outside.","After leaving the airport, everyone got on the bus in turns.","Chen Zhu, Qiao Nian, and Gu San got in a car because it had been decided that Chen Zhu would show her around the next few days.","The others boarded a separate car.","The cars were headed towards the Ninth Branch.","Along the way, Chen Zhu dutifully introduced the Ninth Branch to her.","Qiao Nian didn’t sleep well. Even if she managed to sleep for three hours on the plane, she only slept less than five hours in total. According to her original plan, she was going to take a break on the way to the Ninth Branch. She wanted to close her eyes and recuperate or play with her cell phone.","At this moment, because Chen Zhu was in the same car with them, she was forced to listen to him talk about the Ninth Branch.","“Miss Qiao, the Ninth Branch is divided into two regions. One of them is the research institute, which is mainly responsible for technology development and management. The other is an intelligence agency, which is mainly responsible for intelligence gathering.","“Master Cheng is a master in the field of biotechnology. He belongs to the research institute. We will also be staying at the research institute this time.","“The research side has more rules. Basically, we are not allowed to go out after nine o’clock in the evening. There’s also access control for entering and exiting the premises. Do you know about biometric technology? The access control here basically uses iris acquisition technology, relying on a person’s iris to enter and exit. This technology is currently one of the most high-end access control technologies in the world. It’s also the first technology developed and adopted by the Ninth Branch. Speaking of which, Team Leader Zhou was involved in the research of this technology. It was the first achievement made by Team Leader Zhou after she entered the Ninth Branch.”","Qiao Nian listened to him as though he was an electronic expert, familiar with all kinds of popular technology. She nestled in a position feeling very annoyed.. She took out her earphones and was about to put them on."]},{"number":714,"title":"Chapter 714 - hanting to Sister Nian as Though He Was a Monk Reciting the Scriptures","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","However, when she saw that his eyes were full of sincerity and that he purely wanted to show her around the Ninth Branch, she put down her earphones irritably.","Accepting her fate, she continued to listen to him talk about his popular technology. Meanwhile, trying to hide the depression in her eyes, she turned on her cell phone.","As soon as the cell phone was turned on, she received several messages.","Trying to make herself less irritated by imagining there was just an extra monk at her side, she opened the messages.","The first message was from Chen Yuan. [Sister Nian, have you arrived in Beijing? Remember to let me know when you will be coming back.]","Remembering that Aunt Chen had brought back a hen from her hometown, Qiao Nian’s mood lifted a little. The corners of her mouth raised slightly. Her black eyes were clear as her slender white fingers clicked on the screen to reply to his message.","After replying to Chen Yuan’s message, she took a look at the other messages.","They were from Shen Hui and Liang Bowen, as well as Shen Qingqing. They were basically asking if she had left and were just updating her on the school assignments.","Liang Bowen’s message was the most exaggerated. His message consisted of many emojis that said, “Thank you, big boss.”","In addition, there was also a message from Nie Mi.","She sent Nie Mi a message last night, telling him that she might not be able to attend the music exchange meeting.","Nie Mi didn’t reply to her last night and only sent her a reply today.","She looked at the time Nie Mi replied to her message. 9:30 AM. At that time, she was on the plane, and her cell phone was turned off. She didn’t see it. After getting off the plane, she had to call someone, and then she met with Bo Jingxing and his party. She didn’t have time to read his message.","She only saw his message now.","[Nie: It’s okay if you are busy. It’s okay if you can’t come. If you aren’t going, I won’t be going either. I will let the organizer know.]","[Nie: By the way, you better not stand me up regarding Qing University. I have already prepared the lessons for my class. I’m just waiting for you to enroll. You better not sell me out.]","Qiao Nian looked at his consecutive messages and couldn’t help but smile. She squinted a little and replied to him casually.","[QN: Okay.]","She had already replied to several messages, but when she lifted her head, she found out that someone was still talking about the situation in the Ninth Branch.","Qiao Nian temples started to throb fiercely.","She was speechless.","She wanted to get off immediately!","The atmosphere in the other car was tense.","As soon as everyone boarded the car.","Zhou Wei saw a laptop in the car and did not waste any time. She directly said to Luo Qing, “Team Leader Luo, Miss Qiao gave you the USB, right? There’s a laptop here. How about you take a look at the contents of the USB first?”","Luo Qing frowned and he hesitated. “There’s no need to be so anxious.”","“You’re planning to see it, anyway. If you don’t take a look now, you will still need to take a look once we go back to the Ninth Branch. Since there’s a laptop here, you can take this opportunity to take a look first.”","She didn’t believe that Qiao Nian was really capable of solving the problem in the source code.","Besides the driver, a few people from the Ninth Branch were also in the car. They spoke in turn. “I want to see it, too.”","“Team Leader Luo, did Miss Qiao really solve the problem in the source code for the unmanned driving system in just one day?”","“If the source code for the unmanned driving system is really on the USB, I want to see it too.”","Luo Qing didn’t say anything. He knew that even though they said that they were curious, they were actually skeptical and did not believe that Qiao Nian would be able to solve the problem in the source code.","He was more inclined to believe in Qiao Nian’s solution. After all, he had seen how she managed to reverse the situation regarding the hackers. She even managed to hack all the opponent’s computers.","“Do you guys really want to see it?” Luo Qing asked with a serious expression, wanting to give them one more chance to save themselves from embarrassment."]},{"number":715,"title":"Chapter 715 - Your Sister Nian","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Zhou Wei raised her chin proudly, unable to understand his kind gesture. “Let us take a look. Miss Qiao said that she has solved our problem. I want to see how she managed to do it. Maybe I can even learn from her.","“After all, no matter how good a person is, there will always be someone better.”","Although the words she used were meant to signify good things, she was being ironic.","Luo Qing didn’t bother to reject her anymore. He stretched out his hand and said, “Okay, you can take a look for yourself. Give me the laptop. I will check the USB first.”","Zhou Wei handed him the laptop.","They were in the car, so she wasn’t worried that Luo Qing would deliberately do something to help Qiao Nian.","Luo Qing took the laptop from her and turned it on in front of everyone.","The laptops provided by the Ninth Branch were of high quality. Even this rather low-end laptop booted up very quickly. The configurations were still better than the high-end laptops that could be bought in stores.","The laptop turned on smoothly.","Before Luo Qing plugged in the USB flash drive, he raised his head and looked at the few people in the car. He said, “Just now, when Young Master Bo asked if anyone would like to show Miss Qiao around for the next few days, none of you wanted to. You all said that you were busy, so I didn’t bother to tell you all anything. Although I don’t know if Miss Qiao is able to cure Master Cheng’s headache, I’m still amazed by her! You guys will realize what kind of opportunities you have missed in the future.”","Who else could have gotten first place in the joint examination for Qing University?","Although he wasn’t close to Qiao Nian, he was still convinced that she was capable after seeing her capabilities. Furthermore, Gu San was someone who worked closely with Master Wang.","Gu San was amazed by Miss Qiao based on her ability and not on Master Wang’s account.","It could be said that he respected her!","He believed that the girl had a unique ability that surpassed ordinary people, seeing that Gu San would respect a girl who was younger than him from the bottom of his heart.","The people from the Ninth Branch looked at each other but did not say anything.","They were on Zhou Wei’s side.","They didn’t believe that Qiao Nian could solve their problem.","“Team Leader Luo, you don’t have to say so much. Please just open the source code first. The facts will prove everything! If she can really solve the problem that has plagued our second group for three months, needless to say, I will also apologize to her for my previous attitude. But if she’s just pretending, hahaha...”","Zhou Wei didn’t finish her sentence, but everyone knew what she wanted to say.","Luo Qing looked at her deeply. Seeing Zhou Wei’s proud posture with no regret, he remembered that he had also challenged Qiao Nian before. He said that he would swallow the laptop in front of her. She was in the same situation as him!","He decided not to waste any more words on them and simply said, “Okay, you said it yourself. If Miss Qiao really provided us with a solution, you will apologize to her.”","“She must provide us with the solution first!” Zhou Wei had a proud and confident expression on her face.","Luo Qing turned his gaze away from her and focussed on the laptop. He opened the archive stored on the USB flash drive and clicked on it.","Everyone leaned over and stared at the screen intently.","The screen started to go black, and there was no response for several seconds. It was as if the laptop crashed.","A proud look appeared on Zhou Wei’s face, as though she had known that this would happen. The corners of her mouth started to lift up...","At this moment, the black screen began to run the program. Several lines of code popped up, followed by a verification system.","Someone showed a surprised expression and exclaimed, “Oh my god! Is this iris recognition?”"]},{"number":716,"title":"Chapter 716 - It Seemed as Though It Was Really Not an Iris Recognition System","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Luo Qing looked at the verification screen that appeared on the screen. It began to scan his face. He was stunned for a moment but did not react. It seemed as though he was dazzled.","This...","Was iris recognition not Zhou Wei’s proudest research achievement?","This technology was only available to a few people. How could the USB flash drive that Miss Qiao gave him contain the iris recognition software?","“Could this be a mistake?” He wasn’t sure, but this looked very similar to Zhou Wei’s iris recognition software.","Zhou Wei’s expression became ugly after she saw the screen. She reached out for Luo Qing’s laptop across several people and said, “Let me take a look.”","What iris recognition? She couldn’t believe it!","How could ordinary people have gotten their hands on the iris recognition technology?","Luo Qing didn’t react as she took the laptop from him. He was also stunned and was trying to figure out the situation.","He watched Zhou Wei grab the laptop and put it on her lap. She tapped the keyboard quickly.","The laptop beeped.","Many lines of code started to appear continuously on the screen.","Everyone in the Ninth Branch knew what she was trying to do.","She was trying to break through the verification system.","Not only did she fail to close the iris recognition, because of the code she ran, but warning letters also started to pop out on the screen.","The operation had failed!","Zhou Wei’s face became darker and darker, and she pursed the corners of her mouth tightly. Not believing that she had failed, she tried once again to unlock the verification system.","This time she paid special attention to whether there was an error in the code she entered.","When she entered the last line of code, she checked it again and clicked the button.","She was done!","Various characters started flashing quickly on the screen. Everyone held their breath. They thought that she had succeeded this time.","“Beep beep!” However, the laptop beeped twice to warn them again.","Zhou Wei had failed again!","Everyone in the car was silent.","Seeing that Zhou Wei wasn’t able to unlock the verification system that Qiao Nian had left on the USB twice in a row, Luo Qing took back the laptop and said in a deep voice, “Let me take a look. This may not be iris recognition.”","The rainbow-colored light on the screen was still flashing and was obviously still scanning.","What was this technology if it was not iris recognition?","Zhou Wei pursed the corners of her mouth tightly. Her complexion turned blue, and her expression was terribly unpleasant.","She couldn’t unlock the verification system by herself, so she could only let Luo Qing try.","Luo Qing specialized in software development, so he had no idea how to decipher the system. He wasn’t able to get down to work and try to unlock the verification system immediately as Zhou Wei did.","He could only start from the most basic steps and check what kind of a system this was.","He wouldn’t know if he didn’t see it. However, he would get a shock once he found out!","After Luo Qing checked it, he raised his head with a slight change in expression. He then spoke to Zhou Wei. “This system doesn’t really seem like our iris recognition technology.”","Zhou Wei had been feeling very stuffy since the beginning. When she heard this, she immediately sneered. “If this isn’t our iris recognition technology, what exactly is it? It’s obviously my iris recognition technology!”","She didn’t know where Qiao Nian got the source code for the iris recognition system. However, she could recognize that the verification system on the USB was her iris recognition technology!","Zhou Wei couldn’t understand why she was unable to unlock the system just now.","According to her design, she had entered the code to uninstall the system. She should have been able to uninstall the system successfully. She was unable to figure out what went wrong.","All she saw was that after Luo Qing heard her words, he buried his head back into the laptop and tapped on the keyboard a few more times.. He then raised his head solemnly with a stiff face. He said, “Team Leader Zhou, the verification system put on this USB by Miss Qiao is really not an iris recognition system...”"]},{"number":717,"title":"Chapter 717 - A System Superior to the Iris Recognition Technology","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Zhou Wei furrowed her brows, still not believing it.","Luo Qing was typing away on the keyboard and showing it to her. “Look, the iris recognition technology actually has a source code that can be uninstalled. Hers doesn’t have one. The system Miss Qiao installed into the USB doesn’t have that feature. The only way to get through without verification is to destroy the entire USB. In other words, there’s no way to get to the information in the USB...”","This implied that Qiao Nian’s system was better than hers!","Zhou Wei could no longer hold her expression. She bit her lip with a gloomy face and said proudly, “You said hers isn’t the iris recognition technology, so what is it? I have never heard of a more sophisticated verification system than iris recognition!”","Luo Qing didn’t want to leave her without an out, but when it came to this position, he still reminded her seriously, “Actually, there is one... Leader Zhou, have you forgotten?”","Zhou Wei’s iris recognition was indeed the greatest research achievement in the public verification system.","But, in fact, there was a system in their industry that was stronger than Zhou Wei’s!","Zhou Wei didn’t think of it at that moment. Stunned, she turned to look at him. “What did you say? What system is more powerful than iris recognition?”","So many of the Ninth Branch members were here.","Luo Qing didn’t want to say it initially. He hesitated for half a second and then spit out a name. “You forgot, Sun from the Red Alliance demonstrated a verification system three years ago, similar to the iris recognition technology, but even more complex. The iris recognition only identifies the human eye.","“In addition to recognizing human eyeballs, the one from Sun also involves skulls and sound waves and even added heart rate recognition... When this verification system appeared, the IT world was shocked. Many people privately called it the strongest anti-theft system!”","Zhou Wei was also someone who did computing, how could she have never heard of this system that the Red Alliance released three years ago...","She remembered that when she came up with the iris recognition technology all those years back, she had also been inspired by this strongest technology from Sun.","But she had limited ability.","There had always been a huge flaw in iris recognition, which was the problem that Luo Qing just mentioned—the iris recognition system could actually be cracked!","As long as the vulnerability of the source code was cracked, the iris recognition system could be unlocked.","Of course, this could only be done by top hackers!","Ordinary people couldn’t achieve it.","But her third uncle said that Sun’s system did not have this problem, and hence, Sun’s system was superior.","Either one passed the verification, or everything would be destroyed!","There was no other way that one could unlock the system without passing verification.","The same was true for the system Qiao Nian set up on this USB. She just tried it and couldn’t solve it!","She used the source code vulnerability of the iris recognition system she developed to deprogram twice in a row, but it didn’t work.","Zhou Wei’s expression was unpredictable, and her heart was already tense. She was still reluctant to believe the possibility that Luo Qing proposed.","“You mean hers is the verification technology that Sun from the Red Alliance showed once? How is it possible...”","“I thought it was impossible at first.”","Luo Qing shook his head, looking confused. He tried again, but the result was the same. He let out a sigh of relief. He leaned back and said to Zhou Wei with an incredible but convinced expression, “This is really not an iris recognition system. I’ve looked at it.. It’s not as complicated as the system that Sun created, but the principle is similar, and it doesn’t have any source code loopholes.”"]},{"number":718,"title":"Chapter 718 - How could she be compared to Sun","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","However, this system was the same as the system shown by Sun at the beginning. It did not have any source code loopholes!","Zhou Wei was shocked as her body swayed. Her face full of disbelief.","“She and Sun...”","She wanted to ask how could Qiao Nian be compared to Sun from the Red Alliance?","Her third uncle was so powerful, but he still was not able to enter the Red Alliance. Sun was not only the leader of the Red Alliance, but also recognized by the entire hacker community as an insurmountable leader.","How old was Qiao Nian?","And she’s only 18.","She had not even graduated from high school.","How could she be compared to Sun! Luo Qing was exaggerating!","Luo Qing couldn’t hide his excitement. He took out his cell phone and sent a voice message to Gu San. “Gu San, can you help me ask Miss Qiao how to solve the password of the USB she gave me?”","In the few minutes that they waited for the reply, the car was quiet, and only time ticked forward.","Finally, Luo Qing’s cell phone rang.","Gu San was calling.","Luo Qing hurriedly answered the phone and was the first to say “hello”.","Gu San was still angry about what happened with Zhou Wei just now, and said in a cold tone, “I asked Miss Qiao, and Miss Qiao said that she forgot to set it up. She asked you to wait a moment, she’ll enter your information on her cell phone.”","Luo Qing was very surprised.","Damn, that system could be remotely operated with a cell phone?","What level of Boss was this?!","The rest of the Ninth Branch members were also stunned...","Didn’t they say that she was just a high school student who wasn’t too capable? That she was an ordinary girl who boasted but did not have real skills?","Before Luo Qing could find his voice, he heard Gu San’s voice on the other end of the phone, “Okay, can you try it now?”","“It’s done?” Luo Qing’s throat tightened. It had only been a minute.","He was unsure if it was really done, and could not figure out where Qiao Nian would have gotten his information from.","He tapped the keyboard of the laptop with one hand and re-authenticated.","With a beep, a green light lit up on the screen, and under everyone’s attention, the lock on the screen was unlocked.","“How is it, have you unlocked it yet?” The man’s voice on the other end of the phone came again.","This time it was deadly quiet in the car.","Only Luo Qing calmed down a little. The skin on his rough face twitched, and his voice was hoarse as he said, “It’s done, say thank you to Miss Qiao for me.”","“Mm.”","The call ended.","He slowly put down the phone, raised his head and glanced in Zhou Wei’s direction, wanting to ask if she really wanted to continue watching.","But Zhou Wei didn’t seem to have any reaction. He did not know if she was staring blankly or something else, but her expression was extremely awful, and she didn’t even look at him.","He couldn’t say anything, so he simply opened the USB file in front of everyone.","A complete automated operating system appeared in front of everyone.","From the model display to the subsequent programming code, all were perfectly presented in front of the large group of people.","No loopholes!","No source code issues!","Zhou Wei’s face really hurt now, she opened her mouth, but her voice seemed to be stuck, and she couldn’t say a word.","Her hands clenched into fists. She unclenched them then tensed up again.","It went on for several times.","Luo Qing looked shocked to see what was in the USB drive. He looked up at Zhou Wei quietly and then said succinctly, “Leader Zhou, don’t forget what you said previously.”","Zhou Wei had openly declared that if Qiao Nian had the ability to solve the problem of the automated system source code, she would sincerely apologize to Qiao Nian for her attitude towards her."]},{"number":719,"title":"Chapter 719 - Regret, Very Much Regret","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Zhou Wei’s face was ashen for a moment, but so many people from the Ninth Branch had been present when she said it. Nobody had forced her to it.","She took a deep breath. Although she was annoyed that Luo Qing didn’t give her face, she could push through and say with a cold face: “I know, I will apologize, you don’t need to remind me!”","The rest of them were more focused on the system that was running on the USB drive.","“This... is this the completed automated operating system?”","“Miss Qiao really did the source code fix in one day?”","“Damn, this is brilliant!”","Someone accidentally said, “Leader Zhou and the others haven’t solved this problem for three months, and she solved it in just one day, doesn’t it mean...”","“Watch yourself.” The people around him responded quickly, pulling him and telling him to stop talking.","But Zhou Wei heard it clearly.","He wanted to say, “Doesn’t it mean that Qiao Nian is better than her?”","Zhou Wei was so angry that all the blood in her body seemed to be flowing in the opposite direction. Her face was hot and painful.","But there was one more person whose face hurt more than hers. It was Wang Jian!","He was also one of the IT members of theirs.","Originally, Bo Jingxing got him to accompany Qiao Nian to visit the Ninth Branch while she was here and to serve as a tour guide for Qiao Nian. But he thought that Qiao Nian looked like a young and delicate girl, so he refused without thinking.","When Chen Zhu stood up to replace him, he felt that he had gotten lucky as he thought that he would no longer have to be dragged to accompany ‘the princess’. But now, he realized that Qiao Nian was not an ignorant high school student at all. She was a big boss!","“Seriously, Chen Zhu is really lucky!”","But someone was still mentioning Chen Zhu at this time, with an envious tone of voice. “I should have raised my hand when Young Master Bo asked. If I can follow Miss Qiao for a few days, I might learn a little more and benefit a lot from her.”","“Hehe, I was telling you this just now, and I said that you will regret it later. You were still stubborn with me, thinking you wouldn’t regret it.” Luo Qing watched the fun.","Several people from the Ninth Branch really regretted it at this moment!","Someone whispered, “How was I to know that Miss Qiao was so powerful at that time? I saw that she was a high school student, and she was so young, I thought...”","“You thought she wasn’t capable?” Luo Qing looked at him. “When was ability ever related to age?”","All the Ninth Branch members went silent.","Who would have known? They regretted it now, they really did!","Luo Qing was just like them at the beginning, but now, he was acting like he knew it all since the start. He then added slowly, “Oh right, I forgot to tell you guys. You know about the Qing University joint examinations?”","Everyone who entered the Ninth Branch was a talent with a good background, just like Zhou Wei who came from a top school.","“I know.” Someone asked him in response, “Leader Luo, what’s with the Qing University examinations?”","Why did he suddenly bring it up?","Only Zhou Wei knew why he mentioned the Qing University joint entrance examinations, and her eyes became more hazy.","As expected.","Luo Qing smiled and said, “Miss Qiao is the top scorer in the Qing University entrance examination this year.”","“Do you know how many points she scored?”","As soon as he mentioned that she was the top scorer, several people in the Ninth Branch regretted further. At this moment, they didn’t even want to say a word. They shook their heads weakly, waiting for the storm to come more violently.","Luo Qing brought a tornado directly to them!","“Full marks, 650 points!”","“...”","Wang Jian practically choked!"]},{"number":720,"title":"Chapter 720 - At the Ninth Branch","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","The black sedan stopped outside the Ninth Branch.","“We’re here, Young Master Bo.”","Bo Jingxing looked at the scenery outside the car window. A white research institute stood there quietly. When he turned around, he saw that Chen Zhu was still there to popularize the iris recognition technology.","Raising his hand and pressing on his temple, he smiled and said to the girl who was playing with her cell phone, “Sister Qiao, the Ninth Branch is here.”","“...Iris recognition technology is not only used in access control. I heard that this technology has been used on computers and mobile phones. In the future, our mobile phones will not need fingerprint verification when they are turned on, and only need to be pointed at the eyes for a few seconds to unlock. ”","Chen Zhu was still talking to Qiao Nian about how awesome the iris technology was!","How amazing was Zhou Wei to have come up with this research!","Qiao Nian rubbed her earlobes. She had listened to him go on for a long while now. At this point, she put away her phone, looked past him at Bo Jingxing and asked, “We’re arrived?”","“Mm, arrived.”","Bo Jingxing could also hear Chen Zhu’s chatter along the way, but he didn’t stop it, because the emergence of iris recognition technology could make up for the Ninth Branch’s incompetencies in the hacking field, and it was also an achievement that the Ninth Branch deserved to show off.","He smiled at Qiao Nian and asked, “Want to go down and have a look?”","Qiao Nian could not be happier to open the car door and get off.","The fresh air outside the car was blowing, and Qiao Nian felt that the ears were finally clear. Even the tension in her temple eased.","Ah, liberation!","The car that Zhou Wei and Luo Qing were riding in followed them all the way. When they arrived, the black car behind them stopped.","Luo Qing got out of the car first and greeted Qiao Nian, “Miss Qiao.”","The weather in Beijing in December was much colder than that in the surrounding city. Qiao Nian was only wearing a hoodie and a thin cardigan jacket, which made her feel a little cold. She lazily pulled up her hoodie, her black eyes looking at the big man. She nodded as a form of acknowledgement and response.","Luo Qing was truly in admiration of her!","He was not bothered by Qiao Nian’s casual and distant attitude, knowing that she was usually rather cold to people she was not close with. He walked over with a huge smile and said to her, “Miss Qiao, we just looked through the USB drive in the car. I am very curious, how did you solve the problem of the source code?”","There was an error in the source code of the automated system. Zhou Wei in the second group had been unable to solve this problem. She once asked Liao Xu from their group for help.","He was also present at the time. He had seen Zhou Wei’s source code error and tried to work on it himself, but the effect was not good and the loophole could not be managed.","He really couldn’t understand Qiao Nian, a young girl who had never systematically studied computing anywhere, could be so good!","Qiao Nian lifted her eyes, just in time to see Zhou Wei get out of the car with a long face and walk over here.","She raised her eyebrows expressionlessly and replied casually: “I didn’t really solve it, I just took a look, maybe it’s luck.”","She refused to say it, and Luo Qing couldn’t hide his disappointment. He said, “Miss Qiao, you are too modest. Programming does not depend on luck, it only depends on personal capability. I’m truly in admiration of you. In the future, if you need any help, just come to me and I’ll help you out as much as I can.”","“Anyway, I owed you a favor last time. You didn’t make me swallow the computer. I’m too embarrassed to play stupid with you and acting like I forgot about it...” He smiled and touched the back of his head. He was very sincere.. “Miss Qiao , I have to say sorry to you about what happened before, I’m very sorry.”"]},{"number":721,"title":"Chapter 721 - Zhou Wei’s Apology","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Qiao Nian had helped their group. She had intercepted the opponent’s attack on the Ninth Branch and also helped to destroy the stolen chips.","However, he still held a suspicious attitude towards Qiao Nian and even warned Master Wang to conduct a detailed check on Miss Qiao’s background.","Regarding this problem, it was not completely his fault from his point of view.","Not long after that, Miss Qiao even helped the Ninth Branch to solve the problem they were facing with the unmanned system.","Furthermore, she was going to attend to Master Cheng.","To be reasonable, his previous approach seemed a little overboard!","Luo Qing always bragged that he would always uphold his promises. Although it was embarrassing for an adult to be apologizing to a young girl in front of so many people, his apology was still very sincere. “In short, if you ever face a problem where I can be of help, just let me know. I owe you a favor.”","Qiao Nian raised her eyes and looked at him. Her black and bright eyes were clear, and an air of vigor could be felt around her. “I remember Team Leader Luo saying something about treating me to dinner. Are you planning on going back on your words?”","Luo Qing said, “I will definitely treat you! I will definitely keep my word. I will buy you a meal whenever you are free. You can decide on a place in Beijing. You don’t need to hold back!”","Qiao Nian started to laugh. Her appearance was quite eye-catching. “Then it’s all okay. I didn’t help out in vain. We’ll call it even if you treat me to dinner. We don’t owe each other anything anymore.”","Luo Qing was speechless for a while.","The problem that Qiao Nian had helped to solve was worth a thousand meals. Her generosity and forgiving attitude made her contributions even more precious.","“That’s fine.” Luo Qing wasn’t a hypocritical person. He silently kept this favor in his heart. On a more serious note, he turned his head and looked at Zhou Wei and her group who had already walked by. He spoke directly and reminded Zhou Wei succinctly. “By the way, Team Leader Zhou, if you have anything to say to Miss Qiao, you can tell her now.”","Gu San frowned when he saw Zhou Wei. She was very annoying. He was afraid she would bother Qiao Nian again. He was just about to stop her.","Unexpectedly, Zhou Wei walked forward and glanced at Qiao Nian. The expression on her face looked very forced. She pursed the corners of her mouth and reluctantly said, “Miss Qiao, I’m very sorry for the attitude I have shown you at the airport.”","Bo Jingxing, Gu San, and Chen Zhu were all stunned for a moment.","They couldn’t figure out what she was thinking.","Zhou Wei didn’t have such an attitude before they boarded separate cars at the airport.","At that time, she was still unconvinced by Qiao Nian’s abilities and was picking on her. Why did she suddenly apologize to Qiao Nian right after she got out of the car?","“I had a bad attitude before, but I will pay attention to it in the future.” Zhou Wei looked very humiliated as she spoke. Her eyelashes were lowered and she didn’t even look Qiao Nian in the face.","It was obvious how reluctant she was to apologize.","Luo Qing could only pressure Zhou Wei into apologizing to Qiao Nian. He couldn’t control what she truly felt in her heart. He sighed helplessly and did not bother to say anything else.","In any case, he believed in Miss Qiao’s abilities. He couldn’t help it even if Zhou Wei wasn’t convinced. He only hoped she wouldn’t go against Miss Qiao too much and humiliate herself in the process.","“You don’t have to apologize to me. I’m very busy, and we probably won’t have any more chances to interact in the future.” The girl’s voice was low and arrogant!","Zhou Wei raised her head as she heard the girl’s voice. It sounded very casual.. “I won’t be free from now on, anyways.”"]},{"number":722,"title":"Chapter 722 - She Took a Loss This Time","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","She helped this time on Ye Wangchuan’s account. She would be very busy in the future.","The air felt very tense for a full minute.","When Zhou Wei finally took in what she said, her face darkened and she clenched her fists.","Bo Jingxing coughed and smiled. To break the deadlock, he raised his eyes and said, “Sister Qiao, I will bring you to see Master Cheng.”","He wasn’t sure why Zhou Wei suddenly apologized to Qiao Nian. However, it was obvious that she had suffered a loss this time around!","Jiang Li’s sister was such a tough girl!","No wonder Qin Si liked her.","She could be described in a word—cool!","Her style of acting and talking was very cool.","“Okay,” Qiao Nian replied to him. She had one hand in her pocket, and the other pulled down her cap. Her figure was beautiful.","She left Zhou Wei standing there stunned, unable to react for a long time.","The Ninth Branch had a strict access control system.","After passing through the iris recognition system, they still had to pass through the door with fingerprint verification before they could enter the main building.","As soon as they entered the main building, they could feel a tense atmosphere. It was completely different from the atmosphere outside.","The people inside wore white uniforms and held various data-related books. They were busy with their own affairs.","Even when they came in as a large group, the people inside did not seem to notice them. They didn’t look in their direction and did not even raise their heads.","Bo Jingxing led them all the way to a glass laboratory and stopped. He said, “Sister Qiao, please wait a moment. I’ll let Master Cheng know you are here.”","“Okay.” Qiao Nian found a place to sit down. She took out her cell phone and did not bother to look around.","Chen Zhu leaned over and saw her playing a game.","He couldn’t help it and said, “Miss Qiao, aren’t you curious?”","As soon as she entered the game, she received an invitation from Qin Si. Rejecting it, she asked without even lifting her head, “What am I supposed to be curious about?”","“Just curious...” Chen Zhu looked at her silent face and hesitated. “Curious about the Ninth Branch.”","Was Miss Qiao really not curious about the Ninth Branch at all?","The Ninth Branch was considered a unique existence even among the influential families in Beijing. Many people had tried to peek into its internal affairs. Many people were also eager to possess the cutting-edge technology and intelligence developed by the Ninth Branch.","But Miss Qiao didn’t seem to be interested at all.","Qiao Nian listened to him patiently. She then half squinted her eyes and replied lazily. “Oh, I’m not curious.”","Chen Zhu was speechless.","He was stunned for a moment.","He originally thought that if Qiao Nian was curious, he could continue to tell her about their research results, such as their iris recognition technology.","But he was at a sudden loss for words at this result.","Gu San didn’t care about him. He took out a bottle of coffee from the cupboard beside him, handed it to Qiao Nian, and whispered, “The Ninth Branch only has coffee. Please compromise and drink some.”","He had followed Master Wang and Qiao Nian for such a long time that he was already familiar with her preferences. Qiao Nian preferred drinks like mineral water and lemonade as compared to coffee and milk tea.","However, the research institute was full of people who stayed up late to engage in scientific research. They were usually busy, and it was normal for them to miss a day of sleep.","They all relied on coffee to refresh their minds.","Therefore, it was easier to find coffee than mineral water here.","Qiao Nian wasn’t picky about what she drank. She took the bottle from him and politely said, “Thank you.”","Gu San’s heart warmed up a little, and his initially tight expression slightly relaxed.. He smiled and said, “You’re welcome.”"]},{"number":723,"title":"Chapter 723 - My Laboratory Was Lacking Manpower","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Then, he thought for a while and said seriously, “Miss Qiao, when you attend to Master Cheng later, please help treat him if you can. However, if you can’t, please don’t blame yourself.”","He pursed the corners of his lips and said, “Master Cheng’s chronic illness has been affecting him for a long time. Experts at home and abroad have tried to help him relieve the symptoms, but they all failed. Although Master Wang asked you to come and take a look, he’s not forcing you to help Master Cheng.”","Chen Zhu was sitting beside him. He wanted to tell him that Master Cheng was still part of the Ninth Branch and to not just side with outsiders so easily.","However, he didn’t say anything when he looked at the girl with her beautiful eyebrows.","He was still skeptical about the girl’s ability. He didn’t believe that she would be able to cure Master Cheng’s illness.","Master Cheng’s migraine was considered a chronic illness. It wasn’t easy to cure. If it was so easy, it would have been cured long ago.","In the past few years, Master Cheng had consulted many doctors.","He had even consulted Liang Lu and taken her prescription. However, there was no improvement. In fact, it seemed as though his condition had started to worsen.","Qiao Nian simply looked too young to be able to help cure his illness.","Bo Jingxing didn’t waste time. He opened the door to the laboratory shortly.","An old man in a white coat and wearing a pair of flip-flops walked out of the laboratory.","“I heard someone is looking for me?”","It didn’t seem like he had rested well. Although there was a tone of exhaustion in his voice, it was very gentle. He even joked with Bo Jingxing with a smile on his face.","“You wouldn’t have come to me if you didn’t have a problem. Do you have something to tell me?”","Bo Jingxing put his hands into his coat pockets. Although he wasn’t as eye-catching as Ye Wangchuan, he still looked handsome. His appearance could be considered to be gentle and handsome.","“I have something to tell you.”","However, before he could finish speaking.","Master Cheng noticed the group of people gathered outside. In addition to Luo Qing, Zhou Wei, and the other familiar faces from the various Ninth Branch departments, he also noticed a girl.","She looked very young.","She was wearing a baseball cap and a black hoodie. She was leaning carelessly on a chair holding her cell phone. She looked like she was playing a game, and she didn’t even notice him walking out.","Her side profile peeking out from under the cap looked very exquisite and eye-catching.","The vibe she gave off was rather casual, and no annoyance could be felt from her.","This was the first time he had seen such a young face in the Ninth Branch. He was startled. He pointed at Qiao Nian and asked Bo Jingxing curiously, “Is she one of this year’s new recruits?”","He remembered that the institute recruited a group of new people this year, but he was too busy to care. He was usually busy doing experiments and did not have the time to care about the new recruits.","The Ninth Branch was a secure facility, and outsiders were generally not allowed inside.","Seeing Qiao Nian walking around with Bo Jingxing, he assumed that she was recruited into the institute. This piqued his interest. He glanced at the girl, turned his head, and asked, “What major did this girl study? Could it be bioengineering? There’s a lack of manpower in my laboratory.”","Zhou Wei’s expression darkened.","Master Cheng was one of the Ninth Branch’s pillars.","Not anyone could enter his laboratory.","How could he have taken an interest in Qiao Nian from just a glance and even took the initiative to invite her into his laboratory? Even if Qiao Nian were to enter the laboratory, she would only be responsible for the trivial stuff. She wouldn’t be allowed to start and contribute to the main project, anyways.","However, it was a great honor to enter the laboratory of someone like Master Cheng. Who in China would give up on this opportunity?","The girl had just finished playing her game. Raising her head and noticing that someone had walked out, her dry eyes narrowed slightly.","Seeing the kind old man standing there, she put down her cell phone, stood up, and replied politely, “I’m majoring in Chinese Medicine.”"]},{"number":724,"title":"Chapter 724 - Was She Really Proficient in Chinese Medicine?","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","“Chinese Medicine?” Master Cheng was taken aback. He didn’t expect that. Putting his hand on his head, he turned around and said to Bo Jingxing, “I didn’t know there was a department of Chinese Medicine in the Ninth Branch. When did this happen?”","Bo Jingxing looked at him thoughtfully and smiled helplessly. He then walked over and explained, “No, there are no Chinese medicine laboratories in the Ninth Branch.”","“Then, what’s this girl saying about studying Chinese Medicine?” Master Cheng was still in favor of Qiao Nian and shook his head regretfully.","The girl looked like she was capable. She didn’t have the impetuosity of the young people nowadays. She looked very calm.","Bo Jingxing didn’t expect Master Cheng to take interest in Qiao Nian with just a glance. He even invited her to join his laboratory. Smiling helplessly, he said, “She’s the doctor recommended by Wangchuan. She has studied Chinese Medicine. He wants her to take a look at your condition. Maybe she will be able to cure your illness.”","“You said that this young girl is the doctor he found for me?” Master Cheng was extremely surprised. He looked back and forth between Bo Jingxing and the girl standing there upright. He couldn’t help himself and said, “How old is she? She looks very young. Chinese Medicine...”","He personally had no prejudice against Chinese Medicine. Although he had little understanding, he was in his seventies and had heard of Chinese Medicine before.","It was said that the experience of a practitioner was related to his expertise in the field of Chinese Medicine. However, the girl in front of him didn’t even seem old enough to be in college.","Master Cheng took another look at Qiao Nian. The more he looked at her, the more stunned he became. He thought that Bo Jingxing was playing a joke on him. “Are you sure? Did you make a mistake?”","“Miss Qiao is definitely the doctor recommended by Wangchuan.” Bo Jingxing looked at him squarely in the eyes and spoke with absolute certainty.","After saying that, he embarrassedly explained to Qiao Nian, “Sister Qiao, please don’t mind Master Cheng. This is his temperament. He usually stays in the laboratory to do research. He has no other hobbies. He speaks and does things more directly and casually. He may just think that you are too young. He holds no hidden meanings behind his words.”","Qiao Nian looked at the gray-haired old man in front of her. The old man was probably in his seventies. He wasn’t as well maintained as Nie Mi. His hair was neatly combed behind his head. Medium-sized and thin, the Ninth Branch white coat looked a little too big for him.","He was different from Zhou Wei and the others. He wore a sweater under a white coat and a pair of old trousers. Paired with his slippers, he looked slovenly.","However, it could be seen that he had a good personality and was easy-going. He didn’t seem like a very serious person.","She retracted her gaze and nodded. She wasn’t angry. She softly said, “I understand.”","“Then...” Before Bo Jingxing could ask her to take a look at Master Cheng, Qiao Nian took a step forward and spoke to Master Cheng comfortably. “Is it convenient for me to take a look at your pulse?”","As she approached Master Cheng, he was able to clearly see her face under the cap. Her eyebrows and eyes were exquisite and outstanding. Her skin was very fair.","She was a very pretty young girl.","Taken aback for a moment, Master Cheng frowned. He tilted his head innocently and looked at her curiously, saying, “Do you really practice Chinese Medicine?”","Qiao Nian had always been polite towards her elders. Even if Master Cheng’s question was a little abrupt, she patiently nodded. She had black eyes and a casual aura around her. She said, “I have studied it a little.”","Ah!","Zhou Wei’s eyes were cold as she stood at the side. She was hoping that Master Cheng would reject Qiao Nian’s offer and not allow her to attend to him!","However, she was disappointed.","Master Cheng just smiled when he saw the girl’s calm eyes.. He stretched out his hand and asked, “Do I need to sit? I remember watching a Chinese Medicine consultation on the television before, and the patient seemed to be sitting down.”"]},{"number":725,"title":"Chapter 725 - Master Cheng: You Even Know About This?","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","“Either way is okay.”","Whether the patient was standing or sitting had little impact on their pulse.","Qiao Nian narrowed her eyes slightly. She tilted her head and said, “This will take some time. If you are too tired to stand, you can also sit down.”","“Is that so? Then, I will sit down.”","Without much delay, Master Cheng found a place to sit down. He stretched out his left hand, put it on the table, and rolled up his sleeves.","“Miss Qiao, come here.”","“Mm.”","Qiao Nian walked over and sat opposite him. She stretched out two beautiful white fingers and placed them on his wrist. She then lowered her eyelashes and quietly measured his pulse.","Outside the laboratory, everyone was very quiet. Their breathing became tense. No one said that they couldn’t speak during the checking of his pulse. However, no one made a noise.","Gu San was very nervous. After a few minutes, seeing that the girl did not speak, his expression became tenser. He couldn’t help himself and asked, “Miss Qiao, how is Master Cheng’s situation?”","The corners of Zhou Wei’s mouth curled downwards. There was a look of disapproval on her face.","Bo Jingxing and the others from the Ninth Branch were very nervous. They subconsciously looked at the girl who had her eyes closed. She didn’t seem like she was attending to Master Cheng at all.","While they did not fully believe in Qiao Nian’s abilities, they were still hoping that she could cure Master Cheng’s illness.","Qiao Nian changed her posture and used her fingers on her other hand to check his pulse. She waited for another minute before raising her head. Her eyes were black as she looked at the old man and asked, “Have you been suffering from headaches, nausea, and have been vomiting recently?”","“Oh, is that all you found out after so long? A person suffering from migraines would experience similar symptoms.” Zhou Wei was merciless.","Qiao Nian ignored her and continued to check on Master Cheng, who had not recovered from his shock yet. She said, “Your headache is mainly concentrated around the forehead, bifrontal, parietal, occipital, and neck. The nature of the headache is often dull and painful, with a sense of compression and tightness, right?”","A look of surprise appeared on Master Cheng’s face. He looked at her wide-eyed. “How did you know this?”","He had also consulted Liang Lu. However, Liang Lu was a Western Medicine practitioner. She didn’t take his pulse. She listened to him describe the symptoms of his illness first.","After listening to his description, she asked the nurse to conduct some tests on him. After his brain scan came back, she rambled off some technical terms and gave him a prescription. That was all.","Although Liang Lu used a bunch of technical terms, she wasn’t as specific as Qiao Nian.","The ends of Qiao Nian’s eyes raised a little and she smiled. She said, “I know this from taking your pulse.","“Your pulse feels weak and irregular, with frequent changes in pace. Your liver and gallbladder are blocked. Your spleen and stomach are weak. In traditional Chinese Medicine, this kind of pulse pattern is mainly caused by too much moisture and lack of blood and qi in the body. This would be caused by poor rest all year round.”","Master Cheng felt dizzy. He didn’t really understand.","With that, Qiao Nian answered his question. She never thought about popularizing Chinese Medicine such that ordinary people would understand the distinction between pulse signs and traditional Chinese Medicine. She raised her eyebrows and said, “Every time you experience nausea and dizziness, were you working in an environment with a strong light around you?”","Bo Jingxing saw that Master Cheng’s expression became surprised again. Even more stunned, he said, “How do you know all this? Did you also see this from my pulse?”","Qiao Nian retracted her hand and smiled again. Her smile was so casual and eye-catching that the people around her couldn’t take their eyes off her.","Her voice was slow and a little hoarse as she spoke.","“No, it has nothing to do with your pulse this time. I suspect that you are suffering from a headache caused by muscle contractions.. The symptoms of this migraine are aggravated by the stimulation from light and sound.”"]},{"number":726,"title":"Chapter 726 - Driving Zhou Wei Out","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","“...”","Master Cheng was really shocked this time.","He had seen many doctors in the past, but none of them had explained why his migraine would be accompanied by nausea and vomiting.","Liang Lu and the others asked him to check his stomach, suspecting that there was something wrong with it.","Only Qiao Nian said that it was a migraine complication.","“Then I...”","“I’ll give you acupuncture.”","Qiao Nian didn’t say anything else. She opened the zipper of her shoulder bag and took out a small cloth bag. She then unfolded it and saw a row of silver needles used for acupuncture. She took one out and looked at the exhausted old man. “Your condition is not serious, but it has been delayed for too long. You have to receive acupuncture first and take medicine later. Do you want to try?”","Bo Jingxing asked worriedly when he saw her take out a long and thin silver needle, “Sister Qiao, where do you want to insert this needle?”","“Acupuncture points on the head and temples.”","With that, she met a large group of confused eyes and raised her hand to rub her forehead. Recalling that they didn’t know where the acupuncture points were, she thought so she might as well be more specific.","“It’s mainly done in the head and the back of the neck.”","The head and the back of the neck were some of the most fragile parts of the human body.","Bo Jingxing revealed a cautious expression as he looked at Master Cheng and said hesitantly, “Master Cheng, you...”","He wanted to ask, “Do you want to consider it again?”","Unexpectedly, the old man came back to his senses and was much calmer than him. He looked at the girl with a relaxed expression. “Give it a try. Why not?","“What do you need me to do?”","Qiao Nian quite liked his calm and composed attitude. With a sharp gaze, she said, “Just sit down. You don’t have to do anything. As long as you don’t move when you get an injection.”","“Okay. Do it, then. I won’t move.”","Zhou Wei’s face was tense. She was even more nervous than Master Cheng. She looked at the girl and said with a hint of warning, “Qiao Nian, Master Cheng is the best biological master in the country. If you’re not confident, it’s best not to mess around.”","Qiao Nian was quite annoyed by her nagging. Not saying anything else, she turned to the man beside her and requested, “Can you get rid of the unrelated people? I want a quiet environment to give Master Cheng acupuncture.”","Seeing that Master Cheng had agreed to let Qiao Nian try, Bo Jingxing didn’t hesitate any more and instructed Luo Qing, “Go out with Team Leader Zhou first. Chen Zhu and the others can stay.”","Luo Qing originally wanted to stay and watch Qiao Nian perform acupuncture on Master Cheng. However, he didn’t dare to disobey Bo Jingxing. He turned around with a regretful expression and said coldly to Zhou Wei, “Team Leader Zhou, let’s go. We’ll wait outside.”","Zhou Wei’s expression was extremely ugly.","However, when Bo Jingxing’s cold gaze swept over, she didn’t dare to speak nonsense and followed Luo Qing and the others out unwillingly.","...","Outside, the door to the waiting room outside the laboratory was closed.","Zhou Wei pulled a long face since she came out. She leaned against the wall and refused to sit down.","Luo Qing was with the nine others.","There was no response for more than half an hour. Someone couldn’t help but whisper, “Team Leader Luo, do you think Miss Qiao can really treat Master Cheng’s illness with acupuncture?”","“How should I know?” Luo Qing clasped his hands together with a restless expression. It could be seen that he was quite nervous. He frowned and did not dare to confirm. “I think Miss Qiao looked very confident just now.. She should be able to do it. The person Master Wang found must have some skills!”"]},{"number":727,"title":"Chapter 727 - 7: Master Nie’s First and Last Disciple","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","He was completely convinced by Qiao Nian in terms of programming, but he didn’t know anything about her medical skills.","He believed that Qiao Nian’s confidence came from Ye Wangchuan.","Miss Qiao was someone Master Wang had personally asked to treat Master Cheng. She definitely had some skills. Otherwise, why would Master Wang look for Miss Qiao and not others?","The other nine people stopped talking.","However, Zhou Wei snorted disdainfully from the side. “Even Liang Lu can’t treat Master Cheng’s illness. I don’t believe she can treat Master Cheng’s chronic illness with two needles and just a few words.”","“You didn’t believe that Miss Qiao could resolve the loophole in your source code previously, but she did.” She spoke sourly again and again. Luo Qing didn’t stand on ceremony with her anymore and did not give her any face. “You just apologized to Miss Qiao previously about paying attention to your attitude in the future. Team Leader Zhou, since you said that, you have to keep your word.”","“You!” Zhou Wei was furious. All the blood in her body rushed to her head, and her face turned red. She couldn’t find the words to retort.","Luo Qing couldn’t stand watching her continue to talk nonsense here. He didn’t want to quarrel with a woman. After saying that, he turned to talk to the nine others about Qiao Nian.","After the unmanned programming, the other nine people were quite curious about Qiao Nian and asked him a lot about her.","Luo Qing wasn’t considered familiar with Qiao Nian herself. He had only met her a few times through Ye Wangchuan. His understanding of Qiao Nian was only limited to her awesome hacking skills and heaven-defying results. He didn’t know much else.","“I remember that Qing University is going to announce the results for the joint examination today. I’ll go online to check.” Someone was smart. Thinking that today was the day Qing University announced the results, he took out his phone and searched.","The college entrance examination had always been popular.","This year, Qing University held on to their results for a long time and was unwilling to announce them. When they were announced, the results slip was directly hung on the Internet.","He could find it immediately.","The nine people clicked on the results announced by Qing University.","Number 1 was someone named Qiao Nian.","Qiao Nian, 1st place, total score 650. Chinese, 100. Mathematics, 100. English, 100. 350 for Arts and Sciences.","Then, it was the person ranked second.","There was a total of 30 points between his total score and Qiao Nian, who was at the top of the rankings. The difference in scores was too bad, and it looked especially striking.","He scrolled through the rankings and saw a similar name at 19th.","Qiao Chen was ranked 19th, with a total score of 589; 92 for Chinese, 90 for Mathematics, 91 for English, and 316 for Arts and Sciences.","These nine people were all top students from major universities. When they saw Qiao Chen’s results, they did not feel that it was good, but when they saw the name Qiao Chen, they felt that it was similar to Qiao Nian’s, so they took a second look.","They only took one more look before automatically omitting Qiao Chen’s name. They flipped through other things to see if there was any news related to Qiao Nian.","In the end, he really found it.","The joint examination of Qing University was not considered a national examination. The main area was still within the ranks of the top students. However, Qiao Nian’s results were too heaven-defying, and it still attracted a lot of attention.","One of them took out the video of Nie Mi’s birthday party and asked on Weibo, “F*ck, don’t tell me that the heaven-defying genius who came out of Qing University this time is the same person as Master Nie’s last disciple??????!!”","The nine of them were mainly in scientific research, and the others were mainly in charge of intelligence. They knew very little about the outside world. They were also talents from various fields. Like Zhou Wei, they were actually very arrogant and looked down on almost everyone.","However, many people had heard of Nie Mi before."]},{"number":728,"title":"Chapter 728 - You Can Only Swallow It If Its Broken","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","He was completely stunned. He held his phone for a long time before he stiffly turned his head to Luo Qing. He had an expression that was uglier than crying as he said, “Leader Luo... Why didn’t you tell me that Miss Qiao is Master Nie’s last disciple?”","Luo Qing: “???”","“Master Nie?”","He reached out and snatched the phone. “Let me see!”","What the hell would he know? Third Young Master Gu and Master Wang had never said that Miss Qiao knew Master Nie. He was born and raised in Beijing. Of course, he knew that the members of the few big families in Beijing all wanted to be Master Nie’s last disciple. So Master Nie’s last disciple was Miss Qiao????","...","The banquet hall on the third floor of Huanyu Hotel was filled with guests.","Although Wei Ling had said that Qiao Chen wouldn’t be holding the celebratory banquet this time, for the sake of her pride and because the hotel booking couldn’t be canceled at the last minute, she braced herself and invited many friends over.","However, if Wei Ling did not come, no one from the Tang family would come either. The quality of the entire banquet fell greatly.","Although there seemed to be a lot of people, most of them were relatives from the Qiao family. Other than that, there were also some business partners of Qiao Weimin’s.","However, not many people from the latter came.","After all, the rise of the Qiao Corporation in Rao City previously had a lot to do with Cheng Feng Corporation. Later on, Cheng Feng Corporation openly fell out with the Qiao Corporation. After they no longer gave the Qiao Corporation face, most of the Qiao family’s partners took the initiative to lean toward Cheng Feng Corporation and slowly cut ties with the Qiao family...","Even so, the banquet’s atmosphere was strange.","Most of the Qiao family relatives knew about the family’s lousy matters. It was originally a good thing that Qiao Chen got into Qing University, and it was worth celebrating.","However, Qiao Nian, who had been personally chased out by Shen Qiongzhi, was ranked first. Qiao Chen’s 19th place seemed a little ridiculous now.","Especially since Qing University had just announced her results to the public today. When she casually checked the Internet, all she saw was news of Qiao Nian getting first place.","As this kind of result had never been released before they went around the city, when the results were announced in the morning, First High School even specially set off firecrackers to celebrate.","Banners congratulating Qiao Nian on her good results could be seen everywhere on the streets and alleys.","Qiao Chen had also been admitted to Qing University. She was registered as a student at Fifth High School. Although Fifth High School had also put up a banner to celebrate, she, the 19th place, was suppressed so much that she couldn’t even raise her head.","It was clearly a good thing, but Qiao Chen was covered in dirt during the meal. She could feel her relatives and friends looking at her teasingly from time to time.","The gazes were like steel knives, the blades scraping her heart.","Her face was pale the entire time. Halfway through the meal, she pushed the bowl away, forced a smile, and said, “Mom, I’m going to the washroom.”","“You haven’t eaten much.”","Qiao Chen was in no mood to eat when she saw that the gazes of the people at the table were on her. She barely supported her body as she stood up. “I’m full.”","Shen Qiongzhi saw that her expression was bad and patted her hand worriedly. “Go. Come back early.”","“Okay.” Qiao Chen pulled out the chair and didn’t even look back as she walked quickly out of the banquet hall and walked to the railing outside. She finally found a place to relax.","She had just gone outside when Fu Ge followed her out.","“Brother Fu.” Seeing him, Qiao Chen finally forced a smile on her pale face and greeted the boy walking over.","Fu Ge was 1.8 meters tall and had a tall figure, looking quite handsome.","He walked over and looked at the girl who was dressed like a lily. He asked gently, “Why are you out so soon?”"]},{"number":729,"title":"Chapter 729 - Qiao Nian Took a Half-Month Leave","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","“I came out to take a breather.”","As soon as she finished speaking, she saw the words on the hotel’s rolling screen: “Congratulations to our city’s Year Three Class A student, Qiao Nian, for getting into Qing University.” Her smile instantly froze at the corner of her mouth, and her face suddenly turned pale.","Qiao Nian, Qiao Nian, Qiao Nian... Why was Qiao Nian everywhere?!","It was clearly her promotional banquet at the hotel today, but the hotel was rolling out screen to congratulate Qiao Nian for getting into Qing University...","Qiao Chen clenched her fists tightly and endured it with all her might to control her indignant and trembling shoulders.","Fu Ge didn’t see the caption, so he didn’t notice the change in her expression. He stood in front of her and smiled, his face handsome. “Congratulations, Chen Chen. You successfully entered Qing University.”","Qiao Chen returned to her senses and looked up at him with bright eyes. A little touched, she said gently, “Thank you.”","Fu Ge looked at the girl’s fair and delicate side profile and couldn’t help but reach out to rub her hair. When he saw the girl lower her head shyly, he retracted his hand and raised it casually. “By the way, why don’t I see Qiao Nian? She didn’t come?”","Qiao Chen was originally blushing, but when she heard this, her blood turned cold. She bit her lips and looked up with an extremely unnatural expression. “I sent her an invitation...”","She didn’t finish her sentence, but her meaning was obvious.","She had sent an invitation to Qiao Nian, but she did not come.","Fu Ge frowned slightly.","Qiao Chen continued to speak slowly, “I heard from Xu Xu that she went to school to take a leave the day before yesterday. She asked for more than half a month. She might not be in Rao City.”","As expected.","Fu Ge frowned again and said in disbelief, “First High School allowed her to take such a long leave?”","Heh, wasn’t First High School famous for having two standards?","First High School’s forum’s administrator quickly deleted Wu Jie’s post.","When Wu Jie posted her thread, the administrator seemed blind. He allowed the thread to remain on the forum for three days before deleting it.","However, in the face of Fu Ge’s question, she couldn’t possibly tell him about Wu Jie. Therefore, she lowered her eyes and said softly, “She got first place in the joint examination. First High School obviously doesn’t object to treating her like a treasure. I just don’t know where she went.”","However, Fu Ge thought of a place—Beijing.","He took a deep breath and suppressed the complicated feelings in his heart with all his might. Then, he looked at the girl standing there talking to him in disappointment. His eyes softened again as he placed his hand on Qiao Chen’s shoulder and comforted her in a low voice. “Chen Chen, don’t feel too bad. It’s a good thing to get into Qing University...”","Qiao Chen pinched her hands and said, “Yes, I know. I don’t feel bad.”","However, she felt extremely uncomfortable.","That’s true.","It was supposed to be a good thing that she got into Qing University, but now that the streets and alleys were filled with banners congratulating Qiao Nian for getting into Qing University, how many people knew that she got into Qing University too?","Qiao Nian had stolen all the limelight!","Fu Ge: “She... Although her results this time are better than yours, she chose the Chinese Medicine major. You know the situation of this major in Qing University. Only Mr. Huang can speak for this field. Mr. Huang can’t possibly take care of a student, so even if she goes to Qing University in the future, she can’t compare to you.”","Qiao Chen forced herself to calm down. She pursed her lips and grunted, but it was unknown if she heard him.","Fu Ge patted her shoulder again and comforted her silently before changing the topic.. “By the way, the music event will be in a week. Have you prepared the songs?”"]},{"number":730,"title":"Chapter 730 - Master Nie Isn’t Coming to the Music Event This Time","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","At the mention of the music event, Qiao Chen’s dark eyes finally lit up. She looked at him with ambition and smiled, then said humbly, “I’m ready. My aunt said that she helped me contact Mr. Steven. He quite likes my piano music and has already agreed to take me in as his student.”","“Mr. Steven?” Fu Ge couldn’t hide his surprise.","She lowered her head shyly. “Yes. It’s Mr. Steven from the International Piano Association. He knows my aunt. Didn’t he come to my birthday party before? After that, I’ve been in private communication with Mr. Steven and often wrote emails to ask him about the piano. This time, when my aunt told him about me, I didn’t expect him to not reject her and agree to take me in as his disciple.”","Mr. Steven’s attainments in the piano field weren’t inferior to Nie Mi’s attainments in the konghou field. He was also one of the world’s famous hall-level musicians.","Furthermore, he was the vice president of the International Piano Association.","With this title, if Qiao Chen could really become Mr. Steven’s disciple, she wouldn’t be worse than Qiao Nian becoming Nie Mi’s last disciple.","At least in terms of reputation, the two of them were evenly matched!","If Qiao Chen missed Nie Mi, getting Mr. Steven would be the best outcome.","Fu Ge was quite happy for her. His handsome face couldn’t hide his joy as he said, “Congratulations, Chen Chen. Mr. Steven is no worse than Master Nie. He’s also a hall master in the piano field that you’re best at. If you follow him, you’ll still have a chance to enter the international stage in the future. Master Nie is also famous internationally, but konghou is a musical instrument that can’t be presented on stage, after all. The international scene still places more importance on the violin, piano, and so on.”","Therefore, when Qiao Nian became Nie Mi’s disciple and Qiao Chen became Mr. Steven’s disciple, she would actually be slightly better than Qiao Nian in terms of connections.","Fu Ge finally let out some of the pent-up anger in his chest over the past half a month. His gaze became gentle when he looked at Qiao Chen again.","He had always known that Qiao Chen was outstanding. In the beginning, he was also attracted to her shine. Reality proved that he had not misjudged her.","Qiao Chen did not disappoint him.","As for Qiao Nian...","Fu Ge recalled that she had taken half a month’s leave and had no idea where she had gone. He couldn’t help but frown, unwilling to think deeper.","“Thank you.” Qiao Chen felt his gentle gaze on her and smiled. Speaking of this, she thought of something else and frowned. She said softly, “...By the way, Brother Fu, I heard that Master Nie isn’t coming to the music event this time.”","“Didn’t Wen Ziyu say that Master Nie would be participating?” Fu Ge wasn’t from this industry and didn’t know much about this music event. He only knew that the scale was quite high. Wen Ziyu’s aunt had invited many socialites to participate, as well as music masters domestically and overseas.","Speaking of the national music masters, if Nie Mi said that he was second, no one could say that he was first.","Masters like Mr. Steven were coming from overseas, but Nie Mi actually stood him up at the last minute?","He felt that it was a little too willful.","However, when he thought about how Wen Ziyu had once mentioned to him about the ridiculous things Nie Mi had done in his youth, he felt that with this master’s character, it was very possible that he would do such a thing.","He pursed his lips and his eyes went cold as a figure surfaced in his mind.","She was wild and bandit-like!","She was also someone who could do such a thing.","He somewhat understood why Nie Mi had chosen Qiao Nian as his last disciple. It was probably because of Qiao Nian’s konghou skills and personality.","Master Nie’s character was incompatible with Chen Chen."]},{"number":731,"title":"Chapter 731 - Sister Nians Identity Must Be Covering","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Qiao Chen didn’t know what he was thinking. When she heard this, she shook her head and said, “I don’t know. I also suddenly heard from my aunt that Master Nie is not coming.”","She paused for a few seconds and pursed her lips. “Other than Master Nie not coming, didn’t I tell you previously that Zhui Guang might also come?”","“Okay.” Fu Ge also knew about Zhui Guang. He was extremely popular online, and his fans were close to the A-list traffic. Jiang Li was also a fan of Zhui Guang.","“So?”","Qiao Chen looked up. There was confusion in her eyes, but she was not sure. She said hesitantly, “Zhui Guang isn’t coming anymore.”","“From what my aunt says, Zhui Guang seems to know Master Nie, and they have a good relationship. It’s just that if Master Nie doesn’t come, Zhui Guang also won’t come.”","She had asked Wei Ling about Zhui Guang, but Wei Ling had never seen Zhui Guang in person.","Wei Ling had guessed that Nie Mi and Zhui Guang knew each other.","She had said it casually, but she secretly didn’t want Zhui Guang to come. Previously, she had been worried that Zhui Guang would come to the event to steal her limelight. Now that Nie Mi and Zhui Guang weren’t coming, she could take the lead. To her, it was a good thing that the two of them did not come.","However, she didn’t notice Fu Ge’s expression change when he heard that Master Nie and Zhui Guang might know each other.","Master Nie and Zhui Guang knew each other and were on good terms.","Qiao Nian also knew Master Nie. Their relationship was not ordinary.","Therefore, Zhui Guang = Qiao Nian?","Fu Ge was shocked by this sudden thought. Not in the mood to talk to Qiao Chen anymore, he walked past her and said hurriedly, “Chen Chen, wait for me. I’ll call Wen Ziyu.”","...","In the old residence of the Ye family in Beijing, an old man wearing a Chinese tunic suit and maintaining a good figure was trimming the branches.","He had just finished trimming a pot of orchids when he saw someone leaving from the corner of his eye. He put down the scissors and wiped his hands with a towel handed over by the butler before calling out to the man who was about to leave and coughing lightly. “Where are you going?”","Ye Wangchuan didn’t expect to be discovered by him. He stopped in his tracks and stood tall. His handsome face was outlined in the sunlight, and his eyes were deep. “I’m going out for a while.”","“...I didn’t know you were going out?” Old Master Ye choked on his words. Glaring ruthlessly and putting down the towel, he walked over and said, “Everyone says that a grown woman shouldn’t be kept. You, on the other hand, are a grown man who doesn’t come home all day. This time, if I didn’t get the butler to tell you that I was sick, you would still be holed up in Rao City and refuse to come back.”","Faced with his incessant accusations, the man did not feel guilty at all and said lazily, “Didn’t Ye Qichen come back to accompany you?”","“Him?”","At the mention of this, Old Master Ye’s heart hurt even more!","“Isn’t he the same as you? His heart isn’t here even when he comes back. The moment he comes back, he has a long face and keeps hugging his phone all day waiting for Sister to reply to his messages. I think he’s lovesick!”","In the past, the little overlord of the Ye family would at least have the appearance of a little overlord and would cause trouble for him. For example, if he beat someone’s grandson today, or if he tore someone’s granddaughter’s homework tomorrow... In short, there was no day when he would be quiet and not cause trouble.","This time, he was good. He was very obedient. It was just that he could tell that his soul was not in his body. He had lost half of it in Rao City.","He stayed at home all day and did not cause trouble for him anymore. He either played games or looked at his phone. Anyway, he just ignored him.","He might as well not come back!","The small ones were like this, and the big ones were like this too.","Old Master Ye felt stifled. He looked at his grandson, whom he was proud of, and felt that his nose was no longer his nose. His eyes were not his eyes.. He said, “The results of the Qing University’s joint examination are out. Did you see it?”"]},{"number":732,"title":"Chapter 732 - Havent Got Her After Staying in the City for So Long","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","“I saw it.” Ye Wangchuan was surprised that he had mentioned this to him, but he couldn’t hide the smile on his face.","Old Master Ye was angry when he saw his charming appearance. He pulled a face and asked coldly, “I heard from Ye Lan that Nian Nian came to Beijing to play again?”","Ye Wangchuan stuffed a hand into his jacket pocket and looked calm. Only he could withstand the pressure when faced with Old Master Ye’s question. “No, she came to Beijing for something.”","He didn’t mention that Qiao Nian had gone to the Ninth Branch to treat Master Cheng.","However, Old Master Ye couldn’t control his temper and said angrily, “I don’t care. Say, this person has already come to Beijing a few times. When are you going to bring her to see me?”","He paused for a moment, his eyes filled with suspicion. He looked the man up and down with a strange gaze. “Don’t tell me you haven’t won her over after staying in the city for so long.”","He poked the sore spot.","Ye Wangchuan looked awkward for the first time. He touched the bridge of his nose and lowered his eyes. “Soon.”","Old Master Ye: “...”","Therefore, he had brought Gu San to Rao City for almost a year and had not managed to woo her at all?!","Old Master Ye would be speechless if this wasn’t his own grandson.","Even so, Old Master Ye was still a little speechless at this moment. He stared at his face for a long time and thought about Qiao Nian’s results, which he had happily flaunted to his old friend in the morning. He felt upset. “You...”","He had been in the military all his life and had never cared about such lousy matters of the younger generation. He didn’t know how to speak for a long time.","After some thought, he said, “Qiao Nian will definitely come to Beijing in the future. Her grades have already been confirmed. When she comes to college, the Jiang family will acknowledge her. Since you’ve thought about it, you have to hurry up. There are only a few months left.”","Once Jiang Weishang revealed Qiao Nian’s identity, she would definitely be involved in this mess in Beijing.","Since Ye Wangchuan had already decided to fulfill the marriage contract, he had to at least settle her first. Don’t make him agitated for so long. This disappointing little brat was still single-minded!","Old Master Ye felt mixed emotions. He had never thought of worrying about his best grandson’s relationship status in the past.","After all, ever since Ye Wangchuan became an adult, many girls had come to hint at him.","Now, it seemed like he still had to worry.","He didn’t hide his gaze from Ye Wangchuan at all. The man smiled bitterly, not knowing whether to laugh or cry. “I just want to hurry up. Didn’t you trick me back?”","At the mention of this, Old Master Ye glared at him ruthlessly and said unhappily, “How long have you been at home? Not even a day has passed. You’ve been in Rao City for almost a year, but I didn’t see you chase after her either. So what if I delay you for a day?”","Although he said that, he waved his hand with a disdainful expression. “Forget it, forget it. I can’t be bothered to tell you. If you want to leave, do it tomorrow. Your aunt will be back tonight. We haven’t eaten together for a long time. The entire family can eat together before you leave.”","“Okay.” Ye Wangchuan had originally planned to leave directly. However, he fell silent for a second and agreed. “I understand.”","Old Master Ye didn’t like him like this at all. Seeing that he did not move, he frowned and asked, “Aren’t you going out?”","Ye Wangchuan stuffed his hands into his pockets casually and met his gaze slowly. Their eyes met, and his gaze was extremely evil. “I thought about it and there’s nothing else. I’ll go back to my room first.”","“...”","Old Master Ye watched his tall back disappear into the corridor of the courtyard. Feeling his heart becoming even more stifled, he decided not to look at him anymore. He turned his head and instructed the butler, “Give me my phone.”","He wanted to look at the results sheet released by Qing University to calm down."]},{"number":733,"title":"Chapter 733 - Young Master Bo, Master Cheng Is Awake","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","At the Ninth Branch.","Luo Qing and the others waited outside for three hours, but no one came out.","Zhou Wei couldn’t wait but also couldn’t flare up. She kept leaning against the wall with a stern expression as if someone owed her money.","After another half an hour, she looked at the time on her watch and lowered her arm. She couldn’t help but say, “Why aren’t they out yet?”","Luo Qing and the others found a laptop and surrounded it to study the USB drive Qiao Nian had given them. Everyone was a talent in the computer industry. After getting this level of programming, they didn’t have the heart to care about anything else. All of them had fanatical expressions.","Her voice wasn’t soft. Only Luo Qing was busy talking to her, and his tone was extremely impatient. “Young Master Bo, Chen Zhu, and the others are all with him. Why are you in a hurry?”","With that, he continued to discuss the source code in the USB with the people around him.","“How did you get this code? I’ve been looking at it for a long time, but I still don’t see how Miss Qiao can operate this code...”","Zhou Wei: “...”","...","In the waiting room.","Master Cheng was still sleeping soundly on the chair with his eyes closed. He didn’t have the slightest intention of waking up.","Bo Jingxing stood there for four hours and couldn’t help but feel a little impatient. He looked at the girl playing with her phone on the chair beside Master Cheng and asked gently, “Sister Qiao, why isn’t Master Cheng awake yet?”","Chen Zhu also looked at her anxiously.","Ever since Qiao Nian finished performing acupuncture on Master Cheng, he had been lying there as if he was asleep. It had been almost half a day since the end of the acupuncture, but Master Cheng showed no signs of waking up...","Only Gu San was calm. He wasn’t anxious at all, especially when he saw that Qiao Nian was still playing with her phone calmly.","Anyway, Miss Qiao wasn’t anxious. Master Cheng was definitely fine!","Master Cheng was too important to the Ninth Branch. Bo Jingxing didn’t understand Qiao Nian’s ability. Even if he believed that Ye Wangchuan wouldn’t judge her wrongly, he couldn’t calm down. He couldn’t help but say, “Sister Qiao, when will Master Cheng wake up? Why don’t you take a look?”","Qiao Nian had just finished a game with Qin Si. Hearing this, she logged out.","Qin Si’s message followed.","[Sister Qiao, why did you retreat? Come again!]","Qiao Nian lowered her eyes and held her phone casually. Her fair fingers pressed on the screen as she replied to his message.","[QN: No, I have something on.]","Qin Si’s message flashed quickly.","[I’ll wait for you to finish your work?]","[QN: I’m not sure when I’ll be done. Besides, I’ll wake you up if I want to play.]","[Okay, anytime. I’ll wait for you to summon me.]","Qiao Nian didn’t reply. She put away her phone. After a busy day without sleeping well, she narrowed her eyes and said with a slightly hoarse voice, “Soon. He’ll wake up in ten minutes at most.”","Ten minutes did not count for long.","Bo Jingxing suppressed his anxiety for the time being and waited patiently.","Some time passed.","In the blink of an eye, he raised his wrist to look at his watch. It was time.","The old man lying on the table had no intention of waking up. Bo Jingxing’s eyes darkened slightly, and he was about to speak when Chen Zhu, who was beside him, suddenly exclaimed, “Young Master Bo, Master Cheng is awake.”","“?” Bo Jingxing immediately looked at the old man lying on the table.","As expected, the fingers of the person who had been in a coma moved as the white-haired old man first moved his left hand. Next, his eyes also moved.. Then... under the anxious gazes of a few people, he slowly opened his eyes."]},{"number":734,"title":"Chapter 734 - Boss, Havent You Done Many God-Like Things?","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","“Master Cheng!” Bo Jingxing had never experienced such a long four hours. He walked quickly to Master Cheng, who had just woken up. He helped him up and asked softly with a serious expression, “How are you feeling?”","“Hm?”","The eyes of the old man who had just woken up were turbid. His eyes were not as bright as before, and they looked a little blurry.","However, after recovering, he blinked and rubbed his temples. It was obvious that he was feeling better.","Bo Jingxing saw him stretch and say to the girl in unconcealable joy, “Young lady, what method did you use? I haven’t had a good sleep before. I slept so well this time! I haven’t slept so well in the past ten years. It’s really like a dream.”","Chen Zhu: “...” So Master Cheng was actually asleep when he was unconscious earlier?","Qiao Nian had her hands in her pockets and looked quite wild. “Nothing much. I just pricked your acupuncture points. These acupuncture points have the effect of inducing sleep. How do you feel now?”","Her voice was quite faint and a little hoarse, but it was very pleasant to the ears.","“Does your head still hurt?”","Master Cheng subconsciously felt it. Then, he was surprised to discover that the back of his head, which usually hurt, was no longer as heavy as it used to be. He felt refreshed and unprecedentedly relaxed.","He couldn’t hide the admiration in his eyes when he looked at Qiao Nian again. “It doesn’t hurt at all. Young lady, you’re not bad. I didn’t expect you to be so good at medicine at such a young age.”","Bo Jingxing didn’t expect Qiao Nian’s acupuncture to be so effective. He was stunned for a moment and felt his face turn hot when he thought of how he had almost lost his cool previously.","Fortunately, he didn’t imitate Zhou Wei. Otherwise, the nine of them would have lost all their face!","Qiao Nian didn’t care. She stood up and said calmly, “From today onwards, I’ll perform acupuncture on you every two days. After doing it three times, I’ll prescribe you a medicine. You’ll see the effect after taking it for half a year.”","Chen Zhu asked in surprise, “Miss Qiao, why does it still take half a year to see the effect? Isn’t Master Cheng already fine?”","He had just heard Master Cheng say that his head no longer hurt and that he had slept very comfortably.","Bo Jingxing also wanted to ask this question. He placed his hands behind his back and looked at the girl with his dark eyes. He also asked, “Yes, Sister Qiao. Hasn’t Master Cheng already gotten better? Why will it still take half a year before the effects will show?”","Qiao Nian looked at them strangely. The ends of her eyes were a little wild and devilish. She raised her hand and tugged at the brim of her hat as she said impatiently, “Don’t tell me you think I can treat Master Cheng’s migraine just by doing acupuncture once?”","Bo Jingxing smiled. His refined appearance looked a little fake. “Isn’t that so?”","Qiao Nian retracted her gaze and said calmly, “I don’t have that ability. I’ve never heard of anyone who can treat a person’s decades-long chronic illness at once. Unless this person is a god or something.”","Gu San almost wanted to answer:? Boss, haven’t you done many God-like things?","Fortunately, he controlled himself from saying too much.","Qiao Nian continued gently, “Master Cheng thinks the symptoms are relieved only because he hasn’t slept in a long time and his brain couldn’t get any rest. He just slept and his brain rested for half a day before he had the illusion that his illness had already healed. In fact, the migraine problem is still there.. As long as he continues to work, his brain will become tired again. Some symptoms from the past will still appear..."]},{"number":735,"title":"Chapter 735 - Sister Nian’s Sugar Baby","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Bo Jingxing had thought that she had already treated Master Cheng’s migraine. When he heard this, he realized that it was only his own wishful thinking.","Qiao Nian didn’t care about him. She took out a glass bottle from her bag and handed it to Master Cheng. “Use this first. Eat one every week. It’s about three months’ worth of medicine.”","“This is?” Master Cheng took the glass bottle from her hand and looked at it in confusion. He didn’t see any labels or prescriptions. Inside were white pills. They looked like candy bars.","“It’s a drug that enhances the immune system. It’s not a special medicine for insomnia, but I’ve tried it before. After eating it, I can adjust my sleep. The effect is okay.”","She took it out casually.","However, when Gu San saw her casually give away another bottle of pills, the corners of his mouth twitched ruthlessly.","One bottle!","One pill a week. Miss Qiao said that it contained three months’ worth.","He counted with his fingers. There were at least 12 pills. Now, the price on the black market was about eight digits...","The price of the bottle of medicine Miss Qiao had given Master Cheng was around nine digits.","After calculating clearly, Gu San gasped.","He felt that Master Wang could really consider being a sugar baby. He saw that being Miss Qiao’s sugar baby was quite nice!","At least Master Wang had successfully become a freeloader again.","...","After settling Master Cheng’s problem, it was almost seven o’clock in the evening when Qiao Nian returned to the residence Gu San had arranged for her.","The weather in Beijing was cold. It wasn’t even eight o’clock when the sky outside turned dark.","Qiao Nian took a shower and changed into a bathrobe before walking out of the bathroom. Her hair hadn’t been dried yet, and it was still dripping with water. Water droplets flowed down her long neck into the bathrobe, making it inexplicably attractive.","She casually brought out a towel and placed it on her hair. She didn’t wipe it and went out lazily, about to take out a bottle of water from the fridge to drink.","She heard her phone ring.","Qiao Nian let go of the fridge door and paused for a moment. Then, she slowly took out a bottle of Evian from the fridge, unscrewed the cap, and took a sip. Then, she walked casually back to the desk and picked up her charging phone.","She took a look.","It was a video call.","Wei Lou and Yuan Yongqin knew her character and rarely called her on video.","Nie Mi liked to make video calls, but he had just returned to the country and was a master of culture. He was usually very busy and did not have the energy to look for her.","Qiao Nian lowered her eyelashes. The orange light from her dark eyelashes cast a shadow on her fair oval face.","She picked up her phone and unlocked it. She raised her eyebrows in surprise when she saw who was calling her.","It was Ye Wangchuan.","Qiao Nian didn’t pick it up immediately. Instead, she looked at the time on the laptop beside her and confirmed that it was almost 8:00 PM.","She then pulled down the charging cable and walked to the window.","The video call connected.","The first thing that greeted her eyes was the man’s eye-catching face. Qiao Nian had been busy for the entire day and was dead tired. When she saw this gorgeous face, she was in a good mood.","She placed her phone by the window and wiped her hair with a towel as she asked lazily, “Is anything the matter?”","Ye Wangchuan looked at the girl on the other end of the line who did not treat him as an outsider at all. She was still wearing a bathrobe. It was obvious that she had just come out of the shower. She picked up her video call without even drying her hair. He chuckled and opened a bottle of red wine.. He sat down on the sofa and had the same expression as her. He said lazily, “Can’t I look for you for no reason?”"]},{"number":736,"title":"Chapter 736 - Forget Tonight, The Ambiance Isnt Enough","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","His question was inexplicably provocative.","Qiao Nian was in a daze for a moment. Soon, she came back to her senses and did not look at him. “...Not really.”","However, the next sentence was—The question is, why are you looking for me?","Ye Wangchuan didn’t give her a chance to say anything else. He picked up the red wine and took a sip. His deep eyes seemed able to suck her in. He whispered, “I heard from Gu San that after you performed acupuncture on Master Cheng, he became much better. You even gave him a bottle of medicine.”","For the first time, Qiao Nian realized that Gu San was actually quite talkative. He even had the same problem as Jiang Li. He had a broken mouth and couldn’t hide anything.","As soon as she dried her hair, she threw the towel aside and walked back to the living room with her phone. “I happened to have it with me, so I gave it to him. However, migraine is a chronic illness, not something that can be treated in one or two days. I don’t have so much time to stay here. You can find a Traditional Chinese Medicine acupuncture master for him to do physical therapy when he has nothing to do. It will be more effective with medicine.”","Ye Wangchuan remembered her words and prepared to get Bo Jingxing to look for her later.","His gaze on her became deeper and deeper. It also had a lazy and provocative feeling. His tone was relaxed. “I owe you another favor.”","Qiao Nian narrowed her eyes. A little tired, she replied disapprovingly, “Not really. I owe you a lot.”","She tilted her head, her wet hair sliding across her eyebrows. She happened to raise her beautiful eyes, and they almost seemed able to speak as she looked at the man on the screen and said in a bandit-like tone, “Besides...”","Ye Wangchuan retracted his hand from the cup for some reason. He heard the girl’s lazy voice that was a little intentional.","“Besides, aren’t we good friends?”","Ye Wangchuan was speechless.","“It’s only right for good friends to help each other.”","With that, she successfully saw that the man opposite her had a stiff expression. She was in a very good mood. The corners of her mouth turned up in a devilish smile, and her eyes narrowed as if she had successfully pulled a prank.","It was rare for Ye Wangchuan to see her in such a good mood. The sadness in his heart slowly dissipated. He put down the cup in his hand and said in a low voice, “I’ll come over tomorrow.”","“Huh?” Qiao Nian didn’t react immediately. She looked at him with her dark eyes. “Where?”","“Ninth Branch.”","“You’re in Beijing?” Qiao Nian then noticed the background on the other end of the video call. It seemed like he was at home. She asked curiously, “Didn’t you say you would only be here in a few days?”","Ye Wangchuan leaned his head back. His collar was slightly open, revealing his long and straight neck and a lot of honey-colored skin.","Qiao Nian hadn’t planned to look at it, but she couldn’t help but be attracted by the view and looked at it more.","She didn’t know if the man on the other end of the line was doing this on purpose or accidentally, but as he moved, the collar of his shirt parted even more.","“I’m worried about you being alone there.”","“...”","Qiao Nian retracted her gaze and was silent for a moment.","“You...”","She felt like she was in the hospital again. She couldn’t describe it. It was quite complicated. She hadn’t encountered it before, but when she met Ye Wangchuan, she always had an indescribably complicated feeling.","Before she could finish, she heard the man’s deep voice. “When I reach Ninth Branch, I have something to tell you.”","Qiao Nian came back to her senses and lifted her eyes. When she saw the man’s eye-catching face on the screen, she fell silent. “What is it? You can tell me now.”","She didn’t like it when someone stopped talking halfway.","It was suspenseful.","However, Ye Wangchuan chuckled. There was a hidden meaning in his words. “Forget about tonight. The ambiance isn’t good enough.. I’ll treat you to a meal when Christmas comes in a few days.”"]},{"number":737,"title":"Chapter 737 - Standing Up","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows and narrowed her eyes. Her gaze was sharp, and she was about to ask him, “What kind of words do you need the right ambiance to tell me?” when her phone vibrated, and a new message popped up on the screen.","It was a message from Shen Jingyan.","[Nian Nian, are you asleep?]","Qiao Nian’s thoughts were interrupted. Her attention was attracted by the news, and she frowned slightly. It was quite annoying.","“Okay, we’ll talk about it at Christmas.”","Shen Jingyan sent another message as soon as she finished speaking.","[Qing University has announced the results for the joint examination today. I saw your ranking. First place, with a perfect score of 650. Nian Nian, congratulations. I didn’t know you had such good results. You successfully got into Qing University this time. Do you have any wishes or gifts you want? I’ll buy them for you! You can have anything you want.]","Qiao Nian’s beautiful fingers skimmed through the messages. She narrowed her eyes and still had no intention of replying.","On the other end of the line, Ye Wangchuan only saw the girl’s eyes suddenly turn cold. He didn’t know what she was doing. He raised his thin lips and asked softly, “Do you want to sleep?”","Qiao Nian moved her gaze away from the message. She was quite lazy and pursed her red lips. “A little. I didn’t sleep well last night. I want to sleep early today.”","Ye Wangchuan looked at her loose bathrobe and his throat tightened. He raised his hand and pressed down on the bridge of his nose with a faint smile. Suppressing his desire, he said in a hoarse voice, “Remember to dry your hair before sleeping.”","Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows.","He continued, “Otherwise, it’ll be easy for you to have a headache in the future. You’re young. You don’t have it now, but that doesn’t mean you won’t have it in the future. Dry your hair before sleeping. Be good~”","The words “be good” were used craftily.","Qiao Nian didn’t turn around for a long time. Her dark and beautiful eyes stared at his face for a long time, but she felt that she couldn’t be afraid. She imitated his tone and deliberately lowered her tone, replying cynically, “Hmm, is this also the concern between good friends?”","She originally thought that she would be able to successfully see his frozen expression again. Unexpectedly, this time, the man seemed to have been prepared. His thin lips were slightly raised, noble and languid. His eyes were like the warm sun of spring and the dazzling flames of summer. They were bottomless. “Aren’t I still your brother?”","Qiao Nian was speechless.","Ye Wangchuan looked at the girl’s stiff back and said in a lazy voice, “I remember when we first met, Nian Nian, you called me Brother Ye. Why? I’m not considered your brother anymore?”","If Gu San was here, he would definitely give him a thumbs up.","Master Wang was amazing!","He stood up coquettishly!","For a moment, Qiao Nian’s heart beat faster. Before she could think about the reason, she heard the man’s chuckle on the other end of the line. Then, he reminded her gently, “Remember to dry your hair before sleeping.”","“Okay.” She was a little unused to the atmosphere from earlier and didn’t know how to reply. She didn’t look at the person on the screen and responded lazily, lowering her eyes as if she didn’t want to chat anymore; she was clearly fleeing. “I’m tired. I’m not talking to you anymore. I’m hanging up.”","How could Ye Wangchuan not tell if she did not want to chat or was just tired? He smiled, and his face became even more eye-catching. Three buttons on his collar were unbuttoned, revealing his youthful appearance. “Go to sleep. I’ll send you a message when I get there tomorrow.”","“It’s best to send it later. I can’t wake up in the morning.”","“Okay.”","With that, he said in a deep voice, “Goodnight.. Have a sweet dream.”"]},{"number":738,"title":"Chapter 738 - She Wasnt Returning His Message At All","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","“...” Qiao Nian was expressionless as she hung up the video call ruthlessly. That extremely eye-catching handsome face disappeared from the phone. The entire world fell silent, and the air was not as thin as before.","She picked up the mineral water on the table and took a sip. Then, she saw that Shen Jingyan had sent another message.","[Nian Nian, didn’t you say you wanted to eat together previously? Let’s eat together when you are free?]","Qiao Nian’s attention was pulled back by the message. She saw that the person who had sent her a rare message had sent three consecutive messages.","She flipped through it with her fingers. She might have replied in the past.","However, she did not reply this time.","She decisively deleted all the messages from Shen Jingyan. When she was about to blacklist his phone number, her eyes darkened and she canceled the action.","Then, she threw her phone back onto the sofa and bent to pick up the towel, preparing to go to bed.","Before going to sleep, she passed by the mirror and saw that her hair was still wet. She stopped in her tracks and turned to the bathroom to find a hairdryer to blow dry her hair completely.","After her hair was completely dry, she went back to bed, took her medicine, and turned off the light to sleep.","...","On the other end, the Shen family’s villa in Beijing was brightly lit as if it was daytime.","Wei Ling had just returned to Beijing. When she returned, she went to the bedroom to take a shower. As she wiped her face, she walked down the stairs and happened to see the man sitting on the sofa in the living room.","“Jingyan, when did you come back? Why haven’t you changed?”","Shen Jingyan was holding his phone. When he heard this, he looked up and saw her walking over from the staircase. His expression was tense, and he was quite serious. His voice was also tired. “Go change immediately.”","“Yes.” When Wei Ling came down, she noticed that he had been paying attention to his phone. She couldn’t help but ask, “Who are you waiting for?”","Shen Jingyan didn’t hide it from her. He placed his phone on the table, but his gaze did not leave the phone for half a second. He said in a deep voice, “I sent Nian Nian a message. I asked her when she’s free to go out for a meal.”","Wei Ling’s face immediately darkened when she heard Qiao Nian’s name. The corners of her mouth drooped and she said unhappily, “Why did you send her a message?”","“...” Shen Jingyan didn’t answer her and only looked at her.","Wei Ling understood what he meant. Her chest was filled with panic and frustration. Her mood instantly became bad. “How did she reply to you?”","Shen Jingyan rubbed his temples when he heard this. His brows were furrowed so tightly that it seemed like they couldn’t be separated. His face was filled with worry. “She hasn’t replied to my message yet. I wonder if she’s asleep.”","“She didn’t reply?” Wei Ling didn’t expect this. She subconsciously looked at the clock in the living room. It was only nine o’clock. She sneered. “I don’t think she’s asleep. She just doesn’t want to reply.","“I bumped into her in Huanyu Hotel a few days ago. She was eating with Master Nie and Principal Liang. Professor Cheng invited her to eat with us. Even Chen Chen gave in to her and asked her to eat with us. Everyone sat together, but she refused to give us face. In the end, we couldn’t eat with Principal Liang either.”","Wei Ling couldn’t calm down when she mentioned this.","“After that, we bumped into each other at the entrance of the hotel. There were so many relatives in the Qiao family, and your sister and brother-in-law were also there, but she walked past us as if she didn’t see us. She didn’t even greet us and called for a taxi to leave.. With Qiao Nian’s attitude, do you think she will reply to your message? She’s clearly trying to draw the line between us.”"]},{"number":739,"title":"Chapter 739 - Already Enemies","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Shen Jingyan didn’t speak, but he was very annoyed by her. He took out a box of cigarettes from his bag, took one out, and lit it.","The cigarette was between his two fingers. He seemed extremely frustrated, but he did not smoke.","Shen Jingyan maintained his smoking posture and looked up. He asked her seriously, “Do you think there’s still room for us to repair our relationship with Nian Nian?”","Wei Ling: “No.”","The cigarette in Shen Jingyan’s hand became hot. He pressed the cigarette butt into the marble ashtray beside him and frowned. He refused to give up. “Not at all?”","“No,” Wei Ling said decisively. She looked at him again and felt a little amused and sad like him. “Don’t think about winning her over again!”","Shen Jingyan: “...”","He didn’t want to think about it, either.","The problem was that he went out to socialize today. Everyone was chatting about how a heaven-defying student had appeared at the Qing University’s examinations.","That student was clearly his niece. In the past, he could stand up with a smile and inadvertently reveal this information.","However, this time, even though he knew that everyone at the table was talking about Qiao Nian, he couldn’t say that he knew her. He was extremely aggrieved.","He didn’t eat much throughout the meal.","Qiao Nian’s results this time were too heaven-defying. When the results were announced in the morning, everyone in Beijing talked about it. Wei Ling was also in this industry, so of course, she had heard similar rumors.","Seeing Shen Jingyan’s depressed expression and knowing what he was thinking, she took a deep breath and splashed cold water on him. “Thanks to Wei Qi’s incident, she considers us enemies. She had a good relationship with you in the past, but because of me, she will definitely not be like how she was in the past. She has always protected the Chen family, but Wei Qi got someone to beat up Chen Yuan and almost made him unable to go to school. She still remembers all of it. Didn’t she tell us before that she let Wei Qi off, but we’re even now...”","Shen Jingyan recalled the girl’s cold expression when she said this. It was wild and cold.","Qiao Nian was indeed a person who would do as she said. She would never go back on her words.","She had said that she would call it even with them, so she didn’t reply to his message this time!","He felt even more upset.","Things wouldn’t have ended up like this if they hadn’t been too ruthless in the past.","They could have also benefited from Qiao Nian now that she got first place in Qing University’s examinations.","It had to be known that Qiao Nian’s first place wasn’t as simple as being first place. She had gotten full marks. There had never seen such a situation before.","He heard that the Education Bureau in Beijing was in an uproar this time. They had found a school to hold a meeting because of this. The general meaning was that although they were snatching people, everyone was competing fairly and benignly. The two universities—Qing University and Nanjing University—should not make a big fuss over it.","Even so, dozens of universities had gone to Rao City to block people at First High School.","“Nian Nian...”","Seeing that he was in a daze, Wei Ling interrupted him coldly. “Chen Chen also got into Qing University this time, and her results are not bad. She ranked 19th. Although I’m angry that she thought she was smart and caused Wei Qi to be on the news, I’m still satisfied with her results.”","She knew that Shen Jingyan had also heard about Qiao Nian acknowledging Nie Mi as her master. Thus, she continued, “Furthermore, about the music event, I’ve already spoken to Mr. Steven. He agreed to accept Chen Chen as his disciple in front of everyone at the event.. Although one of the reasons is my involvement in this, Mr. Steven agreed to this matter because he really likes that song from before!”"]},{"number":740,"title":"Chapter 740 - No One Will Remember That a Student From Qing University Once Scored Full Marks","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","“Chen Chen explained to him in private about the misunderstanding of the song plagiarism. He knows that most of the song was written by Chen Chen. He very much approved of Chen Chen’s talent in composition.”","Wei Ling said tirelessly, “Mr. Steven’s status on the international scene is not lower than Master Nie’s. He’s also a master in the field of piano, so he’s more suitable for Chen Chen. Mr. Steven also said before that Chen Chen is very talented. If there’s a chance, he’ll recommend Chen Chen to the piano association. You know that the domestic piano association is only average, but the overseas ones have very high status. The connections they can make are completely different from those in the country. If Chen Chen can enter, she’ll be a fish that jumps over the dragon gate in the future. She’ll be completely different.”","Shen Jingyan finally cast his gaze on her. His expression was not as uncomfortable as before. Pausing for a moment and seeming to think of something, he asked worriedly, “I heard that Nian Nian chose the Traditional Chinese Medicine major. Have you asked around? Will Mr. Huang make a comeback?”","The most inconspicuous thing about Qing University was its Chinese Medicine major. It hadn’t changed for so many years.","It was a joke that the first place of Qing University chose the worst major in the school.","However, Shen Jingyan knew very well that there was still a master presiding over the Chinese Medicine major. If that person was willing to teach her, then the weight of the Chinese Medicine major would be different.","Wei Ling was quite disdainful. “Are you talking about Mr. Huang? Tsk, who is Mr. Huang? How can he come out of retirement so casually? That’s a famous master from an independent continent. He has a good reputation and is different from Master Nie who only plays music. He can’t take in disciples easily.”","The illegal district belonged to an independent continent. Even the top circles in Beijing had heard of these two places.","A place that everyone wanted to go but could not touch.","“That’s true.” Shen Jingyan thought about it and felt that it was as she said. His expression and shoulders relaxed as he leaned against the back of the sofa.","Only then did Wei Ling put her hand on his shoulder and pat him before continuing, “Therefore, if Mr. Huang doesn’t come out, the Chinese Medicine major will be of little value. It’s the same even if she goes to Qing University. She won’t amount to much in the future, and her future development won’t be better than Chen Chen’s. Since you’ve made your choice, don’t think too much about it. Let’s nurture Chen Chen well. She will step on her sooner or later. No one will remember that a student from Qing University once scored full marks. They will only remember Chen Chen’s name!”","“...” Shen Jingyan raised his eyes and silently picked up his phone. He took out the photo on the news again. On it was Qing University’s report card.","Qiao Nian’s name was high on the first row.","No. 1: Qiao Nian, total score of 650. 100 for Chinese, 100 for Mathematics, 100 for English, and 350 for Arts and Sciences.","No matter how one looked at it, this row of results was extremely eye-catching.","Shen Jingyan sighed silently and clicked on another message.","There were still only three messages from him on the screen. The messages were like stones thrown into the ocean, with no reply.","He took a deep breath and did not want to look at it anymore. He exited the message page and deleted the news.","He said to Wei Ling, “I hope so.”","He hoped that Qiao Chen could really work hard and not cause him to invest in the wrong person.","Otherwise, he would regret his choice forever!","...","Early the next morning.","The sun had just risen. It wasn’t even nine o’clock.","Qiao Nian was still sleeping when she heard a knock on the door.","She turned around and buried her head in the pillow. She pulled up the blanket and did not want to get up.","Bang! Bang! Bang!","However, the knocking on the door did not stop.. It seemed like the person wanted to wake her up."]},{"number":741,"title":"Chapter 741 - Did Zhou Wei Come Over?","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","“Tsk!” Qiao Nian swore rarely. She lifted the blanket and got out of bed. Her dark eyes still had the air of someone who had not slept well. Red blood could still be seen at the ends of her eyes, and her beautiful eyes were extremely dry.","Knock, knock, knock...?","Someone was still knocking on the door.","She didn’t open the door immediately after getting up. Instead, she sat on the bed for two minutes. When she regained her senses, she slowly got up and suppressed the frustration in her eyes.","She got up, put on her slippers, and walked over to open the door.","“What’s the matter?”","Her tone was quite cold.","It wasn’t the polite coldness. There was hostility mixed in it, and it was extremely dark.","When Zhou Wei saw her come out, her eyes turned red as if she had been greatly wronged. She suddenly bent down and bowed to apologize to her. “I’m sorry, Miss Qiao. I apologize for what I did previously. I hope you’ll forgive me!”","Qiao Nian was confused.","The girl’s eyes were quite cold. Although she didn’t know what she was doing early in the morning, no matter who it was, they wouldn’t be in a good mood if they slept well and were forced to get out of bed. Qiao Nian was the same. She looked coldly at the person who was bowing and apologizing in front of her and said impatiently, “You came knocking on my door early in the morning just to tell me this?”","Zhou Wei bent down and did not get up for a long time. Quite humiliated, she gritted her teeth and said, “I’m sorry, Miss Qiao. I came to apologize to you.”","“...”","Qiao Nian took a deep breath to suppress the anger in her eyes. Not giving her face, she turned around to say coldly, “There’s no need.”","As she spoke, she walked in and picked up the mineral water on the desk. She unscrewed the cap and took a sip to suppress the anger that was rising to her throat. She looked at Zhou Wei impatiently and said, “If you want to put on a show next time, come again at a different time. I don’t have the habit of looking at the Monastery in Paris early in the morning.”","Over the past few days, she hadn’t slept well for a few nights in order to get the unmanned programming and revision materials for Class A.","It was the same yesterday. She had only slept on the plane for a while.","After getting off the plane, she came to the Ninth Branch again. After treating Master Cheng, she forced herself to sit there and play games for four hours to guard him.","She had finally gotten a good night’s sleep, but she was woken up early in the morning. The first thing Zhou Wei said was to ask for her forgiveness...","What was there to forgive? She hoped that she would forgive her for not knocking continuously earlier and for making her get up to open the door?","Wouldn’t it be good to let her sleep well?","“...” Zhou Wei was already unwilling to come. She was also aggrieved and indignant. When she heard this, her eyes turned even redder as if she had been greatly humiliated. She looked at her and pursed her lips. “Anyway, I sincerely apologize to you, Miss Qiao. I’ve already said what I wanted to say. I can’t force you to accept my apology, but I apologize to you sincerely. Also, I’m sorry for disturbing your sleep.”","At nine o’clock, most of the people in the Ninth Branch had already woken up. Only Qiao Nian was still sleeping. From the looks of it, she wanted to sleep until 12 o’clock.","“I still have something on. I’ll make a move first!”","Zhou Wei felt even more upset. She bowed to the girl leaning against the desk and looking at her coldly before running away without turning back.","Qiao Nian watched her run away with a cold expression and slowly unscrewed the cap of the mineral water.","At this moment, Gu San came over with breakfast and greeted her. “Miss Qiao, you’re up?”","With eyes still filled with sleepiness from waking up, Qiao Nian did not reply to him immediately.","Gu San looked at her and asked carefully, “Miss Qiao, did Zhou Wei come over?”"]},{"number":742,"title":"Chapter 742 - Master Wang Came Over This Morning to Help Miss Qiao Vent Her Anger","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Qiao Nian had just walked over and bent down to pick up the phone that she had thrown by the bed yesterday. Hearing this, a surprised expression appeared in her beautiful black eyes. She looked at him and said, “Huh? How did you know?”","“Of course, I know.” Gu San scratched his head with an expression that said, “I just know.” When he saw Qiao Nian looking at him, he walked over and placed the breakfast down. Then, he slowly explained to her, “It’s because Young Master Wang came over in the morning to help you vent your anger.”","“...” Qiao Nian raised the corner of her eyes. Her fair fingers had already pressed on the phone. The screen lit up, and she happened to see a certain someone’s message.","[Ye Wangchuan: I’m at the Ninth Branch. Are you still sleeping?]","She looked at the time.","At around 8:30 AM.","He was half an hour earlier than Zhou Wei.","Qiao Nian gathered her collar and walked over. She saw Gu San taking out the breakfasts he had brought over in the morning.","The symbol on the box was especially obvious.","It was obvious that it did not belong to the Ninth Branch.","Breakfast at the Imperial Mansion wasn’t easy to buy. When Qin Si was playing games with her previously, he had inadvertently mentioned that there were a few good breakfasts at the Imperial Mansion. He had promised to bring her to Beijing next time to enjoy breakfast there.","Then, he had mentioned that the Imperial Mansion had many rules and generally did not provide any foreign-exchange services. If he wanted to buy takeaway, he needed to wake up early to queue.","Qiao Nian’s gaze paused on seven or eight types of breakfast for a second. She took her phone to the desk to charge it as she leaned against the desk mischievously. She picked up the cup of water and unscrewed the cap. Her long eyelashes were lowered, and she looked very sleepy. She asked casually, “You said that Master Wang helped me vent my anger in the morning. What do you mean? Did he make Zhou Wei come knocking on my door early in the morning to apologize to me?”","Gu San helped her set up the breakfast before turning around. He saw the girl leaning there in her pajamas. Her legs were long and straight. She looked lazy as she held a bottle of water unconsciously.","Tsk, to a certain extent, Miss Qiao was the same kind of person as Master Wang.","They were all people who were too good-looking and did not leave anyone a way out!","He quickly looked away, not daring to look at her anymore.","Then, he replied briskly, “Master Wang came to the Ninth Branch in the morning and punished Zhou Wei in front of everyone. She probably won’t appear in front of you again during this time.”","Zhou Wei had suffered a huge loss this time.","The Zhou family was considered a low-class family in Beijing. They were at the edge of the upper circles. In the past few decades, they didn’t have many outstanding figures. However, from the past few generations, the Zhou family had ruthlessly produced a few computer talents. For example, the famous hacker in the country, Zhou Hengfeng, was Zhou Wei’s third uncle. Zhou Wei herself was also shockingly talented in computer science.","It was the information age. Computer IT in the country started later than overseas, so there were naturally not as many talents. Computer IT talents naturally became the focus of all the major forces.","Zhou Wei and Zhou Hengfeng were rarely seen among such talents who had some ability in hacking. Thus, they became even more valuable.","This could be seen from the fact that Zhou Hengfeng had not approached anyone, but the fact that all the major families in Beijing would give him some face.","Zhou Wei’s status in the Ninth Branch was also extraordinary because of this.","She knew her own importance.","Perhaps because of this, Zhou Wei was famous for her arrogance. She wasn’t very tolerant in their group.","For example, Liao Xu, who was under Luo Qing, was also a hacker, and he came from an unorthodox background.","In the beginning, Liao Xu followed Zhou Wei’s group.. Later, he was pushed aside by Zhou Wei and was forced to transfer to Luo Qing’s group."]},{"number":743,"title":"Chapter 743 - Very Much Like Red Alliance Sun Three Years Ago","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","With her character, it was no wonder that she was jealous when she saw Miss Qiao complete in a day the programming that she couldn’t complete for three months.","She had been targeting Miss Qiao all along because of this.","Gu San looked at the girl who opened the cap and took a sip of water. His eyes were bright and filled with admiration.","To be honest, he didn’t expect Qiao Nian to be so fierce. She was way ahead of Zhou Wei in terms of programming skills. She could really resolve such complicated programming in a day.","This technique... reminded him of an organization that Master Wang, Young Master Qin, and Young Master Bo often talked about—the Red Alliance.","The overlord of the hackers.","It seemed to be the Red Alliance!","Luo Qing had told him in private yesterday that the verification system Miss Qiao had set up on the USB drive was very similar to the style of Red Alliance’s boss, Sun, used three years ago.","He wanted him to tell Miss Qiao again not to learn Chinese Medicine but to learn Computer Science.","She might even be more famous than Zhou Hengfeng in the future and might even succeed in entering the Red Alliance.","Thinking back to when Zhou Hengfeng was praised as the number one hacker in the country, wasn’t it because he almost entered the Red Alliance?","Gu San stole a few glances at her.","It was difficult for Qiao Nian not to notice. She put down the things in her hand and met his gaze. Her dark eyes were beautiful. “What do you want to say? Tell me!”","If Qiao Nian wanted him to say it, he would be embarrassed to say it. He touched the back of his head and said awkwardly, “Miss Qiao, you... really want to learn Chinese Medicine? Actually, changing majors isn’t bad. With your results, as long as you ask, Principal Liang shouldn’t have any objections, right?”","Although the Computing faculty at Qing University was not as good as in Nanjing University, it was still much better than other universities in the country.","If Qiao Nian was willing, Principal Liang would definitely agree.","Even if Principal Liang didn’t agree, there was still Master Wang. With one word from Miss Qiao, Master Wang could pluck the stars from the sky. He didn’t believe that Master Wang wouldn’t help Miss Qiao find a connection with someone else for her to change her major.","Even if Master Wang didn’t find a connection, Old Master Ye and Principal Liang had been friends for many years. Wouldn’t such a small matter be settled with just one word from Old Master Ye?","“Huh? Why should I change my major?” Qiao Nian looked at him in surprise, not understanding why he would suddenly mention this.","The charging phone lit up.","Qiao Nian took the phone and looked down.","It was still a message from a certain someone.","He was sending messages quite frequently.","[Ye Wangchuan: I’ll wait for you at Master Cheng’s.]","Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows, her eyes bright and a little wild.","She rubbed her fingers against the phone screen and really wanted to reply to him. Had she told him that she was going to perform acupuncture on Master Cheng today?","Why did she remember telling Bo Jingxing that it would happen once every two days?","However, acupuncture did not need to be especially hard to determine the time. Master Cheng’s migraine was considered a chronic illness, so more acupuncture would improve his condition faster.","However, she was lazy and wanted to catch up on her sleep in the morning. She had only said to do it once every two days.","Gu San saw her looking down at her phone. Her beautiful side face was bathed in the morning light. The sun cast a halo on her high nose bridge, making her look like a painting.","He almost took out his phone and took a photo to send to Master Wang.","However, he didn’t have the courage to do so and held it in for the time being. He said, “It’s nothing. It’s just that Leader Luo told me that there was a verification technique on the USB drive you gave him yesterday that’s comparable to Zhou Wei’s iris technique. Anyway, what he said was very awesome. I was wondering if you wanted to change majors and learn computer science...”","Qiao Nian had just replied.","When she heard this, she looked up and put away her phone in a relaxed manner. Her clear black eyes looked at him, and her voice was dark and hoarse from just waking up.. “Oh, you’re talking about that.”"]},{"number":744,"title":"Chapter 744 - Sister Nian: I Dont Know Who She Is","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","“Yes, that’s it. Miss Qiao, why do you know iris technology? Yesterday, after Luo Qing brought back your USB drive, the people at the technical department went crazy. I heard that they’ve been studying your technology all night...”","Iris technology was one of the nine most powerful validation technologies currently.","Qiao Nian’s skills were one level higher than Zhou Wei’s most successful technology. Although it wasn’t as powerful as the strongest defense system that only appeared once three years ago, it was still considered very powerful...","The nine technical departments were all workaholics. They were the same as Luo Qing. It would be strange if they didn’t go crazy when they saw this!","Gu San was full of anticipation, thinking that Qiao Nian would give him another surprise. Unexpectedly, he was splashed with cold water.","“I did it casually on the Internet.”","Gu San: “?”","Gu San was in disbelief. He took a step forward. “You did it casually on the Internet?”","What the hell?","“I just downloaded it casually from the Internet. There’s a website that specializes in providing software for download. There are links to all kinds of software on it. I randomly found a downloadable one.” As Qiao Nian spoke, she walked to the dining table and sat down. She opened a lunch box and saw the crystal prawn dumplings inside.","The white and transparent skin was wrapped in a cartoon prawn that was still steaming. It looked appetizing.","Gu San was so shocked that he didn’t come back to his senses for a long time. He was still in a daze as he looked at her. Not giving up, he asked, “You didn’t write the code yourself?”","He and Luo Qing both thought that Qiao Nian had written the verification system herself!","Qiao Nian’s eyes were extremely dark. She leaned against the chair and placed one hand on the back of it. She glanced at him and retracted her gaze. She shook her head and denied calmly. “No. I still have to find revision materials for my class. I don’t have time to write that.”","She picked up a pair of chopsticks by the side and picked one up to try. The fresh and fragrant prawn dumplings were wrapped in all kinds of fillings. There was also gravy when she took a bite. The prawn meat was especially fresh and smooth, and the temperature was maintained at just the right temperature.","It tasted good.","No wonder Qin Si specially mentioned the Imperial Mansion’s breakfast.","Gu San watched as the girl opened the other boxes and began to eat breakfast. She looked around and really did not want to give up. However, after looking for a long time, the girl was extremely calm. She didn’t have the intention of responding to him at all and lowered her head to eat her food.","He couldn’t help but retract his gaze in disappointment and say with a disappointed expression, “I thought you wrote that system. Leader Luo even told me that your system is very similar to a system that was posted online by the Red Alliance three years ago...”","Qiao Nian paused for a moment before saying calmly, “Is that so? Maybe it’s a coincidence.”","Gu San noticed that she paused for a moment and nodded in agreement. “Probably.”","As he spoke, he couldn’t help but look at her eagerly. “By the way, Miss Qiao, do you know who that person is?”","Qiao Nian had just picked up a crab roe dumpling and almost choked on his sudden question. Fortunately, she reacted quickly and took a sip of water to suppress it. Her fair and beautiful hands knocked on the cup rim as her eyes darkened.","“I don’t know.”","Gu San smacked his lips and said regretfully, “I wonder who wrote this software. If only he could come to the Ninth Branch. Even if he imitates Sun, if ‘he’ can write this, he’ll be considered one of the top in the country.”","Qiao Nian, who was imitating Sun: “...”","...","After breakfast, Gu San led her to look for Master Cheng.","Yesterday, Qiao Nian had taken a plane and a car.. When she arrived at the Ninth Branch, she was in a particularly bad state and did not even notice what the place looked like."]},{"number":745,"title":"Chapter 745 - Search for Sister Nian","paragraphs":["Today, Gu San led her and introduced her all the way.","Qiao Nian had a rough understanding of the Ninth Branch.","Out of the nine Chinese branches, the Ninth Branch was usually mentioned outside. They were actually research institutes for the country’s top technology. Other than that, they also had the authority to obtain some intelligence and some rare materials.","This was also why Ye Wangchuan had the rare metals she had always wanted to find for Uncle Chen.","Because of the Ninth Branch’s special status in the country, Gu San didn’t tell her much about its internal affairs. He only briefly introduced the place.","Qiao Nian didn’t have a strong desire to know what the Ninth Branch did. She roughly listened to him and followed him to the laboratory she visited yesterday.","“Master Cheng.” When he arrived at the laboratory, Gu San changed his spirit on the way. He narrowed his eyes and restrained his movements a lot as he greeted the people inside respectfully. “Master Wang, Young Master Bo.”","Qiao Nian looked up and realized that other than Ye Wangchuan and Bo Jingxing, Chen Zhu was also in the laboratory.","Beside Master Cheng were a few people who were also wearing white coats. They were generally younger and should be members of Master Cheng’s team.","In front of them was a series of experimental equipment. One of the U-shaped glass containers was filled with a green liquid. The white-haired Master Cheng was pouring a white liquid from a bottle into a catheter. As soon as the white liquid was poured into it, it immediately burst out with a dazzling light.","She avoided the fire and looked at the experiment table with her dark eyes. She could tell at a glance that the reactor was probably doing an experiment on a new weapon.","Although bioengineering sounded like a borderline major in research on animals and plants, many new weapons were actually related to bioengineering.","For example, many new submarines use a lot of biological engineering theories.","A master at Master Cheng’s level couldn’t only study some trivial things. However, Qiao Nian didn’t expect the Ninth Branch to have such research.","She glanced at the man standing there without a trace. His black eyes were narrowed beautifully, and he looked quite devilish.","She put her hands into her pocket and casually pulled up the hat on her hoodie.","As soon as she was done, Master Cheng noticed her coming in. He put down the experiment he was doing and waved at her. “Little girl, you’re here? Come, come quickly.”","Master Cheng’s team did not see Qiao Nian yesterday. Today, they saw Gu San running to the laboratory with a girl. When they saw that the girl was wearing a black hoodie and did not have a jacket, they knew at a glance that she was not from the Ninth Branch. All of them frowned and looked disapproving. However, no one dared to gossip because of Master Cheng.","As they watched the girl walk over slowly and reach the experiment table, the members of Master Cheng’s laboratory became even more serious.","The reactor experiment they were doing was important.","It wasn’t something that an ordinary person could approach.","However, when they saw the girl’s overly young face, they felt that they were overthinking. Perhaps if they showed her, she might not know what kind of experimental reactor this was.","Master Cheng seemed to not care about this at all and did things as he pleased. When he saw Qiao Nian coming over, a smile appeared on his thin face. He said gently to her, “Young lady, I feel much better after you performed acupuncture on me yesterday. It’s rare for me to have a good night’s sleep. Your medical skills are good. Who did you learn them from?”","“I read and felt around myself.” Qiao Nian’s eyes were calm, and she did not seem to be lying.","However, she gave off an extremely wild feeling.","It was very eye-catching.."]},{"number":746,"title":"Chapter 746 - This Thing Belongs to Her","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","At least, Ye Wangchuan was attracted to her. His deep eyes were filled with love that could drown a person. His thin lips curled up and he chuckled as he looked at the girl standing there.","Bo Jingxing looked at him a few times.","Master Cheng was stunned. He looked at Qiao Nian carefully and saw that she probably did not want to say anything. He didn’t ask further. He turned his head and said as if he had thought of something at the last minute, “By the way, does the young lady know about bioengineering?”","“Huh?” Qiao Nian put her hands in her pocket and looked at him silently with her dark eyes. Her red lips parted and she replied politely, “I know a little.”","“Bioengineering is actually a very broad concept. For example, iris technology. When you came in yesterday, you should have noticed nine access systems. They’re not fingerprint systems outside. They’re identified by scanning the eyes of a person. This is also considered a type of bioengineering. It has to be included in the field of biological engineering...”","Qiao Nian listened to him quietly. Her fair side profile looked quite obedient. “Okay.”","Seeing that she had listened, Master Cheng smiled and said without hiding anything, “I heard from Jingxing yesterday that you have good grades. You came in first in Qing University’s examinations and scored full marks in all the subjects. Are you interested in studying bioengineering? I see that you have a calm personality and are very suitable for this.”","He liked her.","She wasn’t as particular about things as others.","He could those who were straightforward.","“If you’re interested, I can take the time to introduce you to bioengineering while you’re at the Ninth Branch.”","However, this sentence still shocked the entire laboratory.","Bo Jingxing’s fingers couldn’t help but tremble. He temporarily hid the surging emotions in his heart and turned to look at the girl standing beside Master Cheng. A hint of surprise flashed across his eyes. He didn’t understand why Master Cheng liked Qiao Nian so much.","Yesterday, when he thought that Qiao Nian was a new member of the Ninth Branch, he had invited her to his laboratory to do odd jobs.","After finding out that Qiao Nian was an outsider and a high school student today, he invited her to work on the student resource project.","One had to know that the Ninth Branch wasn’t an ordinary place. Top students from major universities would fight tooth and nail for a spot, let alone the spot beside a master.","Qiao Nian... was overreaching.","“Tsk.” Ye Wangchuan laughed again. His eyes were unrestrained and lazy, looking extraordinarily noble. He narrowed his eyes slightly, and he placed his hand in his pocket. His long legs leaned against the experiment table in a very charming manner. He looked at the girl’s profile and did not say anything.","“How is it? Are you interested?” Master Cheng still didn’t feel that he had dropped a huge bomb. He looked more interested than Qiao Nian herself and asked her again.","The girl hesitated for only a second before looking at him. The hoodie contrasted with her milky-white skin. Her eyes were extremely dark, and their shape was very beautiful. It was the kind of eyes that curled up slightly and looked lazy and handsome when they were raised.","“I’m sorry, I might not have time.”","Not to mention Bo Jingxing and the others, even Gu San was stunned.","Was Miss Qiao rejecting Master Cheng?","The corners of Gu San’s mouth twitched. He was in a daze and did not know how to feel.","Perhaps only Miss Qiao would reject Master Cheng’s invitation.","Qiao Nian said politely, “I’ve already agreed to learn two techniques from two other people. I have limited energy. If I learn another technique, I might not have time.”","Chinese Medicine and music were temporarily two courses she had to learn.","Actually, she was quite interested in bioengineering.. However, if one were to really talk about it, she really did not have the time."]},{"number":747,"title":"Chapter 747 - Rejecting Master Cheng Twice","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Master Cheng’s turbid but spirited eyes stared at her with a regretful expression. “Are you really not free?”","She gave him an affirmative answer. “I really don’t have time!”","At this moment, the people in Master Cheng’s laboratory gasped. Their reactions were similar to Bo Jingxing’s. Their expressions couldn’t be described as one of shock. It was simply too complicated.","Master Cheng had taken the initiative to invite her, but Qiao Nian had rejected him twice.","Did she know Master Cheng’s status in the domestic scientific research world?","Qiao Nian was still the same. She had her hands in her pockets and with her hoodie pulled up. Her snow-white face was wrapped under the hoodie, and her eyes were extraordinarily exquisite. She gave off a bandit aura and did not look like a good student. Her cynical aura was more like that of those ignorant and incompetent gangsters in school.","If Master Cheng hadn’t said personally that the girl in front of him was the first place in this year’s Qing University’s joint examination, no one would have been able to link the person in front of them to a perfect score.","It wasn’t that they didn’t believe it.","She just didn’t look the part!","However, when Ye Wangchuan saw Qiao Nian reject Master Cheng for the second time, he was not surprised at all. His smile widened. He knew that she would reject him.","Gu San saw his reaction and noticed that he seemed a little proud. The corners of his mouth twitched. He really wanted to ask him what he was being proud of. What was the difference between Miss Qiao rejecting Master Cheng and rejecting the Ninth Branch?","Even if Master Wang didn’t feel comfortable with being with Young Master Bo and the others, at least he shouldn’t look at Miss Qiao with such a proud expression!","As the person involved in the matter who had been rejected twice in a row, Master Cheng was quite calm. He returned to his senses after a short daze and smiled. “Forget it if you don’t have the time. I originally thought that if you have the time, I’ll introduce you to bioengineering. However, you have to be interested in learning. What matters most is that you like it.”","Qiao Nian leaned back slightly and glanced at the reactor on his experiment table with her dark eyes. She hummed in response.","Her answer wasn’t very respectful.","Master Cheng didn’t mind. He sized her up with his turbid eyes that revealed intelligence, placed his hands behind his back, and said slowly, “Are you sure you want to go to university? Are you studying at Qing University? You’re not taking the college entrance examination?”","The national joint examination wasn’t considered a college entrance examination. Unlike the college entrance examination, the joint examination results could be regarded as a guaranteed result, but it didn’t affect the participation of the college entrance examination.","If Qiao Nian wanted to take the college entrance examination, she could still take it.","It was up to her.","Qiao Nian raised her hand and tugged at the brim of her hat. Her fingers were a little cold as she replied casually, “I want to take the college entrance examination, but I’m still going to university. My major will never change.”","“You told Principal Liang?”","With Qiao Nian’s results, no school could bear to let her go easily. He had a good relationship with Liang Conglin and knew very well that he was a person who loved money as much as his life. He wouldn’t let a student like Qiao Nian off. He must have gone to talk to her personally.","It turned out that the older, the wiser. He guessed correctly.","Qiao Nian nodded and said, “Yes.”","“I knew he wouldn’t let you go.” Master Cheng smiled and said gently, “Qing University is considered a good school in the country. Strictly speaking, I went to Qing University too. They don’t have many courses. After you go to university, come look for me in the Ninth Branch if you can spare some time. Your science results are good, it’ll be a waste if you don’t take the laboratory path!”","Qiao Nian frowned slightly and looked at him with her bright eyes.. She really wanted to say that she might not have time, either."]},{"number":748,"title":"Chapter 748 - Master Wang, Youre Doing a Little Too Much","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Master Cheng was even faster than her. “Don’t be in a hurry to reject me. I’m not saying that I’ll force you to work on bioengineering. I’m just saying that you can come over and follow me when you have the time. What if you’re interested in this later... right?”","Since he had said so, Qiao Nian couldn’t reject him anymore. If she rejected him again, she would be insensible. She raised her hand helplessly and said, “I’ll try my best.”","“It’s a deal, then.”","Master Cheng smiled and was quite happy. Coincidentally, the results of the experimental reactor were out. He asked a few people beside him to record the data. After he was done, he would take time to get Qiao Nian to perform acupuncture on him.","Acupuncture was quite time-consuming.","Yesterday, Qiao Nian spent more than four hours finishing it.","He was a little better than yesterday. It took him more than two hours to wake up.","Qiao Nian removed the needles from his acupuncture points one by one and put them away in her bag. Then, she chatted with Master Cheng for a while.","The group of them walked out of the Ninth Branch.","Bo Jingxing had other things to do. He chatted with them for a while before leaving. On the way back, only Qiao Nian, Ye Wangchuan, Chen Zhu, and Gu San were left.","Chen Zhu was walking side by side with Qiao Nian at first.","As they walked, Ye Wangchuan found an opportunity to put his arm around her back and gradually pulled away from the two people in front.","The temperature in Beijing had been quite low for the past two days, but Ye Wangchuan was wearing a thin jacket. He was tall and handsome in a long trench coat.","He slowed down and walked with the girl. His thin lips were curved from beginning to end, and it could be seen that he was in a good mood.","Halfway through, he suddenly stopped and asked the girl who stopped with him, “Are you cold?”","“Huh?” Qiao Nian blinked. Her eyelashes were long and curly, looking extremely good.","Ye Wangchuan naturally picked up her hand and touched it. He smiled again, his eyes bright and dazzling. “Tsk, your fingertips are a little cold.”","As he spoke, he took off the scarf around his neck. He lowered his head and carefully wrapped it around the girl’s neck until it was wrapped tightly. Then, he raised his hand and rubbed her hair. His tone was filled with restrained love as he spoke. “Have you eaten the breakfast I got Gu San to bring you in the morning?”","Half of Qiao Nian’s face was wrapped in a scarf, only revealing a pair of beautiful eyes. It was obvious that she was a little stunned by his series of actions. She frowned, but she did not dodge. Her white skin looked even whiter under the dark scarf. It was the white color of porcelain.","“Yes, I did. The shrimp dumplings taste good. You bought them at the Imperial Mansion?”","Seeing that she did not dodge, Ye Wangchuan reached out and rubbed her head again. His thin lips curled up seductively. “I went to the queue at 6:30 in the morning.”","This time, Qiao Nian finally avoided it. After avoiding it, she said impatiently, “Master Wang, do you still need to queue?”","How could she remember that Qin Si had inadvertently revealed that Ye Wangchuan was one of the behind-the-scenes bosses of the Imperial Mansion? Why did bosses have to queue to buy their own things?","This question made Ye Wangchuan raise his eyebrows and look straight at her. Their eyes met and he smiled again. His voice was low and charming like a cannon. “Before I came, I remembered that their breakfast tasted good. You haven’t eaten yet, so I drove over at the last minute. Because it was too sudden, the kitchen didn’t prepare anything.. I waited there for an hour.”"]},{"number":749,"title":"Chapter 749 - Met Miss Qiao a Few Times","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","“...” Qiao Nian didn’t expect him to really wait in line for an hour just to buy breakfast in the Imperial Mansion.","In her daze, her left hand was pulled up again.","His broad hand held her hand, his rough fingers pinching her fingertips. It was itchy and dry as if she had been electrocuted.","She looked up and, before she could frown, she heard the man’s deep and hoarse voice. “Heh, there’s finally some warmth.”","Qiao Nian was speechless.","Ye Wangchuan looked at the girl’s frustrated face and said, “Do you want to go out for a walk later?”","“Now?”","Qiao Nian’s attention was diverted; she had forgotten that someone was still holding her hand.","The weather in Beijing in December was quite cold, especially since the temperatures had dropped over the past two days. The weather had become even colder, so she was unwilling to go out.","“Not really...” She didn’t finish her sentence.","Ye Wangchuan said in a low voice, “I’ll make you hot pot tonight, but there are no ingredients in the fridge. If you want to eat, go out and buy some. Want some?”","The tastes in Beijing were generally mild. Qiao Nian herself was at a stage where she didn’t like spicy food.","She had eaten northern flavors all day yesterday and her food was very bland.","When she heard the word hot pot, she was indeed tempted and hesitated.","Ye Wangchuan had made hot pot once before, and the taste was not inferior to those sold outside. Even Jiang Li couldn’t forget it after eating it once.","At the mention of it, Qiao Nian recalled the taste of the hot pot.","She lowered her eyes and thought for less than a minute before coming up with a plan. She looked up at him and said, “Yes!”","“Then, will you go grocery shopping with me?” the man whispered with a smile.","A man who ate others had a short mouth and a soft heart. Qiao Nian had no objections. She shrugged her shoulders and said valiantly, “Yes, where are we going to buy ingredients?”","“There’s a supermarket outside the Ninth Branch. They have fresh food.” Already expecting her to agree, Ye Wangchuan immediately said, “There’s a cold drink shop beside the supermarket. The aloe vera is good. I’ll buy you a cup.”","Qiao Nian raised her eyes and did not reject him.","Following behind them, Gu San watched as his Master Wang took the opportunity to date with just a few words. He even took advantage of Miss Qiao a few times and made skinship with her. Gu San kept smacking his lips behind them with a wooden face and wondered deeply what was wrong with him. Wasn’t a single man looking for trouble by following the couple?!","“Then I’ll drive?”","Since they had agreed to buy things, Ye Wangchuan took out his car key and stopped in front of her.","“I’ll wait for you.” Qiao Nian didn’t have a car. At least, not for the time being in Beijing. When she came over after the college entrance examination, she would ask Aunt Yuan to get her a car. It would be easier to travel.","Ye Wangchuan drove off.","Gu San pulled Chen Zhu and found an excuse to leave.","Qiao Nian waited alone for the time being. While she waited, she played with her phone and game.","She had just opened it when she received a message from Wen Ruxia.","Qiao Nian raised her phone and looked down.","“Big boss Zhui Guang, I heard from Master Nie that you’re not coming to the event? What’s going on? What’s the reason?”","Qiao Nian’s slender fingers tapped the screen as she replied.","[I’m busy.]","It was quite concise.","Wen Ruxia replied after three seconds.","[Okay, I understand. Go busy yourself with your matters first. You can come again next time if you have the chance. By the way, there’s a final assessment at the event.. It mainly assesses the individual abilities of this batch of newcomers. Is it convenient for you? Can you help with the question?]"]},{"number":750,"title":"Chapter 750 - This Zhui Guang Is Quite Powerful","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Qiao Nian frowned and looked at her phone. She didn’t reply immediately.","She didn’t understand why Wen Ruxia asked her to do the question. Wasn’t Nie Mi more suitable?","The next second, Wen Ruxia sent another message.","[This test is mainly aimed at newcomers. You’re the leader of this batch of youngsters. It’s very suitable for you to come up with the question. If Master Nie does it, it’ll inevitably be unfair to masters in other music fields. We thought about it again and again before deciding to choose a question setter from the best of the new generation. I’ve asked Master Nie before, and he also thinks that you’re the most suitable person to be the question setter in China.]","Qiao Nian wasn’t interested in this at all, but Wen Ruxia then sent her a few more messages, probably hoping that she could help.","Wen Ruxia messaged her too frequently.","It was difficult for Qiao Nian to reject her kindness. It was more of a headache from her pestering. She narrowed her eyes and thought for a moment before replying.","[Then, let it be ‘reggae’.]","...","In the Qiao Family’s house.","Half an hour later, Qiao Chen received an internal message from Wei Ling.","“Reggae? Why would it be reggae? Hasn’t reggae music always not been in the mainstream? The final question for a formal event like the concert is actually reggae...”","Qiao Chen bit her lips in an indescribable strangeness. She hadn’t expected the final test of the concert to be an unconventional question like reggae.","Shen Qiongzhi brought her a cup of milk. When she saw that she was talking to Wei Ling on the phone, she gently placed the cup on the table and listened attentively.","“Is this a question from Zhui Guang?” Qiao Chen’s eyes flickered with jealousy. However, compared to Qiao Nian surpassing her, Zhui Guang surpassing her did not make her feel too uncomfortable. She said to Wei Ling on the other end of the line, “I understand, Aunt. I’ll be well prepared.”","With that, she chatted with Wei Ling for a while before hanging up.","Shen Qiongzhi stayed by her side until she finished the call before asking her carefully, “Chen Chen, what did your aunt say? Could there be a change in the music exchange?”","Qiao Chen had been admitted to Qing University, but she had been suppressed by that wild brat. She had long been angry. If something went wrong at the event too, she would be furious.","Fortunately, Qiao Chen didn’t give her the bad news. She put away her phone and replied, “No. There will be an assessment at the end of the concert. After the assessment, it will be to take in a disciple. Aunt called and told me the questions for this assessment.”","“Oh, then I’m relieved.” Shen Qiongzhi heaved a sigh of relief. She recalled the name she had just heard and said with a puzzled expression, “I just heard you talking about Zhui Guang on the phone...”","Qiao Chen didn’t hide anything from her.","“The questions for this test were chased out. She’s quite popular online with many fans. She’s very mysterious and has made a name for herself. Originally, she was invited, but she can’t come because of something. The organizer invited her to set the question.”","Hearing that, Shen Qiongzhi said casually, “Then, this Zhui Guang is quite powerful.”","Qiao Chen didn’t deny her words.","Shen Qiongzhi’s attention was placed on something else. She bent down and picked up the mug to hand it to her. She said with concern, “Don’t take these results too seriously. I don’t think Master Nie thinks much of her as a student. At least, she’s not qualified to participate in the event.”","“Mr. Steven is no worse than Master Nie. Prepare yourself. Perform well at this event. You’ll only be better than her in the future.”","Qiao Chen took the cup from her hand and took a sip of milk calmly. Her face was blurry under the hot milk, but her tone was calm and confident.. “Yes.”"]},{"number":751,"title":"Chapter 751 - Probably Fooling Around Somewhere Again","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Shen Qiongzhi stood beside her and watched her drink milk. She was silent for a while before suddenly mentioning, “Oh, right, Chen Chen. When you saw Qiao Nian today...”","She also knew that Qiao Chen had sent an invitation to Qiao Nian. She had been busy greeting guests the entire day and did not have the energy to notice who had come today or not.","Now that she suddenly remembered, she asked Qiao Chen.","Before she could finish speaking, Qiao Chen slowly put down the mug in her hand. Her gentle eyes looked quite cold. Before she could finish, she said, “She didn’t come.”","“She didn’t come? She...” Shen Qiongzhi subconsciously frowned, not hiding her disgust.","Qiao Chen placed the cup on the coffee table. Her eyes were gentle as she said casually, “I asked her classmate. They said that she applied for a long leave for the school.”","“It’s almost time for the college entrance examination, but she’s still taking leave.”","After Shen Qiongzhi finished speaking, she realized that Qiao Nian didn’t need to take the college entrance examination, unlike Qiao Chen. She could still enter a famous school, and her results were even higher than Qiao Chen’s.","The stifled feeling she had during dinner today surfaced again. She was feeling extremely uncomfortable, but she still had to force herself to look like she didn’t care about this matter as much as Qiao Chen.","“She’s probably fooling around somewhere again!”","Shen Qiongzhi was angry, and her tone was naturally unfriendly. “Isn’t she that kind of person? She can’t stop for a day. If she doesn’t fool around outside, she can’t possibly know Yuan Yongqin and the others.”","Talking about Cheng Feng Corporation and Yuan Yongqin was like a fishbone stabbing into her heart. It made her feel terrible every time she thought of it.","Naturally, she didn’t have a good impression of Qiao Nian. She said coldly, “Just let her be. I want to see how she’ll fare. The Jiang family has never admitted to having a person like her. When we get to Beijing, you’ll have the support of your uncle and the others. If she doesn’t have a backer, that’ll be all. Beijing is filled with crouching tigers and hidden dragons. There are many talented people. When we get to Beijing, she’ll know that Yuan Yongqin is nothing there! She can only dream if she still wants to rely on her relationship with Yuan Yongqin to be able to do whatever she wants in Beijing like in Rao City!”","Qiao Chen didn’t reply, but the corners of her mouth curled up.","Saying nothing was equivalent to admitting it.","Shen Qiongzhi was filled with anger at the mention of Qiao Nian. She simply couldn’t be bothered to think about it and spoke to Qiao Chen, who had her eyes lowered. “By the way, Chen Chen, you should be preparing for that reggae music you mentioned just now. If you can prepare in advance, you must do so in case you suffer.”","“I know, Mom, don’t worry.” Qiao Chen hadn’t clung to her arm for a long time. This time, she rarely held her arm. She smiled gently and said shyly, “Brother Fu helped me find a music teacher. He’s also a top student from the music department at Qing University. He was hired by the Wen family. I’ll discuss it with the teacher and see what he says.”","Shen Qiongzhi felt completely relieved when she heard this. She patted her arm and smiled slightly. “It’s good that you’re confident. I trust you.”","“Mm.”","Qiao Chen restrained the arrogance in her eyes and lowered her eyelashes.","As long as she couldn’t chase after the limelight, she was confident that she wouldn’t lose to anyone. She was definitely going to be in the limelight at this event!","As for going to Beijing in the future, she wasn’t afraid of Qiao Nian.","Qiao Nian was going to the worst Chinese Medicine faculty at Qing University. She was going to major in the Music Department, followed by the Finance Department. Double majors in university were popular majors. It wasn’t certain who would be more outstanding!","...","In Beijing, Ninth Branch.","Qiao Nian had no idea that she would be remembered despite not being in Rao City."]},{"number":752,"title":"Chapter 752 - Sister Nian: I Guessed","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","As the number of acupuncture treatments increased, Master Cheng’s migraine symptoms were not as serious as before. After helping with an acupuncture treatment, coupled with the effects of the small pill, Master Cheng could basically enter a shallow sleep at night. However, he didn’t sleep for long. He only slept for four to five hours a night.","It didn’t seem like much. However, For Master Cheng, who had been sleeping with the help of sleeping pills for a long time, it was already very effective.","It was the last acupuncture session today. Qiao Nian woke up early in the morning to write the prescription. Many balls of paper could be seen on the ground.","When Gu San came in, he saw her sitting on the chair in deep thought with a pen in her mouth. He walked in anxiously and stood beside the girl.","Qiao Nian had just listed a few herbs and was still thinking about how to use them. From the corner of her eye, she saw him coming over and thought that he was looking for her to perform acupuncture on Master Cheng. She leaned back against the chair casually and turned the pen in her beautiful hand. She casually narrowed her eyes and said, “There’s still a while. I’m still writing the prescription.”","Gu San looked at her leisurely appearance. His lips moved, but he didn’t know how to speak. He said in a deep voice, “No, Miss Qiao. I’m not urging you about Master Cheng.”","Qiao Nian could hear the anxiousness in his voice. She put down the pen and turned to look at him. Her dark eyes were beautiful and devilish. “Huh? Is something the matter?”","She was so smart. She could tell at a glance that he was looking for her. It wasn’t appropriate for Gu San to speak. However, the situation was urgent, and he couldn’t care less about being pretentious. He lowered his voice and said, “Miss Qiao, something happened.”","“About the public visitation day?” Qiao Nian’s voice was quite hoarse. She narrowed her eyes and asked calmly.","She remembered that it was the public visitation day of the Ninth Branch. Ye Wangchuan and Bo Jingxing had gone to receive the guests. It seemed like many overseas people were coming.","Gu San had found her at this time not because of Master Cheng, but because of the public visitation day.","Gu San was stunned for a moment and did not seem to react. His face was wooden, and he was in a daze. His eyes were filled with shock. “M-Miss Qiao, how did you know that there’s a public visitation today? I haven’t said anything...”","“I guessed.”","Qiao Nian guessed that she wouldn’t be able to write the prescription in peace, so she simply closed the lid of the pen and stuck it in the pen holder. She crossed her arms in the posture of a big boss before turning around to face him. “Tell me, what’s the matter?”","Gu San had never seen such a smart person. His mouth was agape, and his chin almost fell off.","He returned to his senses after a few seconds. Anxiety covered his face again as he said impatiently, “It’s the USB. There’s a problem with the programming you gave Leader Luo...”","“Impossible.” Qiao Nian narrowed her eyes. This was her first reaction.","Seeing that Gu San did not speak, she explained slowly, “I’ve checked it. There’s no problem.”","She usually didn’t check her programming, but this time was an exception. After all, she was helping them. She had especially read it after she finished writing the programming the other day.","She would believe anything Gu San said. However, there couldn’t be any problems with the programming.","“It’s true, Miss Qiao.” Of course, Gu San believed her. It was just that the situation was urgent, and he could only shorten the story on Luo Qing’s end. “I don’t know why the USB drive you gave Luo Qing suddenly stopped halfway through the procedures, and there was even a mess of codes. Leader Luo and the members of Team 1 have tried many times.. It’s always like this. It becomes a mess halfway through...”"]},{"number":753,"title":"Chapter 753 - Somethings Wrong With the USB","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Typically, a completed program wouldn’t have a cartoon error halfway through unless the program had a loophole that hadn’t been resolved.","“Today is the public visitation day of the Ninth Branch, and many foreign guests have come. The driverless system is the main show of contents for this public visitation day. It has been arranged for the finale to be introduced to everyone. Master Wang and Young Master Bo are not here, and Leader Luo doesn’t know what to do either...”","No one had expected such a sudden situation to occur. Everyone was caught off guard. The technical team was now feeling anxious. Some people had already gone to look for Zhou Wei, hoping that she could resolve this bug.","He and Luo Qing trusted Qiao Nian more, so he rushed over to look for her. Gu San was actually very anxious, but he couldn’t put too much pressure on her in front of the girl. Trying not to look so anxious, he said, “Miss Qiao, are you free? Why don’t you go over and take a look?”","...","At the same time, on Luo Qing’s side.","A man with dark skin and a scar on his face was sitting in front of a computer. His fingers were typing rapidly.","Luo Qing was beside him, staring at the computer screen.","Looking at the data update and seeing the scar-faced man hit the enter key, he immediately placed his hands on the table and asked in a low voice, “How is it?”","The man with the scar stared at the computer screen and did not speak at first. When the program was halfway done and the screen flashed with code, his expression instantly turned ugly. He shook his head and said with a serious expression, “Boss, I still can’t do it.”","“Damn it!”","Luo Qing’s fist hit the table, causing a cup to bounce up and almost drop to the ground.","“How could this be? It was fine at first...” His face was also dark as he lost his temper.","The atmosphere in the room was bad.","No one in Team 1 spoke.","Everyone was quite anxious.","However, the procedures that even Liao Xu couldn’t handle weren’t as good as theirs. No one dared to go forward and embarrass themselves.","On this public visitation day, the technical team’s driverless system was the key. Everyone was filled with hope and prepared to showcase it to the overseas guests.","Their hopes were dashed. If the system didn’t perform well, they might embarrass themselves. It wouldn’t be good for anyone.","Liao Xu tried again. It was still the same old problem. Whenever the program was running, there would be a mess of flashing screens. Sometimes, the screens would turn black and jump back.","The scar on his face looked quite scary. When he pulled a face, it looked even more frightening. Only he dared to speak to Luo Qing at this moment. “Boss, it looks like there’s a virus.”","“Virus? How could it have a virus?” Luo Qing was stunned.","It was a matter of glory and loss, but someone was still making sarcastic remarks.","“What virus? I think it’s just a programming bug. This situation happened because there were loopholes in the program from the beginning. How could that source code be so easy to fix? We worked overtime for three months and still couldn’t do it. A high school student who hasn’t even grown a hair yet solved the loophole in the source code in a day. There was a problem from the beginning. See, something happened.”","The person who spoke was not one of Luo Qing’s subordinates. It was from Team 2, where Zhou Wei was.","At this moment, he wasn’t thinking of solving the problem but was still dividing the responsibility.","Before Luo Qing could speak, Liao Xu couldn’t stand it anymore and said, “I already said that there must be a virus. Is there a problem with the program? On the first day, we all saw it when the boss brought the USB.. The program in the USB flash drive Miss Qiao gave us operated fine, which means that the programming was fine.”"]},{"number":754,"title":"Chapter 754 - Who Are You Waiting for?","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","The person from Team 2 was not polite. “Sure. You said that the programming she gave was fine and that this is happening because of a virus. We have to resolve the virus now, right? Deal with it first.”","“You...” Liao Xu was so angry that the scar on his face twitched.","He wouldn’t have sat in front of the computer for so long if he had a way to resolve this virus.","Although he was certain that it was because of a virus, the other party’s virus was very advanced. His current ability couldn’t resolve the virus in the USB drive.","The other team members pressed his shoulders to stop him from being angry.","Luo Qing raised his wrist to look at the time, and the anxiousness in his eyes increased. He didn’t care about the argument in the house and asked anxiously, “Team Leader Zhou isn’t here yet?”","In 20 minutes, it was their turn to showcase the driverless operating system.","Now, there was a problem with the system.","The most powerful person in this aspect was Zhou Wei.","Since Liao Xu couldn’t resolve it, he could only depend on Zhou Wei.","Therefore, he was quite anxious.","At this moment, someone jogged in and said unevenly, “Team Leader Luo, Team Leader Zhou said that she’s still held back and can’t come over. She told you to think of a way yourself.”","With that, the entire room fell silent.","The veins on Luo Qing’s temples bulged. He didn’t expect Zhou Wei to not come at this time.","Wasn’t this embarrassing the entire Ninth Branch?!","His eyes darkened as he almost fainted from anger.","Fortunately, he had sharp eyes and agile hands and held the table to prevent himself from being angered to death by Zhou Wei’s coquettish actions.","Liao Xu didn’t expect Zhou Wei to not come, either. He was stunned for a moment and subconsciously looked at Luo Qing with a worried expression. “Boss, what should we do?”","Everyone knew that Zhou Wei was the best at this aspect in the Ninth Branch. Zhou Wei had always been monitoring the driverless system.","If Zhou Wei didn’t come, they might not be able to clean up the mess today.","Luo Qing’s mind was blank. It was like his throat was blocked with cotton. He was furious at Zhou Wei, but he couldn’t think of a good solution.","Liao Xu and Chen Zhu had already prepared for the worst. They asked him, “Why don’t you tell Master Wang?”","Luo Qing thought about how Gu San had not returned yet and looked at the time on his watch. His eyes darkened. “Wait a while more.”","“?”","At this moment, no one knew who he was talking about.","The fire was already burning, why was he still waiting??","No one spoke. Everyone looked at each other and exchanged glances. No one knew who Luo Qing was waiting for.","It was only when Qiao Nian and Gu San appeared that Liao Xu, Chen Zhu, and the others knew who he had been waiting for.","Qiao Nian!","Liao Xu almost heaved a sigh of relief. For some reason, he calmed down a lot.","He was one of the few people who had seen Qiao Nian’s skills with Luo Qing in Rao City. He personally recognized Qiao Nian’s level.","As soon as Qiao Nian entered, he gave up his seat and greeted her. “Miss Qiao.”","As long as it was someone led by Luo Qing, Team 1 was basically polite to Qiao Nian.","Only the people from Team 2—Zhou Wei, in particular—looked disapproving and disdainful when they saw Qiao Nian.","The girl walked in from outside and did not care about the others’ gazes. She walked straight to Luo Qing and said simply, “I heard that a bug appeared in the programming?”","“Miss Qiao, you’re here.” When Luo Qing saw her coming, he had the same reaction as Liao Xu and heaved a sigh of relief. He led her to the computer Liao Xu had used previously and suppressed his anxiousness. “Yes, the code will always mess up halfway. This has never happened before.”","“Let me see.”","The girl didn’t waste her breath and spoke simply."]},{"number":755,"title":"Chapter 755 - If a Dog Has IQ","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Qiao Nian walked over and sat in Liao Xu’s seat. She typed on the keyboard with her fair fingers and looked at the screen with a deep gaze.","Luo Qing and the others held their breaths, waiting for her results.","After waiting for three minutes, Luo Qing couldn’t wait any longer. He leaned forward and asked in a low voice, “Miss Qiao, how is it? Can it be resolved?”","“There’s a virus.”","Qiao Nian’s hands left the keyboard and she leaned back against the chair with a convincing aura.","Her explanation was the same as Liao Xu’s. They both said that it was a virus.","When the people from Team 2 heard the word “virus,” they snorted disdainfully and thought nothing of it.","“What virus? There’s clearly a problem with the programming in the USB drive you gave. Why must you push the blame to the virus?”","The person who spoke was from Zhou Wei’s team.","Gu San immediately raised his eyebrows and was about to flare up.","The girl leaning against the back of the chair raised her eyebrows slightly and glanced at him with her dark eyes. Her tone was soothing and casual. “If a dog has IQ, it can’t even say what you just said.”","If a dog had IQ...","At first, the people in the house did not react. When they thought about it carefully, they couldn’t help but laugh.","Especially those from Team 1, they laughed ruthlessly.","After being rebuked, the man did not react immediately. When he heard the mockery around him, he realized that Qiao Nian was scolding him. His face instantly turned green and white as he pointed at her anxiously. “You...”","Before he could finish, Luo Qing’s face darkened. He glanced at him with a cold gaze and scolded him rudely. “What time is it? Why are you still arguing here? Are you able to do a better job?”","Liao Xu’s skills were only worse than Zhou Wei’s in the technical department. He was better than everyone else.","How could the man resolve a bug that even Liao Xu couldn’t?","Luo Qing’s gaze swept across his frozen face, cold as the winter ice. “If you can’t, shut your mouth. Stop f*cking talking!”","With that, he didn’t care if he was being too disrespectful to Zhou Wei’s people. He turned around and looked at the girl sitting there with an anxious expression. He asked in a low voice, “Miss Qiao, can this virus be resolved?”","“Wait, let me see.”","Qiao Nian took out the coder and connected it to the computer. She typed on the keyboard and tried to pull up the program.","Luo Qing, Gu San, and the others waited beside her with bated breaths.","Three minutes later, she looked up. Her skin was smooth and white, and her eyes were dark and bright. Her aura was inexplicably calm. “It can be resolved.”","“Phew...” Luo Qing suddenly gasped, his tense face relaxing a little. He asked, “That’s good. How long will it take?”","Qiao Nian’s long fingers typed on the keyboard. Her eyelashes were slightly raised and her eyes were wild. “About half an hour.”","“Half an hour?”","Luo Qing’s heart, which had just calmed down, rose again. He looked at the phone beside him. Time was pressing, and he didn’t have time to wait for half an hour.","“Can you be faster?”","It was their turn less than fifteen minutes later. He couldn’t wait half an hour.","Qiao Nian saw his anxious expression and did not say anything. She tried again and frowned slightly. She placed her hands on the keyboard and looked up at him. “No, it’ll take half an hour at the earliest.”","Someone from Team 1 couldn’t stay calm.. He stomped his feet and walked back and forth as he clenched his fists and said impatiently, “Boss, what should we do now? It’s only 15 minutes until our turn. We can’t possibly use this USB drive...”"]},{"number":756,"title":"Chapter 756 - Sister Nian: Why Dont I Go Up?","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","According to the original plan, Luo Qing should take the USB drive to the conference room and show the driverless operating system in front of the nine overseas research organizations.","But now, everything was ruined.","The USB was useless. Even if Luo Qing braced himself and showed it in front of many overseas researchers, he would still lose face.","Luo Qing also understood this logic. He gritted his teeth and scratched his head in frustration. “Nothing seems to work. I can’t possibly not bring the USB drive up.”","Liao Xu, Chen Zhu, and the others fell silent.","Especially Liao Xu. He stood rooted to the ground and was unable to speak for a long time. He was probably blaming himself. The scar on his face was red from holding it in. He walked to the side and punched the wall. Then, he hugged his head and said in a muffled voice, “It’s all my fault. If I had solved the bug earlier, it wouldn’t have ended up like this.”","Gu San placed his hand on his shoulder and comforted him silently. “Liao Xu, don’t be like this. No one wanted it to turn out like this.”","“But...” Liao Xu’s eyes were red. It could be seen how much he blamed himself.","Luo Qing hit the table again in frustration. He took out his phone and wondered if he should report this to Ye Wangchuan.","Until the last moment, he was really unwilling to tell Master Wang that something had happened in the technical department.","Clearly...","They had clearly succeeded in creating driverless technologies overseas that could prove their country’s level of technology.","In the end, it turned out like this.","If he had known that this would happen, he might as well not have set this process. There was no need to embarrass himself like this.","Qiao Nian remained silent as she typed on the keyboard silently to clean the trojan horse virus on the programming software. She hit the last enter key, and the computer began to automatically disintegrate the trojan horse...","She then moved her hands away from the keyboard and leaned back in her chair. She glanced at the serious-looking crowd and narrowed her eyes. Suddenly, she turned to the tall and burly man.","“Should I go up?”","“Miss Qiao?” Luo Qing was stunned for a moment and did not react.","Gu San was also stunned for a moment. He reacted faster than him. When he heard that Qiao Nian was willing to replace Luo Qing, his first reaction was of surprise. Then, he became worried and concerned. “Miss Qiao, you... you want to demonstrate the driverless system on Team Leader Luo’s behalf?”","“Can’t I?”","“It’s not impossible...”","This was quite a big matter.","The people of the Ninth Branch placed great importance on this.","There was no need for Qiao Nian to do this.","After all, if this went wrong, Qiao Nian would be the one in trouble.","Gu San was still on Qiao Nian’s side. Of course, he didn’t want her to get involved in this.","On the one hand, he hoped that Qiao Nian could go. After all, he knew very well how capable she was. If Miss Qiao was willing to go on Luo Qing’s behalf, she might be able to resolve this matter successfully.","“I’m just afraid...”","“There’s nothing to be afraid of.” Qiao Nian was quite calm. She said calmly, “Don’t worry, I wrote this program. I won’t panic if I go up. Also, I can stall for time to resolve the trojan horse on the USB.","“Or, can you find a second person who can resolve the trojan horse virus?”","When this was said, Gu San stopped talking.","Because he couldn’t!","Other than Qiao Nian, no other person could resolve this trojan horse virus!","The method Qiao Nian suggested was the only way.","Luo Qing was also unusually silent. He and Liao Xu looked at each other in dismay.. He hoped that she could resolve this matter successfully, but he was also worried that she would be implicated."]},{"number":757,"title":"Chapter 757 - A Simple Manual","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","After quickly weighing the pros and cons, he looked up and seemed to have made up his mind. He looked at Qiao Nian with a deep gaze. “But Miss Qiao, you don’t know the contents of the speech... There’s so much time. Even if you can resolve the trojan horse virus, you don’t have a script...”","Qiao Nian didn’t know what to say when she went up. She had never done a PowerPoint before, so she didn’t know the procedure at all.","The girl wasn’t wearing a cap today. Her facial features were exquisite and bright, making her extremely eye-catching.","Hearing this, she only raised her eyes slightly and stared at him with her beautiful black eyes. When their eyes met, he felt inexplicably relieved.","“Do you have a script?”","Luo Qing paused for a moment and returned to his senses. His brows were tightly furrowed. “I do, but not really either. I only have a simple manuscript.”","He had originally wanted to go on stage without a script, but he didn’t have the complete version of the script. He only printed out the important content and sorted out a simple script.","Even the simplified version had more than ten pages.","It was filled with professional terms.","There were also many foreign languages.","Qiao Nian didn’t waste her breath and said simply, “Let me see.”","“Now?” Luo Qing asked. He took a deep breath, then searched for the script and handed it to Qiao Nian.","“This is it. This is just a simple version.”","Qiao Nian took the script and began to flip through the pages. The light shone on the side of her face as if there was a faint layer of light.","For the next ten minutes, everyone in the room watched as she flipped another page every two minutes.","She was so fast that it was as if she wasn’t reading a scientific research report with obscure words, but a comic book.","It almost seemed like she read ten lines with every glance...","As time passed, 10 minutes later, the girl finished flipping through the last page of the manuscript. She looked up and said to Luo Qing with a cold expression, “I’m done reading. I’ll go up in your place later.”","“...Miss Qiao.” Luo Qing had a lot to say, but he could only call out her name dryly.","How could he let Qiao Nian be his scapegoat?","Qiao Nian thought that he was worried that she would mess things up. She held the script and stood up, then said calmly, “Don’t worry. I know the procedure after I read your script. I shouldn’t mess it up...”","Luo Qing wasn’t afraid that she would mess things up.","She turned her head and asked Chen Zhu, “Is it almost time?”","Chen Zhu looked at the time, “There are still three minutes.”","Qiao Nian took off the USB drive on the computer. Her exquisite eyes were cold and dry as she said in a low and hoarse voice, “Let’s go.”","She walked in front while Chen Zhu led the way.","The people in Team 2 didn’t expect her to really dare to replace Luo Qing to show the driverless system to the overseas researchers. Furthermore, she only looked at the script for 10 minutes and was holding a USB flash drive without having resolved the trojan horse. She still dared to go up...","Someone looked at her back in a daze and couldn’t help but whisper, “Can she do it?”","Qiao Nian had stepped forward bravely for the technical department this time. Luo Qing couldn’t describe the emotions surging in his chest. When he heard someone from the second team gossiping, his expression darkened and he said coldly, “No, but I didn’t see Zhou Wei either! What’s there to talk about? Go ahead if you’re capable!”","...","In the Ninth Branch conference room.","It was the intermission. Someone came in to serve tea.","Around twenty blond and blue-eyed experts were taking advantage of this time to discuss the insights of the original nucleus experiment that the master had just demonstrated."]},{"number":758,"title":"Chapter 758 - Is The Doctorate of the Ninth Branch So Young?","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Bo Jingxing was sitting on one side of the circular conference table. He was wearing gold-rimmed glasses and looked refined and handsome.","However, only those who had seen him before knew if he was really gentle and handsome under that gentle facade.","He had just taken off his glasses and placed them on the table when he saw a person jogging in. She slipped to his seat and whispered to him.","Two minutes later, that person went out quietly again.","Bo Jingxing put away his relaxed laziness and leaned against the leather chair with a splitting headache. He turned around and whispered to the man who was drinking tea, “Something happened.”","Ye Wangchuan was wearing a formal suit, which was a rare thing. He was wearing a white shirt and a silver-gray suit. The buttons on his jacket were buttoned up to the top of his collar meticulously. He looked expensive and abstinent. However, the man’s face, which was filled with trouble, did not seem abstinent at all. His eyes were so beautiful that they jumped up, making him look sexy and charming.","Hearing this, he didn’t even raise his eyebrows. He was lazy and calm as he leaned back in the chair, not even taking his eyes off the cup of tea. “Huh? What is it?”","Bo Jingxing was stunned for a second.","He slowly came back to his senses and smacked his lips.","There was a saying in Beijing that the color of the sky and the water were not as beautiful as Young Master Ye’s!","With Ye Wangchuan’s dignified appearance, it was no wonder that such words had come out of Beijing.","However, this was not the time to think about it. He recalled the news he had just received and said with a headache, “There’s a bug in the USB drive Qiao Nian gave Luo Qing. It can’t be used anymore. Liao Xu can’t fix it, either. The technical department said that if Luo Qing doesn’t come up later, they’ll send someone else...”","Zhou Wei couldn’t come. If Luo Qing didn’t come up, he couldn’t think of anyone else who could replace Luo Qing. Was it Liao Xu from Team 1?","A figure appeared in Ye Wangchuan’s mind. He narrowed his eyes and asked, “Who’s going up?”","The meeting room suddenly fell silent.","Everyone seemed to be looking at the door.","The girl didn’t wear a cap today, but she was still wearing her favorite hoodie. The black hoodie didn’t have any additional flower prints, and the simple design gave off a wild and mysterious feeling.","“Qiao Nian?” Bo Jingxing was stunned for a second when he saw her. He asked in disbelief, “Why is it her?”","Was Luo Qing talking about Qiao Nian?","It was too ridiculous!","What was the technical department doing?","Ye Wangchuan seemed to have sensed something as he looked in the girl’s direction. He happened to meet the girl’s gaze. It was only a glance, but he inexplicably felt good. His thin lips curled up and his eyes narrowed. He was quite protective of her. “Why can’t it be her?”","Bo Jingxing was speechless.","Why couldn’t it be her? Why couldn’t it be her? Wasn’t the reason obvious?","He admitted that Qiao Nian was very powerful and had extraordinary talent in programming. However, this time, all the people who came were authoritative overseas researchers. Driverless technology was their finale. Luo Qing and Zhou Wei had studied it the entire time. Qiao Nian had only helped with the bug in the programming source code. Wasn’t it a joke to let her replace Luo Qing?","Anyone from the technical department should be more suitable than Qiao Nian.","Before Bo Jingxing had the chance to say this, an overseas expert turned around and asked with interest, “Is your doctorate that young?”"]},{"number":759,"title":"Chapter 759 - If She Isnt a Doctorate, Is She a Masters?","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","The person who spoke was an expert from MPG, an overseas research organization. He was very famous internationally. There was no malice in his blue eyes. He was just curious about Qiao Nian.","Bo Jingxing couldn’t answer for a moment.","“She...” He was about to say that Qiao Nian was not from the Ninth Branch.","Unexpectedly, Ye Wangchuan walked past him and narrowed his eyes. He looked elegant and lazy. His voice was clear and melodious, and there was a hint of arrogance in it. “She’s a newcomer to our Ninth Branch this year, not a doctorate’s.”","“Not a doctorate’s?” The blond middle-aged man was stunned. He looked at the girl on the stage and turned to look at him with interest. “Oh, no wonder. I was wondering why she looked so young. Which university is she from?”","The Ninth Branch was the top research institute in the country. Any one of them would have a doctorate degree.","A master’s degree was the worst level that the other party could think of.","Who knew.","Ye Wangchuan smiled and placed his hand on the conference table. He looked at the girl walking up the stage and smiled. “No, she doesn’t have a master’s degree either.”","“...Not a master’s degree?” The person looked at Qiao Nian’s overly young face and pondered for a moment. Although it was a little unbelievable, he still asked, “Is she a university student?","“Qing University?","“Nanjing University?”","The other party only knew these two universities in the country and did not know much about the other schools.","Ye Wangchuan raised his eyes. His eyes were deep as he looked at him and said something that shocked all the overseas experts.","“No. She’s in her third year of high school and has not gone to university yet.”","The experts of MGP and MIT, two of the top overseas organizations, were silent. They looked at each other and did not understand what the Ninth Branch was doing.","For such a top-notch academic conference, why did the Ninth Branch find a high school student?","Bo Jingxing could see that the atmosphere in the meeting room had become strange. The twenty-plus experts looked at each other in confusion.","His temples twitched violently a few times as he lowered his voice. “Wangchuan, what are you doing? Don’t tell me you’re really going to let Qiao Nian speak on Luo Qing’s behalf?”","“Why not?” The man with narrowed eyes looked calm. He leaned against the back of the chair. His relaxed appearance showed that he wasn’t worried at all.","He wasn’t worried about Qiao Nian replacing Luo Qing at all.","Bo Jingxing took a deep breath. No matter how deeply he breathed, he couldn’t be as calm as Ye Wangchuan was. He turned his head and looked at the podium.","The girl had already walked to the computer on stage and inserted the USB drive she had brought into the projected computer. When everything was ready, she looked up. Her cold and oppressive face was very eye-catching. Her dark eyes were like stars in the night. Her aura was strong. “Hello, experts. I’m Qiao Nian. I’ll introduce driverless technology to everyone today...”","The girl’s voice reverberated in the conference room on the stairs. It was a clear and hoarse voice that inexplicably caught people’s attention.","Bo Jingxing was originally restless, but now, he couldn’t help but turn his attention to the girl on the stage and was inexplicably attracted to her.","Qiao Nian bent her legs. The legs wrapped in her jeans were straight and long. She bent down, operated the mouse with one hand, and typed the keyboard with the other hand skillfully.. Without looking up, she said slowly in a slightly cold tone, “Before demonstrating the driverless operating system, I’ll show everyone how to resolve the Lizard Tail virus.”"]},{"number":760,"title":"Chapter 760 - Sister Nian, Your Identity Has Fallen","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Her light words were like a heavy bomb thrown into the calm lake.","The meeting room exploded.","“Lizard Tail virus? Could it be the legendary trojan horse virus?”","“I’ve heard of this virus before. It’s said to be one of the trojan horses that the Red Alliance created back then. This trojan horse virus will infect the system library documents, replace system documents, and even inject the system process and steal user information.”","Someone explained as if he knew everything. “At that time, this trojan horse virus caused a huge commotion the moment it was released. However, for some reason, the Red Alliance cleaned up this virus later on and did not let it spread widely. This is a virus unique to the Red Alliance, right? I heard that no one has been able to resolve it yet.”","“This kind of trojan horse program seems to be very well-hidden. Many computers that are infected can’t detect it. They think there’s a problem with the program.”","“I think so. I didn’t expect to see a solution today.”","...","This was the first time Bo Jingxing had heard of the name Lizard Tail. Seeing the reactions of the experts from the various fields around him, he more or less had an idea when he heard about the Red Alliance. He frowned and said to the man beside him in a serious tone, “Lizard Tail virus? Why is there such a virus in the USB?”","Previously, Luo Qing had sent someone to tell him the rough situation. He only knew that there was a problem with the USB flash drive and that Luo Qing couldn’t resolve it, so he had gotten someone else to replace him.","From the looks of it, someone had implanted a virus in the USB. Luo Qing and Liao Xu couldn’t resolve it, so they got Qiao Nian to solve it.","“This belongs to the Red Alliance?” Bo Jingxing’s handsome face couldn’t hide his worry. He looked at the girl on the stage and asked, “Can Sister Qiao do it?”","He didn’t know anything about the Lizard Tail virus, but according to the experts, there was no way to resolve it.","“Why don’t...” His gaze turned to the man in a rare suit, and he was about to say something.","Ye Wangchuan’s eyes were as deep as the ocean as he interrupted him. “Wait a little longer.”","“...” Bo Jingxing didn’t understand what he was waiting for.","The smile on Ye Wangchuan’s lips became even more unrestrained and his eyes deepened. “Others can’t resolve the Lizard Tail virus, but maybe she can.”","Bo Jingxing didn’t understand what he meant. “If others can’t, are you sure Sister Qiao can?”","“Because...” Ye Wangchuan suddenly stopped talking.","His gaze landed on the girl on the stage with a faint smile.","He was quite lazy and extremely protective.","He realized that Qiao Nian seemed to know everything in the Red Alliance and was very familiar with it.","Since this virus was developed by the Red Alliance, it was very likely that Qiao Nian knew about it. If she said she could resolve it, then she could.","If Qiao Nian could resolve the trojan horse virus in this Lizard Tail, the answer he had been guessing but could not confirm would be confirmed.","Ye Wangchuan couldn’t help but smile when he thought about how he seemed to have discovered another secret of hers.","When Bo Jingxing saw that he could still laugh under such circumstances, he retracted his gaze gloomily and did not want to look at him. He turned his head and locked his gaze on the girl on the stage. His heart was suspended in midair, and his back became tense...","Other than the virus from the Red Alliance that came out of nowhere, he was also worried about something else. Luo Qing’s speech was very complicated.","He had helped him read it before.. There were at least ten pages of content, and there was no lack of obscure words. Could Qiao Nian really replace Luo Qing at the last minute?"]},{"number":761,"title":"Chapter 761 - Why Would There Be a Virus From the Red Alliance in the Ninth Branch?","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","The facts of the matter far exceeded his imagination.","Over the next one hour, Qiao Nian’s performance on stage was perfect.","It only took her twenty minutes to get rid of the trojan horse in the USB flash drive.","Then, she took a piece of chalk and began talking to more than two dozen top domestic and foreign experts. She carefully explained the driverless driving technology combined with the 3D model on the USB flash drive.","There was a part he was worried about.","For example, Qiao Nian used extremely rare words related to professional fields with great precision. It was as if she had participated in the development and research of this project throughout the process.","“Driverless technology has been studied in China since the 1980s. Hongqi HQ3 is controlled by a computer system throughout the journey. The speed and direction of the vehicle are controlled by a computer system, and the maximum speed set by the system is 110km/h. During the experiment, the measured average speed of autonomous driving throughout the journey was 87km/h.”","Bo Jingxing leaned back in his chair blankly. He watched her present on the stage, with her bright red lips moving. One after another, precise measurement numbers came out of her mouth.","She held the chalk while facing diagonally to the audience, occasionally writing down one or two formulas on the blackboard.","She also used the chalk to point at the 3D operation model on the projection.","The operation model which had been studied by the Ninth Branch for the past couple of years was simple and clear in her hands. Qiao Nian’s tone never changed from the beginning. It was the kind of causal voice that slowly explained the unmanned operation technology developed domestically to the foreign experts.","So concise!","So cool and unbelievable!","The calm aura was so powerful, exactly the same as someone they knew!","Outside the conference room, basically everyone from the Ninth Branch was present.","However, they couldn’t enter. Therefore, they could only peek through the gap in the door and try to get some details on what was happening inside.","“How is it?”","Gu San was looking at the situation inside. Luo Qing walked back and forth beside him, asking questions from time to time.","Gu San was dumbfounded. He peeked through the door for half an hour before reluctantly reporting the situation to a group of people.","“Miss Qiao got rid of the trojan horse virus in the USB flash drive before the group of experts.”","“Miss Qiao got rid of the virus?” Luo Qing spoke excitedly, and a smile immediately appeared on his face. He couldn’t conceal his joy. “That’s great!”","As long as the virus was gone, everything else would also go more smoothly.","Liao Xu specialized in hacking and viruses. He was more interested in the virus as compared to Luo Qing. He asked, “Did Miss Qiao say what kind of virus it was?”","He was confident he could crack almost all viruses in China. However, he was helpless when faced with the virus in the USB flash drive.","It could be said that he didn’t even scratch that virus’ surface.","Therefore, he wanted to know what kind of virus it was.","Gu San stuttered. He wasn’t very familiar with viruses. He had only briefly heard her mention it. He thought for a long while before replying with uncertainty, “I heard that it is probably a lizard’s tail.”","Liao Xu exclaimed, “Lizard Tail?!”","Gu San’s eyes lit up, and he clapped. “Yes, that’s right. Lizard Tail. I think I heard this name coming from inside the room.”","The scars on Liao Xu’s face jumped up excitedly. He couldn’t hide his excitement. “I didn’t expect the virus to be the Lizard Tail.”","Luo Qing’s expression also changed all of a sudden. He spoke with a complicated expression. “Is that the virus that the Red Alliance made? Why would a virus made by the Red Alliance be on a USB flash drive from the Ninth Branch?”","He was sure that when Qiao Nian gave him the USB flash drive, there were no trojan horses or other viruses in the USB flash drive.","Where did this virus come from?"]},{"number":762,"title":"Chapter 762 - Sister Nian: The Trojan Horse Was Deliberately Planted Into the USB Flash Drive By Someone","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","There was a lot to think about regarding this question. Although he had a list of suspects in his mind, it wouldn’t be good for him to voice it out loud.","Luo Qing didn’t want to think too deeply. He shook his head, looked at Gu San again, and solemnly asked, “By the way, what about her presentation?”","It was still fine before he brought up this matter. However, after he mentioned it, Gu San showed an expression of amazement. It was as if he was excited and as if he had been stunned. It was simply too complicated.","Facing the eagerness of everyone from the Ninth Branch, he turned his eyes and touched his lips. His voice was uncontrollably dry as he said, “Miss Qiao...”","Seeing his expression, everyone held their breaths anxiously.","Luo Qing was tempted to pry his mouth open to make him speak faster. He asked hurriedly, “How is Miss Qiao doing? Did she fail?”","Qiao Nian’s failure was within his expectations.","Unmanned operation technology involved many aspects. It also required a lot of professional knowledge, as well as knowledge in the field of mathematics and physics.","Qiao Nian hadn’t passed the College Entrance Examination yet.","Advanced mathematics and physics were only taught in college. Even if Qiao Nian was unfamiliar with certain formulas, it was to be expected.","Furthermore, Qiao Nian went up to present because of him. When Luo Qing thought of this, he calmed down. He showed an expression of acceptance and slowly spoke after thinking for a while. “It doesn’t matter even if Miss Qiao didn’t present well. After all, she was forced to present in such a hurry. She just simply looked at my manuscript. It’s impossible for an ordinary person to remember so many details in such a short time.”","Before he could finish speaking, Gu San’s expression became more and more excited. He looked at him with bright eyes and shook his head. “Team Leader Luo, I didn’t mean it that way.”","“Then, what do you mean? Tell me quickly!”","Luo Qing was very frustrated. “Why are you speaking so slowly? You’re leaving us hanging!”","“I’m not leaving you hanging. I’m just afraid that you guys won’t believe me.”","After Gu San finished speaking, he glanced around at everyone. He pretended to be calm and said, “The manuscript... Miss Qiao has memorized it all!”","Luo Qing was speechless.","Liao Xu was also speechless.","Everyone who had heard Gu San’s words became stunned.","Luo Qing quickly regained his senses. His eyes almost popped out. He grabbed Gu San’s shoulder with an incredible expression on his face. “You said that Miss Qiao memorized the whole script?”","The script was ten pages long!","He hadn’t memorized it himself and planned to take the manuscript up with him. If he didn’t remember something, he could take it out to take another look.","Qiao Nian only had ten minutes to look through the manuscript. It seemed like she only had time to scan and flip through it. However, she actually managed to memorize the whole manuscript?","What kind of memory was this?","This was too amazing!","Gu San nodded and replied with certainty, “Yes, Miss Qiao seems to have memorized the whole script. She even wrote some stuff on the blackboard. She’s presenting the whole thing smoothly.”","The whole presentation was smooth and did not face any problems.","Luo Qing loosened his shoulders and lowered his hands. His mouth opened and closed, but he couldn’t make a sound.","He was completely convinced of her abilities this time!","...","The Ninth Branch’s presentation on driverless technology was unexpectedly smooth. Qiao Nian’s young age and smooth presentation managed to convince the foreign experts.","Furthermore, this time, they not only saw the state-of-the-art driverless technology but also saw the whole process of Qiao Nian cracking the legendary Lizard Tail trojan virus.","Bo Jingxing was responsible for showing her around.","They waited for everyone else to leave.","Luo Qing and everyone else waiting outside walked into the room.","Ye Wangchuan capped the pen, got up, and walked over to Qiao Nian on the podium. She pulled out the USB flash drive. Her eyes were bright and deep. “What’s going on?”","“A trojan horse virus was deliberately implanted into the USB flash drive.”"]},{"number":763,"title":"Chapter 763 - Sister Nian: It Was Actually Very Simple","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","“I’m pretty sure that before I handed the USB flash drive to Team Leader Luo, there was no virus in it. The trojan horse was deliberately implanted in it. One of you did it.” Qiao Nian had no intention of hiding her suspicions. She threw the removed USB flash drive to Luo Qing in front of everyone.","Luo Qing almost missed it, but fortunately, he reacted quickly and managed to catch the USB flash drive. He got the USB flash drive and clenched it tightly. With a stern face, he looked at Qiao Nian seriously and said, “Miss Qiao, is the trojan virus really the Lizard Tail?”","“Yes.” The girl’s eyelashes curled wildly. She held the podium with one hand and leaned by the side. Her expression on her delicate eyebrows and her eyes seemed very casual.","Luo Qing was silent for a moment.","This matter involved the people from the Ninth Branch and the virus from the Red Alliance. There was only one person he could think of—Zhou Wei!","However, Zhou Wei had already put so much effort into developing the driverless technology. He couldn’t understand why she would do this.","How could this benefit her in any way?","Was she not afraid of embarrassing the entire Ninth Branch together with her?","Liao Xu didn’t think so much. He was only thinking about one thing. He looked at the girl on the podium feverishly. He suppressed his excited tone and said, “Miss Qiao, how did you get past the Lizard Tail virus? This is the most powerful trojan horse developed by the Red Alliance. It hasn’t been cracked by anyone before. Even I was helpless in front of this virus. I want to know how you cracked it. Is it convenient for Miss Qiao to tell me?”","An insightful gaze fell on her.","Qiao Nian didn’t need to look to know who it was.","She hadn’t thought about this issue before. She was only concerned about doing Luo Qing a favor. She had just realized that her abilities were exposed.","She had a headache. Frowning, she tried her best to ignore the man’s gaze as she replied slowly, “It’s actually very simple.”","Liao Xu was speechless.","The Lizard Tail virus appeared about five years ago. No one was able to crack it yet. How could it be so simple?","“There’s a bug hidden in the trojan horse program itself. It’s easy to crack if you find the bug. It just takes some time to fix the files.” Qiao Nian spoke casually.","Liao Xu and the others from the Ninth Branch looked like they were listening to the words of a wise man.","There was a bug in the Lizard Tail program?","What the hell?","Was this really the legendary virus developed by the Red Alliance?","However, why did he feel like Miss Qiao was describing this super virus like an unsuccessful product made by a child?","“I don’t understand.” Liao Xu looked at her eagerly. He was tempted to drag Qiao Nian aside and make her explain in detail. “I tried to crack it several times by myself and have not found any bug. Miss Qiao, where is the bug you mentioned? How could I not find it?”","He couldn’t find it. However, Miss Qiao said that it was very easy to find. How could it be possible?","Qiao Nian spoke directly and concisely. “This Lizard Tail is not hard to crack. I will show you later. It’s just a trojan horse with loopholes.”","Her eyebrows didn’t even move. She obviously did not care about Liao Xu and the Lizard Tail virus, although this virus seemed to be regarded as a big deal to the people from the Ninth Branch.","It was normal for Qiao Nian to not care about this “super virus”. A few years ago, she was bored. In addition to playing games, she became interested in programming using the C programming language. In the process, she made many things. These things included the verification system that Luo Qing saw before and the Lizard Tail virus that Liao Xu was talking about now.. These products were merely unfinished products that she made during that time"]},{"number":764,"title":"Chapter 764 - Because This Was Her Half-Finished Product","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Because all these were things that she made while playing around, she didn’t care about them too much and put them on the black market for a while.","Later on, Slim Waist Control informed her that the trojan virus did not make any good impact. The virus could be easily used by people to do bad things, so she removed the code from the internet.","However, after leaving it on the internet for so long, anyone with connections to the Red Alliance would be able to access the virus. Therefore, it was not surprising to see this trojan horse virus in the hands of another person.","“Once you understand the principle behind this virus, you can also crack it by yourself.” Qiao Nian thought for a while and raised her eyes. There was an aura of wildness in her eyebrows. She then said, “It’s not as difficult as you think.”","Liao Xu couldn’t control his excitement and thanked her profusely.","Qiao Nian added his WeChat details and made an appointment with him.","...","On the other hand, Luo Qing was more interested in what she had said. He was stunned for a long time. When he regained his senses, he raised his head with an obscure expression and looked at Ye Wangchuan solemnly. “Master Wang, should we look into this matter?”","The Zhou family could be considered a minor family in Beijing. Furthermore, Zhou Wei’s third uncle, Zhou Hengfeng, was the number one hacker in China.","Zhou Wei was also talented and was from Nanjing University. She was considered the top talent within the younger generation in the technical department.","There had always been a shortage of talents like Zhou Wei in China. This meant that there was also a shortage of talent in the Ninth Branch. If this matter had to be investigated and if Zhou Wei was the one behind this matter, she would have to be punished.","He personally preferred to solve things privately.","It was something that definitely had to be investigated, and the person messing around needed to be held responsible. However, if things blew up too big, it would also hurt the Ninth Branch’s reputation.","Qiao Nian raised her eyelids and looked at the man not far from her. Only then did she notice that Ye Wangchuan was wearing a formal suit today. It was rare to see him dress so seriously. He wore a classic white shirt with a silver-gray suit on the outside. He had a thin figure and a straight posture. He looked very eye-catching.","She glanced at him and saw the blue cufflinks on his cuffs. The blue diamonds were beautifully polished and set in silver support. They looked like crystals. Only Qiao Nian knew that it was a real diamond. She had asked Yuan Yongqin to make it from the rough stone brought back from the illegal district.","She designed it herself.","This was the only design she made that she did not put her personal mark on.","Qiao Nian slowly retracted her gaze, and her eyebrows were cold. She didn’t seem to feel the slightly solemn atmosphere in the conference room as she pulled up the brim of her hoodie and pulled out her cell phone from her pocket. She lowered her eyelids and started to play with her cell phone.","She was only here to take a look at Master Cheng’s condition. This matter was the Ninth Branch’s internal affair. She didn’t care and didn’t want to intervene in their affairs.","Ye Wangchuan knew what she was thinking when he saw her take out her phone and start playing with it. She looked indifferent.","He raised his thin and crimson lips. He seemed to be in a good mood.","Luo Qing assumed that he would share his opinion. Luo Qing thought that he would also prefer to settle the investigation privately.","However, his low voice unexpectedly resounded throughout the conference room.","“Tsk. We must check! Why shouldn’t we? If this person dared to do this, why would the Ninth Branch not investigate this matter?”","“Master Wang.”","Luo Qing raised his head abruptly and looked at him directly.","Looking into Master Wang’s deep eyes, his impatience was obvious to see. It was as if someone had poured cold water on him, and his heart was very cold. Luo Qing already understood that this matter was not going to be investigated privately.. If this matter really had something to do with Zhou Wei, she would definitely have to pay the price this time."]},{"number":765,"title":"Chapter 765 - Zhou Wei Was Being Investigated","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Zhou Wei was from a top hacker family. She had the talent in this area and was very cautious in doing things.","The technical department’s inspection and surveillance cameras weren’t able to find anything useful for the investigation.","Liao Xu only discovered that the surveillance cameras had been hacked after looking through them a second time. His abilities were decent, and after discovering this vulnerability, he immediately tried to recover the surveillance cameras’ data.","However, Zhou Wei was very careful in doing things. Liao Xu looked through the footage of several surveillance cameras but still found no evidence.","It was only when he checked the surveillance footage for the side door of the technical department that he found a piece of evidence.","The picture was taken very clearly.","At 9:10 PM last night, a woman who should have been up appeared outside the technical department. She opened the door with her pass. After sneaking in, she found the USB flash drive that Luo Qing had stored in the drawer and connected it to the computer.","That person was probably afraid of being found out as all the lights were turned off.","However, the white light from the screen illuminated her face clearly.","There was a picture of her side profile.","Everyone recognized the person’s face who sneaked into the technical department and stole Luo Qing’s USB flash drive. It was Zhou Wei!","“Team Leader Zhou?” Chen Zhu was relatively more naive than Luo Qing. He didn’t think about this matter as deeply as him. Chen Zhu didn’t doubt Zhou Wei at all. When he saw that the thief was Zhou Wei, he was dumbfounded. “How could it be her?”","“Why did Team Leader Zhou implant a trojan horse virus in the USB flash drive? Did she not know that a group of overseas experts was coming to visit the Ninth Branch today? Team Leader Luo wanted to show everyone the unmanned operating system. If the system is not available when it is displayed, then...”","The entire Ninth Branch would have been embarrassed!","That wasn’t all. All the domestic experts would also be embarrassed!","After all, the Ninth Branch was representing all the top domestic researchers in presenting their findings to all the foreign experts.","What was Zhou Wei doing?","Chen Zhu stopped speaking halfway. However, everyone present knew what he wanted to say.","This was because what he was about to say was also what everyone was thinking about.","Many people in the technical department could guess why Zhou Wei did this. When Qiao Nian came, she was challenged everywhere. She wasn’t able to get over it and wanted to get revenge.","It was understandable. Everyone could understand why she did it. After all, Zhou Wei had always been considered a gifted person. Her life had always been smooth and she had a high position in the Ninth Branch.","Qiao Nian had caused her to be criticized twice, and she was even forced to apologize to Qiao Nian. It was normal for her to want to do something to get back at her.","However, there was something everyone at the Ninth Branch could not forgive. Although she was embarrassed, how could she ignore the honor of the entire Ninth Branch and the efforts of domestic experts like Master Cheng? No one was able to forgive her for doing something that harmed the reputation of everyone else around her.","In contrast, an outsider like Qiao Nian stood up and replaced Luo Qing to solve the crisis and save the Ninth Branch from shame.","The difference between the two was as clear as day.","All the people from the second group who had once suspected Qiao Nian’s abilities were all silent now. They all had gloomy expressions and looked uncomfortable.","They wanted to apologize, but they didn’t know how to do it.","Liao Xu replayed the surveillance footage. What Zhou Wei did was like a slap to their faces.","They regretted how much they cared for her.","...","Qiao Nian was replying to Qin Si’s message.","Qin Si asked her if she was in Rao City. She was just about to say that she was in Beijing.","Just as she was about to send him a message, Qin Si called her."]},{"number":766,"title":"Chapter 766 - Either the Reception Is Bad or She Doesn’t Want to Pick Up","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios","Editor: Atlas Studios","Qiao Nian looked at the continuous caller ID on her phone and hung up ruthlessly.","Qin Si wasn’t the type to give up easily. He called again immediately after not getting through.","Qiao Nian hung up ruthlessly again.","After the call disconnected.","Qin Si sent a WeChat message.","[Sister Qiao, is the signal on your side bad? You just left the airport?]","Qiao Nian bent her legs and stood there awkwardly. She lowered her eyelashes and looked at his message. Before she could reply, she heard Chen Zhu’s dry voice.","She raised her eyes and saw the face of the woman who had tampered with the USB on the projector Liao Xu was operating.","She raised her eyebrows in frustration.","She did not seem surprised, and she was also nonchalant.","She glanced at it and lowered her head again. Her gaze fell on the phone screen as her fair fingers typed on the keyboard.","[QN: No, it’s not convenient to answer.]","Qin Si replied quickly. Sure enough, a message came the next second.","[????]","A series of question marks seemed to be saying, “Why did you hang up on me if your signal was good?”","Qiao Nian narrowed her eyes and replied.","[QN: I’m busy.)","[Christmas is coming. Do you want to celebrate with your brothers in Beijing? If you come, I’ll call Zhang Yang and the others over. Let’s play together and have fun.)","Christmas?","For some reason, when Qiao Nian heard this, she was in a daze for a moment. She recalled that someone had asked her out in advance about treating her to a meal that day.","When she returned to her senses, she rejected Qin Si’s invitation cleanly.","[QN: No, I have an appointment.]","She had just replied to Qin Si’s message when Ye Lan sent another message. Like Qin Si, it was a message asking her out for a meal.","[Nian Nian, I heard from my little brat that you’re in Beijing. It’s about time. Do you have time to eat together?]","Her reply to Qin Si was quite casual, but she was much more polite with Ye Lan as she rejected her invitation.","Ye Lan did not say anything else and only told her to busy herself. She regretfully said that she would arrange to meet her next time.","Other than Ye Lan, Shen Qingqing had also sent her a message. Qiao Nian opened it and thought that it was something related to her class.","In the end, it was related to Qiao Chen.","When Shen Qingqing said that she had been on leave for more than half a month, Qiao Chen was overjoyed. She seemed to have been accepted as a disciple by an internationally famous pianist. For a time, she was in the limelight.","Qiao Nian wasn’t interested in this. She glanced at it and put away her phone. Then, she said to the man who was still typing, “Take your time. I’ll perform acupuncture on Master Cheng.”","When Ye Wangchuan saw that she was about to leave, he called out to her gently, “Wait.”","Qiao Nian was quite impatient to participate in this kind of thing, but she stopped in her tracks and frowned as she watched him walk back to his seat in the conference room.","He took a bag from there.","Ye Wangchuan took out a red scarf from the bag and walked to her. He lowered his head slightly and wrapped the scarf around the girl naturally. He then took a step back and said with a smile, “It’s cold outside. Don’t catch a cold.”","Several pairs of eyes landed on her. Qiao Nian didn’t say anything. She pulled the scarf around her neck and pursed her lips. Her voice was a little cold. “I’m leaving.”","“Go. I’ll look for you later.” Ye Wangchuan smiled, but his expression was too provocative.","After Qiao Nian left.","He then turned around lazily and narrowed his eyes. He exuded a noble aura from head to toe and was no different from a wealthy gentleman. He casually turned the prayer beads on his wrist, but the end of his eyes was filled with a touch of red that made one’s heart skip a beat.","“Go. Call Zhou Wei over.”","His words were heavy."]},{"number":767,"title":"Chapter 767 - A Loud Scheme","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Zhou Wei was still waiting anxiously, not knowing that she had been captured by the surveillance cameras","She looked up at the clock on the wall.","She couldn’t sit still seeing that almost an hour had passed since Luo Qing sent someone to look for her. The coffee had lost its smell. She put down the cup she was holding and could no longer pretend to be calm. An uneasy feeling surged in her heart. Zhou Wei couldn’t say why she was feeling uneasy, but she couldn’t calm down.","After a short hesitation, she picked up her phone on the table and sent a message to the second team.","A minute passed","No one replied.","Three minutes passed.","Still no one replied. “What’s going on?” Zhou Wei frowned. She looked down at her phone and sent another message unwillingly.","She thought that he would definitely reply to her quickly this time.","In the end, her phone was silent, and there was no response.","Zhou Wei couldn’t sit still. She stood up and held her phone with both hands. She walked to the window again and searched for the group message from Team 2","The earliest group message was still an hour ago.","Team Leader Zhou, when are you coming over? I don’t think Liao Xu and the others can handle the bug in the USB. Liao Xu is so anxious that he’s covered in sweat. He’s almost dying. You must come over soon.] Zhou Wei saw that her reply had been quite calm. No hurry. Wait for a while more.)","Then, someone else sent a message.","[F*ck, Team Leader Luo must be crazy. He really wants that high school student to show the driverless technology to the overseas experts on his behalf. It’s over... the Ninth Branch is going to lose face this time!","There was no new message next.","Zhou Wei rubbed her phone screen anxiously and flipped to the last message.","She had seen Luo Qing asking Qiao Nian to replace him on the stage, but she did not take it to heart. At that time, she was certain that Luo Qing wasn’t bold enough to really ask her to replace him. Therefore, she waited in the room calmly and waited until Luo Qing couldn’t hold it in any more before asking someone to beg her for help...","Unexpectedly, she waited for an hour.","An hour. Did Luo Qing really let Qiao Nian go up? It was too ridiculous!","On this public visitation day, MGP and MIT’s experts were all here. It was very important to the Ninth Branch. Even if Luo Qing dared to let Qiao Nian try, she did not believe that Young Master Bo and the others would let her. Her thoughts were very simple. Once Bo Jingxing interfered, he would definitely only be able to find her in the end. After all, she was the number one person in the nine IT departments.","The bug that Liao Xu couldn’t resolve could only be solved by her.","Then, she could logically showcase her ability and solve the bug on the USB drive to prove herself. At the same time, she could show others that she was the most talented person in the country’s programming industry!","This was Zhou Wei’s plan. Just as she had guessed, Liao Xu couldn’t resolve the trojan horse virus on the USB, and Luo Qing had sent someone to look for her for help..","The problem lay behind.","Zhou Wei frowned and felt even more uneasy. She didn’t understand why no one had looked for her after almost an hour. No one had replied to her messages. Did Qiao Nian really replace Luo Qing?","As soon as this thought surfaced in Zhou Wei’s mind, she couldn’t help but laugh. The corners of her mouth twitched as she muttered to herself, “How is this possible","Just as she finished speaking","Her phone suddenly vibrated.","When she saw Luo Qing’s call, she immediately picked it up in a hurry. Then, she took a deep breath to compose herself and pretended to be calm as she said, “Hello? Team Leader Luo called me for something?”"]},{"number":768,"title":"Chapter 768 - Mentioning the USB","paragraphs":["ome to the stairway conterence rOo.","taway conerenee o0","Zhou Wei knew that this exchange would be in the conference room on the","stairs. It seerned like QJjao Nian had ruined her speech. Luo Yng still needed","her to clean up the mess.","Her eyes tlashed and her lips curled into a mecking smile. She was about to say","that it was inconvenient tor her when the phone rang","Zhou Wel took her phone away and realized that the other party had already","hung up",".Huh?” Her breath was in her throat as she held her phone and sImiled angrily.","ter a short period of anger, zhou Wei slowly calmed down. According to her","proud character in the past, if Luo Yng begged her without giving her face, she","would definitely stand him up!","HOwever, this time, there was an indescribable uneasiness in her heart.","Although 2hou Wei was angry, she stood still and looked at her phone.","No one in Team 2 had eplied to her message.","Everyone pretended not to see their phones.","She bit her lip and hesitated for a moment. Then, she picked up her things and","went out to the place Lato Oine had said..","In the conference room on the stairs, Bo Jingxing had just sent her away and","he had already heard about Zhou Wet’s tricks trom Gu San.","His retined and handsome face was dark as he walked to Ye Wangchuan and","asked in a low volce, “How are you going to handle 2Zhou Wei?”","Deal with it however you want.","This answer was equivalent to not answering","Bo Jingxing felt stitled. He and Luo Qjng had the same thoughts. Both of them","still had concerns about the Zhou farmily. After all, there were too few talents in","the country’s computer industry.","The Zhou tamily was also well-knownm in this area.","Zhou Hengfeng alone was quite famous in the country. After all, it was the","information age. Many things would need the Zhou family’s help in the future.","On the other hand, the Ninth Branch was short on resources and had not","cultivated its own pOWer yet.","He wanted to say something but hesitated. Just as he was about to speak up for","Zhou Wel, he saw from the corner of his eye that Zhou Wei had already arrived","at the door. She was holding a notebook in her hand and looked like she did not","know anything.","When she came in.","Everyone in the conference room turned to look at her.","Someone was still talking. When she came in, the meeting room fell silent.","Zhou Wei originally thought that she would see a group of overseas experts","when she came in. However, when she walked in, she realized that there were","only nine people in the huge conference room.","Bo Jingxing and Ye Wangchuan were both there.","A large group of people from the technical department was also present.","Luo Qjng and Chen Zhu looked at her with complicated expressions.","The members of Team 2 had their lips tightly sealed. When they saw her enter,","no one went forward to greet her.","This scene was completely different from what she had imagined!","Zhou Wei subconsciously looked around but did not see Qjao Nian.","The uneasiness in her heart gradually increased. She frowned slightly and","could only enter first to greet the two men with outstanding looks.","“Young Master Bo.”","She looked at the other person. Compared to Bo Jingxing, that person’s","appearance was more outstanding He was noble and eye-catching","Zhou Wei pursed her lips and restrained the emotions in her eyes. She","whispered, “Master Wang”","Only Bo lingxing nodded at her. Ye Wangchuan completely ignored her","greeting and was extremely cold.","Zhou Wei couldn’t say what it was, but she felt that something was wrong, She","put down her notebook and took the initiative to say, “Team Leader Luo called","me just now to ask me to come over. Is the bug in the USB still not solved?","It was fine if she didn’t mention this, but the moment she did, the atmosphere","in the meeting room became even more intriguing."]},{"number":769,"title":"Chapter 769 - Revealing Her True Colors in Public","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Gu San looked disdainful.","No one from Luo Qing and the technical department answered.","The scene froze.","Zhou Wei felt like she had been isolated by everyone for no reason. No one was","talking, but she felt like she had been slapped. Her face was burning with","embarrassment.","What were these people doing?!","What did they mean?","Didn’t they ask her to come over to resolve the ‘bug’ in the USB? Why wasn’t","anyone speaking?","Bo Jingxing gave her face. Seeing that no one was responding, he said softly,","“Qiao Nian has already solved the problem.”","Already solved?","Zhou Wei’s first reaction was quite big. “Her? How is that possible?”","“Tsk.” Ye Wangchuan raised his eyebrows lazily and glanced at her with a sharp","gaze. It made Zhou Wei’s heart skip a beat. “Tell me, why can’t she?”","Zhou Wei’s back was drenched in a cold sweat. She was speechless.","She knew best that it was not a bug, but a very powerful trojan horse virus.","This virus could infect the database of the system and replace its files.","However, it was difficult for ordinary people to discover its existence. They","would only think that there was a loophole in the system.","This virus was given to her by her third uncle. It was said to be from the Red","Alliance. It had appeared briefly on the black market in the past and was later","cleaned up by the Red Alliance.","The reason her third uncle had this virus was that he knew someone from the","Red Alliance. That person had sent it to him to study back then.","The trojan horse virus was called the Lizard Tail.","Her third uncle had studied this virus for five years before finding a way to","resolve the trojan horse. He also told her the solution.","If not for that, she wouldn’t have dared to use this virus.","She was certain that no one other than her knew this virus, let alone know the","way to take care of it!","Zhou Wei calmed down after some thought. She looked up and explained","logically, “Miss Qiao is only in her third year of high school, I don’t think she","has learned programming and software systematically. Even if she has talent,","she will inevitably encounter bugs she has never seen before. It’s normal that","she can’t resolve them.”","Her words sounded very reasonable at first glance and also explained why she","had such a big reaction earlier.","But everyone in the meeting room had seen the surveillance video!","Hearing her say that Qiao Nian couldn’t resolve it with a calm expression, the","situation seemed especially dramatic.","Gu San couldn’t help but mock her. “I don’t think that’s the reason.”","“Then, what are you trying to say?” Zhou Wei pursed her lips unhappily. She","still didn’t know that everyone knew the truth.","“You know very well yourself!” Gu San looked at her. “A bug? Are you sure it’s","not a virus.","Zhou Wei’s face turned green with a huge reaction. She shouted, “What virus?","Who said that? Did Qiao Nian say that?”","She was still pretending! Gu San ignored her, but his eyes were especially","disdainful. “Don’t pull everything on Miss Qiao!”","Zhou Wei gritted her teeth at his cold gaze and turned to look at the burly man","as if she was asking for help. She said softly, “Team Leader Luo, you’ve been","keeping the USB flash drive all along. Where did the virus come from? It’s","obvious that there’s a bug in the programming! The programming back then","was not perfect, don’t you think?”","Luo Qing didn’t expect her to really have the cheek to ask this. Meeting Zhou","Wei’s gaze, his expression was dark as he said word by word, “There was really","a virus on the USB.","“It’s called Lizard Tail.’","Zhou Wei pinched her fingertips tightly as her lips turned white. She couldn’t","help but widen her eyes in shock and panic when Luo Qing said the name of the","virus accurately...","How did he know this?"]},{"number":770,"title":"Chapter 770 - Zhou Wei Was Kicked Out of the Ninth Branch","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Didn’t her third uncle say that no one in the country knew the Lizard Tail virus?","“It’s all thanks to Miss Qiao’s help this time. Otherwise, no one would have been able to resolve your mess.”","Luo Qing spoke very slowly. He clenched his fists and looked at her silently, but his tone was not polite. “Zhou Wei, I don’t know why you did this. I just want to ask if you’ve thought about it. Driverless technology is not yours alone. It’s the result of the entire technical department’s research day and night,","as well as the effort of your team members.”","No one in Team 2 spoke up for Zhou Wei because Luo Qing’s words were also what they wanted to say in their hearts.","Zhou Wei had gone overboard this time.","“You secretly implanted the trojan horse in the USB stick. If not for Miss Qiao’s help, the entire Ninth Branch would have lost face with you!”","Zhou Wei’s fingertips trembled non-stop. Her expression was pale as she argued. “What nonsense are you talking about? When did I implant the trojan horse into the USB drive? You mean I did all of this? What right do you have to say that?”","It was as if she had been greatly wronged. Her proud eyes shone with tears. “I know you’re close to Qiao Nian, but you can’t malign me...”","At this point, her first reaction was still to argue. Luo Qing shook his head in disappointment. “...We all saw the surveillance video.”","‘We all saw the surveillance video!","This sentence crushed all of Zhou Wei’s hopes.","Her eyes suddenly widened as she clenched her fists and quickly looked at the others.","She realized that everyone in Team 2 avoided her gaze.","How was this possible","She had clearly deliberately modified the data of the surveillance cameras.","At this moment, Bo Jingxing walked over and placed his hand on her shoulder. He said softly, “Everyone knows that your third uncle, Zhou Hengfeng, has an extraordinary relationship with the Red Alliance. He almost entered its ranks back then. That Lizard Tail belongs to the Red Alliance.”","He didn’t continue.","Zhou Wei opened her mouth and her eyes faded. She still wanted to deny it. “...1 didn’t know.”","“Liao Xu, show her the surveillance video.” Bo Jingxing had always been the type to make people understand. He was very fair. He put down his hand and instructed the others.","“Yes, Young Master Bo.”","They had just seen the surveillance video, and Liao Xu hadn’t turned off the video. Now, he moved the mouse and clicked on the “play” button.","In the video, Zhou Wei’s face was captured very clearly.","How she stole the USB from Luo Qing’s drawer, how she implanted a trojan horse.","In the face of absolute evidence, Zhou Wei’s mind went blank. Her back was already drenched in a cold sweat as she sat on the ground with a pale expression.","‘There was only one thought in her mind—It’s over.","Seeing her sit on the ground, Bo Jingxing walked past her and asked Ye Wangchuan, “How are you going to handle Zhou Wei? Are you going to demote her?”","Being demoted in the Ninth Branch was an extremely serious punishment!","The blood on Zhou Wei’s face disappeared completely. She was unwilling, but she didn’t dare to say anything.","Unexpectedly, the man who hadn’t spoken all this while swept his sharp eyes across her casually and said coldly, “There’s no need to go through so much trouble. Just get rid of her.”","“_.” Zhou Wei didn’t expect Ye Wangchuan to say that. Her face was pale, and her shoulders trembled. Her vision almost turned dark.","‘The Ninth Branch was the top in the country. Those who were expelled from the Ninth Branch were equivalent to being expelled from the entire research institute. They would never be able to go higher in their lives.","In Beijing, the Zhou family and she would also be laughed at.","Bo Jingxing didn’t expect his punishment to be so severe. Stunned, he subconsciously asked, “Isn’t this punishment a little too heavy?”","“Since she dared to do this, she must have prepared for the consequences,” Ye Wangchuan said simply. “I’ll announce Zhou Wei’s removal to the public. There’s no need to discuss it further.”","This sentence stopped Bo Jingxing from saying anything else.."]},{"number":771,"title":"Chapter 771 - Should I Call Her Sister-In-Law?","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor:","Atlas Studios","Bo Jingxing returned to his senses and placed his hand on his forehead with a helpless expression. “Are you sure you didn’t have any private emotions when you handled this matter?”","He had thought that Ye Wangchuan would deny it. Unexpectedly, he was even calmer than he had imagined. His peach blossom-shaped eyes were deep and unfathomable. They were clear as he said in a low and hoarse voice, “My people were almost bullied. Can’t I have emotions?”","“Your people? You’re being angry for a beauty.” When Bo Jingxing reacted, he smiled faintly and joked. “Then, shouldn’t I address Sister Qiao as Sister-in-law?”","He was joking. He hadn’t expected Ye Wangchuan to take this matter seriously.","Unexpectedly.","Ye Wangchuan smiled. He raised his eyebrows and looked at him affectionately. “Not yet. We still have to wait...”","“Wait for what?”","Ye Wangchuan had no intention of hiding anything, He raised his eyes and said lazily, “Wait for me to confess first.”","Bo Jingxing: “...” Really?","Was he really going to address her as... Sister-in-law?","The image of the girl’s overly young face surfaced in Bo Jingxing’s mind. She was wild and awesome, but the problem was that Qiao Nian was only in her third year of high school!","He imagined himself calling a high school girl his sister-in-law, but he couldn’t care less about Zhou Wei. He only felt stifled.","Qin Si was wild when forced, but Ye Wangchuan had always been calm. He had also thought about what kind of woman would be worthy of the glamorous Young Master Ye. He had thought that she would at least be at Jiang Xianrou’s level. She could play the zither, the chess, the books, and the arts, and","she was about the same age. She would be two or three years younger and would have a similar family background","At that time, he didn’t expect a young lady to come from Rao City. She was in her third year of high school and had taken him down so easily.","However, Qiao Nian.","Bo Jingxing recalled the way the girl held a piece of chalk in front of a group of overseas experts and explained driverless techniques calmly. He suddenly felt that the two of them seemed to be quite compatible.","They both had intelligence that surpassed ordinary people.","They were just as eye-catching.","He was still pondering about this when someone suddenly patted his shoulder. Bo Jingxing looked up and met the man’s gaze.","Ye Wangchuan raised his chin slightly and looked at Zhou Wei, who was lying on the ground weakly. He said expressionlessly, “I’l leave this to you.”","“What about you?” Bo Jingxing asked subconsciously.","He regretted it the next second.","“Tm chasing my girlfriend.”","Bo Jingxing: “...”","Outside the laboratory, Qiao Nian had just finished performing the last acupuncture on Master Cheng.","This time, Master Cheng woke up in less than an hour. He woke up feeling refreshed and with a flushed face. He asked the girl who was packing her acupuncture bag, “Young lady, after I’m done with my acupuncture, will I not need acupuncture anymore?”","Qiao Nian placed the silver needles back into the cloth pocket one by one, tied them with a string, and placed them in her bag. Hearing this, she looked up and said politely, “Not really. Of course, it would be better if you could get someone to continue with the acupuncture. It’s just that I don’t have time to","stay in the Ninth Branch. I have to go back and prepare for the college entrance examination.”","Master Cheng knew her results from Luo Qing. When he saw the girl telling him seriously that she wanted to go back and prepare for the college entrance examination, he felt a little magical.","However, he had lived for 70 to 80 years and had seen most of the world. He was only stunned for a moment before he returned to his senses. He placed his hands behind his back and smiled. “Are you really not going to consider being my student?”"]},{"number":772,"title":"Chapter 772 - Sister Nian’s Teacher and Elder","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","“I don’t think so. At least for the time being.” Qiao Nian met his gaze and looked at him calmly. “I just don’t have time.”","Master Cheng had heard of her reason long ago. He didn’t probe further and paused for a moment before asking, “By the way, who is your Chinese Medicine teacher?”","He knew Mr. Huang and wanted to string her up.","Qiao Nian: “It’s probably... Mr. Huang.”","“Mr. Huang?” Master Cheng originally wanted to use his relationship to help her pull the strings. Unexpectedly, Qiao Nian had already become Mr. Huang’s disciple. He was stunned for a moment, but looking at the girl standing in front of him, he did not feel as surprised as he had imagined.","He had already become familiar with her at first sight. After interacting with her for a month, he was even more tempted to take her in, let alone anyone else.","Who wouldn’t want such a smart student?","With this in mind, Master Cheng understood. He raised his white eyebrows and looked at her with his turbid but hale and hearty black eyes. He asked, “It’s impossible for you to have chosen only one major when you study so well. Other than Mr. Huang’s Chinese Medicine, what else do you major in?","“Finance?” Qing University had two majors. One was in the Clinical Department and the other was in the Finance Department. He guessed that Qiao Nian either majored in finance or computers.","After all, Qiao Nian’s computing skills seemed to be very good.","Even Luo Qing admired her. He could more or less guess Qiao Nian’s talent in IT.","Qiao Nian shook her head. “No.”","“No?” Master Cheng didn’t expect himself to guess wrong twice. He was a little stunned. “Then, what else are you majoring in?”","He was about to say, “Could it be computing?”","Qing University’s level of computer expertise was average. If Qiao Nian wanted to study it, she should go to Nanjing University.","Nanjing University had the best education level in this area.","Zhou Wei was a Nanjing University student.","Unexpectedly.","Qiao Nian zipped up her bag, her eyes wild and alittle lazy. “Music Department.”","Music?","A perfect-score student like Qiao Nian wanted to learn music?","He felt like it was a waste of a genius.","‘The expression on his face was filled with heartache and pity. “Why do you want to learn music?","“You can learn music at home, but there’s no need to specialize in a professional class... If you have the energy, you can come to the Ninth Branch and learn from me in the laboratory. You can go for scientific research in the future, or you can do other things...”","Qiao Nian didn’t expect him to talk to her about this. She put one hand in her pocket and said with a gentle gaze, “No, I mainly agreed to an elder’s request to learn from him.”","“Who is it?” Master Cheng felt heartache. He wished he could argue with that person and ask him why he wanted Qiao Nian to learn some music.","“Your elder is also teaching in Qing University?”","He tried to recall if there was a teacher in the music department with the surname Qiao. He couldn’t recall anyone. He looked up at Qiao Nian and waited for her reply.","“Is the elder you’re talking about your relative?”","Qiao Nian felt a headache and was a little frustrated by his gaze, but she still answered his question nicely. “He’s not a relative. He’s just an elder I’ve known for many years. Master Cheng, you might not know him.”","On this matter, Master Cheng was quite persistent. He said in a warm and gentle tone, “Young lady, tell me his name first. What if I know him?”","‘There were only a few famous music masters in the country. They weren’t from the same industry. He didn’t know many, but he knew one or two people.","He wasn’t just asking for his name. He thought that if Qiao Nian’s music teacher standards were average, even if he wasn’t able to help her with her Chinese Medicine major, he would at least be able to help her with her music major","Seeing how persistent he was, Qiao Nian could only say Nie Mi’s name."]},{"number":773,"title":"Chapter 773 - Sister Ni","paragraphs":[", Have You Heard?","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Hearing the name of the elder, Master Cheng’s face instantly twitched. He looked at Qiao Nian, speechless.","Nie Mi.","‘The leading music master in the country could be said to be the number one person in the country’s music industry. He wasn’t an inherited cultural figure and was highly respected in the domestic music industry. He also had an extraordinary status internationally.","Nie Mi was indeed a senior teacher, but he was only an honorary professor.","Unlike Mr. Huang from the Chinese Medicine Department, ever since Nie Mi became an honorary professor at Qing University, he hadn’t spent a day there!","His return to Qing University this time... was clearly for Qiao Nian!","‘The Chinese Medicine she majored in was led by the famous Mr. Huang, and her music teacher was Nie Mi... Master Cheng finally understood why Qiao Nian was going to Qing University. She had even rejected him repeatedly and told him that she didn’t have time.","With these two teachers, it was indeed impossible for her to skip class and take time to come to him.","However, the more he became a master, the more he wanted to vie with others. After all, if he had to compare his status in the country, his achievements in his own domain were not bad.","“You’ll definitely be busy in your first and second years of university, but your classes will start to decrease in the second half of the second year. When the time comes, you can come to my place to learn. Bioengineering is no worse than Chinese Medicine and music. If you learn them, you’ll realize that","making reactors is much more interesting than making music.”","“Oh.” Qiao Nian thought of the ammunition reactor he made that day and looked at his expression that said, “Ours is also interesting,” She didn’t reject him completely, but she didn’t give an affirmative answer. “Can we see how it goes?”","“Sure, of course.” Master Cheng had already discussed this with her before. This time, he had only brought it up again because he saw that she was about to leave.","Qiao Nian chatted with him for a while more before Master Cheng rushed back to the laboratory to watch the project he was researching.","Qiao Nian did not delay. She picked up her things and played with her phone as she slowly walked out.","It had taken her almost two hours to perform acupuncture on Master Cheng until he woke up.","She guessed that Ye Wangchuan had finished handling the matter.","Qiao Nian looked at the message on her phone. Gu San and Luo Qing hadn’t told her about Zhou Wei’s final outcome.","She didn’t particularly care about how the Ninth Branch dealt with Zhou Wei, so she didn’t especially send a message to ask.","It happened that the class in First High School might have ended. She had replied to Shen Qingqing’s message earlier. When she opened her phone, she saw that Shen Qingqing had sent her many more messages.","She flipped through it.","The girl rambled on about the situation in class during this period. For example, when everyone’s results improved during the monthly test, the average score in the class increased by 20 points. Shen Hui was extremely happy and treated them to a meal.","For example, Chen Yuan had improved the most this time. His results for the monthly model examination were around 620, but he directly scored 680. He improved 60 points in one month. Everyone was asking him if he would go to Qing University or Nanjing University.","In addition, Shen Qingging also shared some school gossip. There was talk about how other schools came to First High School to poach people near the college entrance examination. Some of the top students in Class B had been poached.","After that, the girls liked to chat about celebrities and gossip.","[Sister Nian, since you’re in Beijing, have you heard that...]","Heard of what?","She had just read the message when her nose bumped into a hard chest. Caught off guard, Qiao Nian staggered and almost tripped.","A firm arm happened to grab her waist and pull her back. The man’s familiar cold fragrance lingered.","She was frustrated.."]},{"number":774,"title":"Chapter 774 - Master Wang Has Arranged to Meet the Parents","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","“Why don’t you look where you’re going?” Ye Wangchuan’s low and magnetic voice came from above.","Qiao Nian pulled away from him and put away her phone. She raised her eyebrows a little impatiently and looked at him with her dark eyes. She smiled provocatively. “Because I didn’t expect anyone to stand in front of me silently.”","“Heh.” Even though he was clearly being despised, Ye Wangchuan laughed softly. He raised his eyes and reached out to rub the top of her head. His tone was soothing and charming. “Are you angry?”","“I didn’t expect you to be so focused on your phone that you didn’t even notice me coming over,” he explained good-naturedly.","Qiao Nian couldn’t say why she was feeling frustrated. Under his gaze, she felt that her entire body was hot, especially her face and ears. It was so hot that she wanted to take off her scarf.","She was silent for a moment before pulling on her scarf to dissipate the hot air. She suppressed the heat in her eyes and looked up. “Is anything the matter?”","She thought that Ye Wangchuan was looking for her because of Zhou Wei.","Then, she heard the man say calmly, “Chen Chen will go too.”","Qiao Nian was speechless.","Seeing that the girl did not reject him immediately, Ye Wangchuan smiled and lowered his eyes. His face was very eye-catching. “You haven’t seen him in a long time. He’ll be very happy if you go. It’s his birthday in a few days. If you go back to Rao City, he might not be able to come back. He has to stay in","Beijing for a while.”","Sure enough, Qiao Nian’s determination wavered. She looked up. “What time tomorrow?”","“Aren’t you going to sleep in?” Ye Wangchuan smiled. His eyes were deep, and his facial features were well-defined. He was firm and noble. “Dinner.”","“Sure.” Qiao Nian had no objections and asked for the location.","Ye Wangchuan had considered this before and asked for her opinion. “Grandpa can’t eat too much food at his age. How about the Imperial Mansion?”","It was just a meal.","Of course, Qiao Nian would not reject him. “You decide..”"]},{"number":775,"title":"Chapter 775 - Master Wang: You’re a Student, You Don’t Have Money","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","“Then, let’s go to the Imperial Mansion.”","Qiao Nian hummed in agreement and lowered her eyes. She was still thinking about the WeChat message she had just seen. Shen Qingging wanted to ask her if she had heard about something","She walked calmly to her residence, thinking about something, She didn’t look up as the man continued talking to her.","suddenly, a hand blocked her from hitting the wall.","Qiao Nian looked up impatiently and met the man’s handsome face. His deep eyes seemed to be pressing down on her, making her feel like she was being sucked in.","“Nian Nian, shouldn’t you explain to me how you solved the Lizard Tail virus so easily?”","Qiao Nian cursed inside. She knew that he would ask.","However, she felt uncomfortable and at a loss as she was slammed against the wall. She raised her hand and pushed it. The coldness around her couldn’t be concealed, but her beautiful black eyes did not look at him. “... Move aside first.”","Ye Wangchuan looked as the girl’s head turned, revealing a fair and slender neck under the scarf. It was beautiful and eye-catching.","How obedient!","Although she thought that, she remained expressionless and said casually, “It’s exactly what you guessed.”","Ye Wangchuan couldn’t help but laugh again. The corners of his mouth curled up as a devilish expression flashed across his face. “Oh, what did I guess?”","“..” He was clearly teasing her.","Qiao Nian raised her eyes angrily. Her dark eyes were clear and bright as she placed her hands in her pocket and pulled up her hoodie. She decided not to look at him. “You know what.”","Seeing that he was about to anger her, Ye Wangchuan restrained the frivolousness in his eyes. Rubbing the girl’s head again, he frowned and said, “Don’t forget to come to the Imperial Mansion tomorrow night.”","At the mention of serious matters, Qiao Nian felt more at ease. Her back relaxed and she said lazily, “I know.”","Speaking of this, she thought of something.","“By the way...” Qiao Nian looked up with a serious expression. “Should I buy a gift for your grandfather?”","It was like seeing an elder with a gift.","No one had taught her this before, so she didn’t know very well.","“Heh.” Ye Wangchuan lowered his head and happened to see the confusion in her eyes. His heart felt like it was being pulled by a thread. It was filled with meticulous heartache. He smiled and said in high spirits, “There’s no need. You’re still a student. You don’t have money. Let him buy you a gift.”"]},{"number":776,"title":"Chapter 776 - Somewhat Miss Sister Nian","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Qiao Nian was speechless.","She raised her eyes slowly to look at him. She seemed to think about it and said slowly, “Money... Actually, I have a little.”","Ye Wangchuan was very efficient. He had only found out about Zhou Wei’s behind-the-scenes scheme in the morning, but in the afternoon, the news of her being chased out of the Ninth Branch spread throughout the upper circles of Beijing.","The various large families in Beijing had always liked to keep an eye on the Ninth Branch. This time, with the Ninth Branch causing such a huge commotion, almost everyone was secretly guessing what had happened.","Jiang Xianrou received a call from Zhou Hengfeng. She had just come out of Liang Lu’s place when she called Qin Si. After asking where he was, she went over to Chang’an Club.","Chang’an Club had a member system. Jiang Xianrou often came with Qin Si and the others, and the waiters all knew her.","The moment she arrived, the public relations manager greeted her enthusiastically and led her to the private room.","“Miss Jiang, Young Master Qin, and the others are in private room 003.”","Jiang Xianrou was hiding something in her heart and her expression was not good.","On the way, the public relations manager looked down and did not speak much. He silently led her to the private room Qin Si had booked and then excused himself.","Jiang Xianrou ignored him and pushed open the door.","In the private room.","Qin Si, Zhang Yang, and the others were all there.","Zhang Yang and the others were playing mahjong. Qin Si was leaning on the sofa, his phone clutched in his hand as if he was playing a game.","Seeing her enter, Qin Si looked up and took the time to greet her.","“Xianrou, you’re here.”","Jiang Xianrou held her handbag and walked over. When she saw the game interface, she pursed her lips and did not sit down.","Qin Si sent a message to Qiao Nian. He then looked up and saw her standing upright in front of him. Frowning instinctively and suppressing his impatience in his heart, he patted the sofa beside him. “Why are you standing there? Sit.”","“Twant to ask you something.” Jiang Xianrou was thinking about Zhou Hengfeng’s call. Her snow-white oval face was serious as if she had something to say.","Qin Si still gave her face. Hearing this, he logged out of the game and put down his phone. He then looked at her. “What is it? Tell me.”","“You know that Zhou Wei was chased out of the Ninth Branch by Master Wang...”","She had just finished speaking when Qin Si interrupted her impatiently with a clear expression. “Are you here to plead for Zhou Wei?”","Her question was direct and a little impolite.","Jiang Xianrou had been playing well with Qin Si and the others because of Jiang Li’s relationship. Qin Si and the others also took special care of her. They rarely spoke to her in such a tone. She clenched her handbag in discomfort and remembered Zhou Hengfeng’s instructions. She nodded stiffly again.","“What did Zhou Wei do? Master Wang’s punishment is so serious. If Zhou Wei is chased out of Ninth Branch, she won’t be able to stay in Beijing anymore...”","Qin Si raised his eyebrows with a complicated expression. “You don’t even know what mistake Zhou Wei made, yet you came looking for me?”","Jiang Xianrou was a little embarrassed and felt her face burning, She bit the bullet and said, “Zhou Hengfeng is the number one hacker in the country. He knows many people and is also related to the Red Alliance. I just don’t think there’s a need for you to be so ruthless...”","Qin Si was impatient. When he finally finished listening, he repeated her words with a faint smile.","“Zhou Hengfeng is the number one hacker in the country? Who told you that? Did he say it himself?”","He didn’t know what kind of situation Sister Qiao was in, but he had heard from Luo Qing that she was pretty good at IT. Her programming skills crushed Zhou Wei.."]},{"number":777,"title":"Chapter 777 - You Don’t Have the Face","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Zhou Hengfeng.... If not for the fact that he had almost entered the Red Alliance all those years ago, there would have been no news of him. The Zhou family was only good at marketing. They used Zhou Henggeng’s title as the number one hacker and his “relationshij","major families in Beijing, However, it wasn’t certain how big of a relationship Zhou Hengfeng had with the Red Alliance!","” with the Red Alliance to influence the","The Red Alliance had never cared about the Zhou family and Zhou Hengfeng all these years.","Jiang Xianrou was stumped by this question and didn’t know how to answer it for a long time. Qin Si didn’t want her to look too ugly, but Jiang Xianrou’s hasty appearance was a little overboard. He didn’t even try to be tactful as he said, “Don’t worry about Zhou Wei. Since Master Wang wants her to get","lost, he must have a reason. You don’t have to look for me to plead for her. I won’t help her. I don’t have in front of Master Wang, and you even less.”","—I don’t have this face in front of Master Wang, and you even less!","His words were like a slap to Jiang Xianrou’s face, causing her to see stars. Her mind was blank. Even though she knew that Qin Si’s voice was not loud and that Zhang Yang and the others might not have heard him, even if he did, a smart person like Zhang Yang would have pretended not to hear. Her face","still felt hot, and she stood there for a long time, unable to move.","Qin Si didn’t care about her. He took out his phone and nestled on the sofa. He then searched Qiao Nian’s photo on WeChat and clicked on it.","Sister Qiao hadn’t replied to his message.","He entered the game first and shared the team link with her, then went to play something else.","At the Ninth Branch.","Qiao Nian had just returned to her room.","As soon as she closed the door, her phone lit up.","She was in no hurry to look at it. First, she took off the man’s scarf around her neck and placed it on the bed. Then, she stared at it for a few seconds before walking to the fridge. She opened it, took out a bottle of mineral water, unscrewed the cap, and took a sip.","When the slightly cold mineral water was poured in, she suppressed a lot of the impetuousness in her heart.","However, the scene of her being teased and her hair being touched was still vivid in her mind. She kept feeling that someone was becoming more and more fearless recently.","It felt like he had crossed the line.","However, he appeared very natural, as if this was their relationship.","Qiao Nian couldn’t explain it. She felt that something was wrong, but she couldn’t say what was wrong. She took the water bottle to the desk, sat on the chair, and crossed her legs casually. She then took out her phone slowly.","She saw the new message at a glance.","It was from Qin Si again.","He had invited her to play games.","He even sent her a link.","Qiao Nian clicked on the screen with her fingers and narrowed her eyes. She did not reply.","After interacting with him for a while, she could already tell that Qin Si was the type that as long as she acknowledged him, he could chat with her awkwardly for the entire day without repeating himself.","She had always been afraid of trouble. Mainly, Qin Si was just looking for her to play games. It wasn’t an important matter, so Qiao Nian did not reply.","She crossed her legs again and her gaze landed on WeChat. She scrolled through half of the messages she had seen previously.","[Sister Nian, did you hear that in Beijing... Jiang Li seems to have beaten someone up during the filming of the show.]","Shen Qingqing had always been a fan of Jiang Li. Qiao Nian had only heard about this later.","She was said to be a Mommy Fan.","However... Jiang Li hit someone?","Qiao Nian frowned and grabbed the laptop on the table. She turned it on, then opened the search box and typed in the keyword: “Jiang Li hit someone.”","A lot of news reports immediately popped up.","She leaned back against the chair and narrowed her eyes to scan through one of the photos. She then logged into Weibo and checked its status.."]},{"number":778,"title":"Chapter 778 - Sister Nian: I Want to Get a Weibo Certification","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","The popularity of top-notch celebrities was not small, but there were no related phrases on Weibo’s trending searches. It could be seen that the company’s public relations team was at work and was still trying to suppress the matter’s popularity.","Qiao Nian casually flipped through the list and saw the trending searches for the recipient.","She clicked on it.","The person who had fought with Jiang Li seemed to be an unpopular male artist. She saw a photo of him on a news article from when he debuted. His face was drawn like a ghost, and his eyeliner looked so long that it could be pulled to his temples. He was even wearing lipstick.","It was a beauty she could not appreciate.","The other party seemed to be anxiously enjoying this wave of popularity. On his latest Weibo post, he surprisingly wrote—’I don’t know why Senior Jiang hit me, either. I was just chatting with my assistant when Senior Jiang suddenly got angry. He rushed over and punched me. I’m still in the hospital for","a checkup. The results aren’t out yet. I think it’s nothing serious. Don’t worry about me. I’m very sorry for taking advantage of public resources!”","This arrogant response inexplicably reminded Qiao Nian of someone.","Qiao Chen also seemed to like to use this tone to post on the Internet.","Qiao Nian opened the comments below. The highest comment was from someone who claimed to be a witness.","[Peach No Juice: I know what happened at that time. I was at the scene! Xue Ziang didn’t lie. He didn’t provoke Jiang Li. He was only chatting with his assistant, talking bad about Zhui Guang. His words were very unpleasant. He said that Zhui Guang was pretending to be X. She’s clearly a girl, but she","deliberately didn’t show her face and lied to her fans. He even said that Zhui Guang was so ugly that she played mosaic during the VCR recording and was unwilling to face her fans... In any case, he said a lot of bad things about Zhui Guang. In the beginning, Jiang Li didn’t say anything. Later, Jiang Li sat","opposite him and put on his makeup while listening. For some reason, Jiang Li suddenly flew into a rage and threw his phone on the ground, then rushed forward and began fighting with Xue Ziang. Tsk, tsk. Brother Li looks like a refined gentleman. The fight was fierce, and Xue Ziang’s nose even bled. It","was very tragic...]","Below were Jiang Li’s fans’ comments.","Qiao Nian was surprised to see that the people who called themselves her fans were defending her.","However, many people also criticized Jiang Li for his actions.","Qiao Nian lowered her eyes and suddenly smiled. The corners of her lips were cold, and a hint of wildness could be seen in them. Her dark eyes were extremely cold.","She crossed her legs and called Nie Mi.","“Hello.”","As soon as the call connected, she heard a strong voice coming from the other end.","Qiao Nian took the phone away and waited for the person on the other end to finish speaking before saying casually, “Do you know how to certify Weibo? I want to get a Weibo verification.”","Nie Mi was still talking, but he sounded puzzled when he heard this. “Have you never played social media? Why do you suddenly want a Weibo verification?”","Qiao Nian stared at the comments of the ignorant crowd “protecting justice” under Xue Ziang’s Weibo. She raised her eyes and came back to her senses. “It’s nothing. I just feel that I should have an account. I have something I want to post.”","“Right away.” Nie Mi didn’t say anything else. He helped her contact Wen Ruxia and got her to let Weibo know. “Send me your account first. I’ll settle it for you later.”","“Alright, thanks.”","Qiao Nian hung up and poured out a small sugar pill from the gum bottle before popping it into her mouth. Her eyes were unrestrained as her slender fingers typed on the keyboard. She would first establish an account and then throw it to Nie Mi to get him to certify her. Then, she sat there and waited for","him to reply.","Nie Mi replied after a while: [What identity do you want to certify?]","Qiao Nian lowered her eyes and replied.","[QN: Zhui Guang..]"]},{"number":779,"title":"Chapter 779 - Still Wanting to Make Things Difficult","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","At the Emergency Department of the city hospital.","Jiang Li’s manager rushed to the hospital. Not even trying to find a place to stop, the car stopped at the roadside. In the blink of an eye, the traffic police had pasted a ticket on it, and he was in no mood to care.","On the way, he wished that he had four legs so that he could walk faster.","He then arrived outside the emergency room.","‘When he saw the other party’s company representative, he immediately strode over and greeted them.","“President Chu, you’re all here.”","Xue Ziang’s assistant was discussing with the company’s representative how to use this popularity to step on Jiang Li and raise his own artist.","Halfway through their conversation, they turned around and saw him coming over. The few of them instantly looked at each other and tacitly stopped talking.","Jiang Li’s manager saw their small actions. However, he was currently anxious. Even if he knew that they were probably discussing how to cheat them, he could only pretend not to see it. He smiled and walked over. “How is Xue Ziang?”","“Heh, just like that. With how badly he was beaten, his nose must have broken.”","The boss of Xue Ziang’s company was a woman in her early forties. Her surname was Chu, and it was said that she had a little background in Beijing. Her background was not small. At this moment, her hair was neatly combed at the back of her head, and she did not look outstanding.","Dressed in a professional suit, she looked quite valiant, but her attitude was a little harsh. Hearing this, she narrowed her eyes slightly and raised her chin. She wasn’t polite. “As for whether he suffered other injuries, the artist is still doing a checkup. We don’t know the details yet. The doctor said that it’s","best to take a CT of his brain to see. We still have to do an electrocardiogram test later...”","” The manager knew that she was deliberately making things difficult for him. What electrocardiogram? CT scan of the brain? It was too exaggerated.","Jiang Li had indeed beaten Xue Ziang up, but the two of them were quickly pulled away by the staff present. At most, Xue Ziang had received a few blows to his face and had suffered some soft tissue injuries on his body. There was no need for a scan at all. With so many reporters waiting outside, Chu Yao","insisted on bringing Xue Ziang to the city hospital for a checkup. It was obvious that she wanted to take this opportunity to cling to Jiang Li","Although he knew clearly in his heart that Jiang Li had hit him, it was the truth. Furthermore, he had beaten Xue Ziang into a pig’s head under the eyes of so many people. Logically speaking, he didn’t have the advantage in public opinion. If he wanted to escape from the news this time, he could only","discuss it with the other party.","Therefore, he was silent for a moment before choosing his words carefully. He said very humbly, “President Chu, we’ll reimburse Xue Ziang’s medical fees this time. Look at the Weibo post on the Internet...”","As soon as he finished speaking, Chu Yao raised her exquisite eyebrows arrogantly. “My artist was beaten up for no reason. You don’t even have a single explanation. You want to reconcile just like that?”","“That’s not what I meant...”","Chu Yao: “I saw the status on Xue Ziang’s Weibo. He didn’t say anything. He’s considered a victim. He was clearly beaten up, but he still explained it for Jiang Li on Weibo. What else do you want?”","The manager only wanted to laugh coldly. Explain?","Xue Ziang had published that Weibo post when Jiang Li’s side just contacted Weibo to lower the popularity of this incident. How was this called explaining?","It was more like adding fuel to the fire!","He even firmly established the image of an injured puppy in the hearts of his fans!","He knew very well that this was just the entertainment industry’s usual trick. Since the other party was acting stupid with him, he couldn’t possibly tear his face apart and say anything if he needed a favor. He could only take a deep breath and swallow this anger. He discussed with the other party nicely.","“President Chu, according to what I know, Jiang Li did not attack for no reason. Xue Ziang also did something he shouldn’t have done...”"]},{"number":780,"title":"Chapter 780 - My Artist Didn’t Do It For No Reason","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","He was one of the few people who knew why Jiang Li had acted on impulse. It was no wonder that Brother Li couldn’t control his temper when Xue Ziang spoke ill of his sister.","He wasn’t surprised that Jiang Li attacked him.","If not for the fact that many staff members were present at the scene and quickly pulled the two of them apart, he reckoned that Xue Ziang’s nose wouldn’t have been simply broken. He would have to lie in bed for at least ten days to half a month.","He knew very well, but the fact that she was Brother Li’s sister was a secret. He knew, but no one else knew!","To outsiders, the nature of this matter was extremely bad.","Firstly, Jiang Li’s status was thousands of miles higher than Xue Ziang’s. It was easy for others to say that he was bullying the weak. Furthermore, Jiang Li was the first to make a move.","They couldn’t understand.","After weighing the pros and cons in his heart, the manager looked up and quickly continued, “How about this? Jiang Li has a variety show invite. That show still lacks a flight guest. I think Xue Ziang is very suitable. President Chu, what do you think?”","With Jiang Li’s current status, no production team would reject him if he wanted to take on a variety show and bring in a newcomer for an episode.","This could be considered as exchanging resources to calm this matter.","This was a good deal.","Jiang Li’s popularity had always been high, and he rarely participated in variety shows. Every time he participated in one, his fans would always especially watch it. The topics on the programs he participated in were extremely high. Many celebrities wanted to squeeze in and find more information.","Xue Ziang was unknown before this incident. An unpopular artist like him had no chance of appearing on the show.","Unexpectedly, Chu Yao didnt accept his proposal. She crossed her arms over her chest and said arrogantly, “You mean you want us to shut up and treat it as if nothing happened?”","‘Tm telling you, we don’t need such an insincere apology, and we don’t need to go on this show. If Jiang Li really wants to apologize, then let him apologize to Xue Ziang himself. Didn’t Xue Ziang post on Weibo? I remember Jiang Li has a Weibo account, too.”","She really dared to dream!","She actually wanted Jiang Li to apologize to Xue Ziang publicly!","What was the difference between this and trending on Jiang Li’s behalf?!","‘The manager almost laughed in anger, his face turning green and white.","Chu Yao didn’t stand on ceremony. She narrowed her eyes and smiled, looking like she had already decided on this matter. She softly said, ‘We only accept this kind of apology!","“Anyway, Xue Ziang’s results aren’t out yet. Well reserve the right to call the police within three days. You can do as you deem fit. Or you can go back and discuss it with Jiang Li and see what he thinks.”","‘The manager’s expression was quite ugly. He looked at her and said in a low voice, “President Chu, we’re all from the same industry. Must you be so ruthless?”","Chu Yao was determined to step on Jiang Li this time.","“Lalso said earlier that our artiste won’t beat someone up without reason,” he said meaningfully. “Xue Ziang isn’t innocent. He knows very well what he did. Some fans saw it with their own eyes at the scene.”","Before Chu Yao came, she had understood the situation with Xue Ziang’s assistant. She had also personally seen Xue Ziang’s subsequent Weibo post. Otherwise, how did he post it?","Of course, she had seen the popular comments below.","However, she didn’t take this matter to heart.."]},{"number":781,"title":"Chapter 781 - Zhui Guang Has Never Afforded Public Opinion","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","‘When she heard this, she only raised her eyebrows coldly and said in a light tone, “I know. He talked bad about Zhui Guang. Zhui Guang is also considered half a public figure. So what if he said a few unpleasant words to others in private? Even Zhui Guang herself doesn’t fuss about it, so why did Jiang Li come","over and attack? Don’t tell me that Jiang Li attacked him because he mentioned Zhui Guang to the person beside him.”","“He..” The manager wanted to say, so what?","However, Zhui Guang’s identity was a secret. Even if he knew that there was a reason for Jiang Li’s actions, he could only forcefully suppress his anger.","“In short, it’s simple if you want to resolve this matter. We only have one request—Jiang Li will publicly apologize to Xue Ziang on Weibo! Otherwise, there’s no need to discuss anything!”","Chu Yao had never felt that Zhui Guang would stand out and make trouble. Everyone in the industry knew that Zhui Guang was extremely cold and aloof. She had no contact with any entertainment company and had no intention of debuting. Although she was very popular, she never cared about online","gossip or marketing. She didn’t even have a Weibo account, making her no different from a god.","It was because of this that she didn’t take Xue Ziang’s private slander of Zhui Guang to heart. Her attitude was extremely arrogant as she looked at Jiang Li’s manager and said, ‘Consider it yourselves!”","Outside the hospital, a nanny van was parked quietly in the shade.","The air conditioner was switched.","‘The car was warm and not cold at all. The man was nestled in the backseat. There was a light scratch on his face, but it didn’t affect his handsomeness. He was playing games on his phone, his eyes extremely cold.","*... The others in the car looked at each other when they saw this. They were anxious.","Why was Brother Li still in the mood to play games?","Did he not know that Xue Ziang’s white lotus flower” statement on Weibo had been forwarded more than ten thousand times?","If this continued, the company wouldn’t be able to suppress this wave of popularity. It would be on the trending searches.","Just as the few of them were at a loss, the door was pulled open. The manager hurriedly got in from outside. As soon as he got in, the assistant immediately asked him.","“Brother, how is Xue Ziang?”","At the mention of this, the manager felt a headache coming on. He was extremely frustrated. He got into the car and closed the door before saying gloomily, “He’s still being checked. He wants a full-body checkup, but the results aren’t out yet.”","“A full-body checkup? Aren’t they being too ridiculous?” The assistant was at the scene and knew Xue Ziang’s condition better. He pursed his lips and said, “He at most got a few blows to his face. Is there a need for a full-body checkup?”","“Hehe, you don’t think so? He’s even preparing to take an electrocardiogram. He can’t wait to check everything inside and out. He can’t wait to find out something wrong!”","With that, he ignored the others’ reactions and tured to look at the man playing games in the backseat. He said seriously, “Brother Li, how are you going to handle this?”","Jiang Li was in a bad mood. Hearing this, he looked up with a dark gaze. “What do you mean by how? Pay up if you need to. I don’t lack this bit of money. Let him check however he wants.”","“mow you don’t lack money.” The manager placed his hand on his forehead and felt that it hurt even more. He knew about Jiang Li’s family situation. Joining the entertainment industry was just him fooling around, but this matter was indeed difficult to resolve. “This isn’t a matter of money. They’ve steeled","themselves to smear you to hype themselves up. If this continues, it will only make the public even more unfriendly to you!”","Jiang Li felt like he had been shot in the head. He simply let go of his phone and said coldly, ‘What are their conditions? What do they want?”","He wasn’t afraid of things getting out of hand. If they did, so be it. At most, he would quit the entertainment industry."]},{"number":782,"title":"Chapter 782 - Sister Nian’s Weibo Certification Is Settled","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","The Jiang family didnt rely on him to earn money. At most, he would go back and be a spoilt heir. However, he felt a little regretful that he couldnt play the music he liked.","‘When the manager saw his expression, he didn’t even dare to say what the other party had proposed. After a long time, he said, “They... want you to apologize to Xue Ziang publicly on Weibo.”","“Damn! Are they shameless? To think they dared to think that Brother Li would publicly apologize to him? On what basis? Xue Ziang has a foul mouth. He deserves it!”","“Exactly. How shameless.”","The assistant and the others couldn’t help but curse.","The manager wrung his hands helplessly. “I also know that they’re shameless. They want Jiang Li to apologize publicly to hype up Xue Ziang. The problem is that Jiang Li hit Xue Ziang first. The surveillance videos clearly show that he hit him first, and the reason for doing so is... I can’t say. They don’t accept","resource replacement, so there’s nothing we can do.”","He originally did not want to say this, but he couldn’t help but say, “Besides, the other party even threatened to call the police.”","If this matter was brought to the police station, it would be a big mess.","If they caused a ruckus at the police station, Xue Ziang could casually create an injury certificate and ruin Jiang Li’s reputation. The other party was relying on this to be fearless!","He thus made a brazen request for a public apology.","It wasn’t impossible to resolve this matter, but he needed someone...","The manager frowned and looked at the man in the back who was clearly not afraid of trouble. He said hesitantly, “If Miss Qiao is willing to stand forward..”","He was about to continue speaking when Jiang Li interrupted him. “Don’t even think about it! I can leave the industry. If they want to call the police, just let them do it. I won’t involve Nian Nian. Don’t even think about it!”","‘Tl just say this. Actually, if she’s willing to stand forward, this is a good thing...”","Before the manager could finish, Jiang Li threw his phone away again and said forcefully, “You don’t have to say anything. I’m telling you, it’s impossible! I won’t apologize to him, either! They can do whatever they want.”","The manager knew he would say that. He was so anxious that his mouth burned, but there was nothing he could do.","This time, he had used the Jiang family’s connections to suppress the popularity of this news on the Internet. Otherwise, it wouldn’t be easy to suppress the trending searches. If Jiang Li was unwilling to involve Qiao Nian, they could only be sucked dry by Xue Ziang’s side. There was nothing they could do...","However, their attitude was really infuriating.","He thought about it for a long time but couldn’t think of a good solution. He rubbed his forehead and said to the driver, “Let’s go back to the company first. I’ll discuss with the company and see what to do next.”","Everyone in the nanny van was in a gloomy mood.","In the Ninth Branch.","Qiao Nian had already dried her hair. She sat back at the desk, her long legs wrapped in a bathrobe resting casually as she picked up the phone on the table.","Nie Mi had already replied to her message.","‘Ive prepared the Weibo verification. Go up and take a look yourself. See if there’s any problem. Let me know if there is.”","Qiao Nian curled her fingers and clicked on her phone. She lowered her eyes and thanked him.","Then, she booted up her laptop and logged into her account. Indeed, there was a red V on the back of the account.","She narrowed her eyes and stared at it before scanning the certified information below.","—Zhui Guang, musician.","There was only one verified Weibo post that the system had sent itself lying there silently. The number of forwards and comments was very high.","Qiao Nian looked at it. In less than an hour, there were already more than 30,000 forwards.","Qiao Nian saw the trending searches at the side from the corner of her eye.."]},{"number":783,"title":"Chapter 783 - Jiang Li, My Brother","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","#Zhui Guang Weibo","#Zhui Guang, Master Nie","#Zhui Guang is on Weibo #","#Zhui Guang enters Weibo #","A few trending topics about her could be seen, and there was a caption at the top.","She leaned back against the chair casually and picked up the mineral water beside her. She unscrewed the cap and took a slow sip. She then placed the bottle beside her and opened the Weibo message the system had sent.","There were many comments below.","The first few comments hadn’t been Liked by the new reviewers, and the Likes were generally higher.","[Pink Piglet: Damn, another hot chick pretending to be my goddess is here. Can’t Weibo catch her?]","[I Fly Horizontally: Hehehehe, this account is fake! My big boss never opens Weibo. You don’t even know this, and you still dare to write yourself as Zhui Guang, It’s bullshit!)","(Upright Passer-by: Tsk, I was just listening to some music on QQ, but Weibo actually recommended me this fake account. Impressive (7)]","[Funny Monkey: This imitation is quite similar to Zhui Guang’s photo on the platform.]","Qiao Nian’s gaze followed the comments. When she saw the comment that told her to ‘eat sh*t’, her eyebrows raised in interest. Her cold jawline was smooth as she supported her chin with her hand as if she was pondering the possibility of doing so.","Behind these comments with higher Likes were more new comments that surged in after her verification.","[Melbourne has no tears: Ahhhhhhh! I’m dead! It’s really my goddess. My goddess has opened her account on Weibo.]","[Too Angry: Damn, what’s going on today? What kind of festival is this? Why did Zhui Guang create a Weibo account?)","Then, it was the highest post forwarded.","Qiao Nian narrowed her eyes and saw that it was also a verified Weibo post. However, it was different from her. There was a blue V behind the account.","{Nie Mi Studio: This is the real Zhui Guang (forwarded)]","There were countless forwards to this simple forwarding Weibo.","[Southern Husky: Master Nie forwarded the certificate. It’s Zhui Guang. It can’t be wrong!]","[Halo: Master Nie forwarded the account... Tsk, this proves that it’s the real Zhui Guang.]","{Weeping Kitten: Front row, follow the account decisively!]","Qiao Nian ignored the quiet atmosphere in the ward. The screen of her mobile phone on the table lit up. She picked it up leisurely and looked down at the screen.","It was a message from Nie Mi.","[How is it? Have you logged in?]","Qiao Nian typed back.","After replying, she turned her gaze to the notebook again. She leaned forward and typed on the keyboard before searching for Xue Ziang’s Weibo.","‘There were already many reposts and comments under Xue Ziang’s victim statement. It could be seen that Jiang Li’s company’s public relations were bad.","‘The other party’s popularity had already risen.","Qiao Nian opened the comments below. The comment with the most Likes was still the person exposing the truth. She looked at it again and retracted the light in her eyes. Her long fingers typed on the keyboard as she forwarded Xue Ziang’s Weibo message and tagged Jiang Li.","All the Weibo users who followed Zhui Guang realized that there was a new Weibo post on her homepage.","A lot of people looked over curiously.","[Zhui Guang: [Repost] @JiangLi, my brother.]","It was simple and rough.","Behind him was Xue Ziang complaining about Jiang Li hitting him. He was still checking Weibo in the hospital.","Originally, when Jiang Li hit someone, Xinghao Entertainment had spent a lot of money to suppress the news. Xue Ziang’s Weibo was still quite popular, but it hadn’t reached the trending searches.","In the end, when Qiao Nian reposted it, Xue Ziang’s popularity exploded.","After reposting and playing with Weibo, Qiao Nian directly clicked on the forked page and picked up the prescription she had half-written this morning. She then continued to write Master Cheng’s prescription.","Master Cheng was considered to be suffering a chronic illness in his old age. He couldn’t use the medicine too forcefully, and it was easy for it to be ineffective. Therefore, Qiao Nian was quite troubled about which herbs to use.","Not long after, a few more paper balls appeared on the ground.","She didn’t look at it after reposting it calmly.","However, her Weibo trending increased because of a casual forwarding post.","#Zhui Guang and Xue Ziang","#Zhui Guang is Jiang Li’s Sister","Two topics were directly pushed to the top three of the trending searches.","Within the city hospital, Chu Yao had just received the news. Her originally high-spirited face was now covered in dark clouds, twisted beyond compare.","She held her phone in her hand.","Xue Ziang’s assistant was beside her. A young man was lying on the bed. The man had been beaten black and blue, and his original handsome appearance could not be seen. He was also extremely anxious and wanted to get up from the bed.","“How could this be?”","“Don’t move around recklessly.” Chu Yao held her phone and had a splitting headache. She couldn’t understand why Zhui Guang, who had not appeared for ten thousand years, would stand out and speak up for Jiang Li. She stared at Xue Ziang’s Weibo post on her phone.","Originally, it only had slightly more than ten thousand forwards.","At this moment, it directly soared to more than 70,000 forwards, and it was gradually increasing.","This was what they had expected.","Because the more heated this matter became, the easier it was for them to get dividends from it. Now that things were developing in the direction they were looking forward to, no one in the ward laughed.","Zhui Guang personally appeared.","She clearly didn’t say anything.","However, she had pulled Xue Ziang from the clouds into the mud. It was a painful slap!","Chu Yao looked at the public opinion below. Most of the passersby who had sympathized with Xue Ziang now stood by Jiang Li’s side and mocked Xue Ziang for having a foul mouth, deserving of a beating.","Her temples immediately pounded as she stared intently at the repost. No matter what, she couldn’t figure out where Xinghao Entertainment got the ability to not only get Master Nie to appear but also Zhui Guang.","Zhui Guang had introduced Jiang Li as her brother.","That witness comment was immediately praised by more than 100,000 people, pinning Xue Ziang to the pillar of shame!","As the party concerned, Xue Ziang naturally saw the number of reposts his Weibo got. He didn’t have high EQ, to begin with. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have casually discussed others in public. With the way things had turned out, he had long become flustered. He asked in a daze, “President Chu, what should","1 do? My reputation will be ruined if this continues. Should I post an apology on Weibo?”","“Your reputation won’t be ruined if you apologize?” Chu Yao rolled her eyes at him angrily. She composed herself and said, “The matter has already developed to this point. It’s not something that can be resolved with an apology.”","“Then, what should we do?” Xue Ziang was flustered and said gloomily, “Why are Zhui Guang and Jiang Li siblings?”","Chu Yao couldn’t be bothered to tell him. She tumed to her assistant and said, “Ziang still has seven or eight endorsements. If this goes on, the companies will look for compensation. I’ll call Weibo and ask them to suppress the news first.”","Hearing her words, Xue Ziang and the others in the ward relaxed a little.","Chu Yao’s family had a strong background in Beijing. As long as they suppressed it, there was still room for discussion.","With that, she didn’t delay any longer and quickly called home.."]},{"number":784,"title":"Chapter 784 - Master Wang: I’ll Follow Her Silently","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Meanwhile, at the Ninth Branch.","Ye Wangchuan’s room was opposite Qiao Nian’s.","In the past, he had never lived in the Ninth Branch. Even if he came, he would mostly stay in Rhine Apartment or the Ye family’s old residence. This time, he actually stayed there. He even chose the room opposite Qiao Nian’s. Most of the people in the Ninth Branch knew his intentions.","After separating from Qiao Nian, he returned to his room to take a shower and changed into a sleeping robe. The navy blue robe made him look tall and lazy. The belt wasn’t tightly tied and the robe hung loosely, revealing a white and firm chest.","‘The man’s hair was still dripping, but the towel was useless. He walked to the bed and picked up his phone, just in time to see the message Qin Si had sent him.","[Zhui Guang is Jiang Li’s sister? Why haven’t I heard of this before?)","“Huh?” Ye Wangchuan’s fingers brushed past the phone screen. He narrowed his eyes, his gaze frivolous and noble. He hooked his neck and lowered his eyes to call Qin Si back.","‘The other party picked it up immediately.","He held his phone and walked to the balcony. His voice was dark and hoarse as if he had just finished showering. “How did you know about this?”","“Weibo. It’s so popular on Weibo. I happened to see the news my phone sent me.” Qin Si’s voice was unrestrained, and the background music was very noisy. He was probably outside. “Damn, what’s going on? Is Zhui Guang really Jiang Li’s sister? Which sister? Jiang Xianrou?”","“It’s not her.”","Qin Si asked who it was again. Ye Wangchuan raised his head lazily and looked at the tightly shut balcony window opposite him. He placed his hand on the railing. “T’ll tell you in the future.”","With that, he hung up.","After hanging up, he opened Weibo.","As he hadn’t used it in a long time, it reminded him to log in as soon as he opened it. Ye Wangchuan thought for a moment before remembering his account and password.","He logged in.","He hadn’t played social media for a long time. As soon as he logged in, Weibo recommended him a lot of people for him to follow.","Ye Wangchuan immediately saw the first name.","Zhui Guang!","She had more than 200,000 followers.","His bright red lips curled up. He clicked on the notification before entering the profile of the only person on the list.","Inside.","He saw the other party’s Weibo posts, which were not many.","She had created a Weibo account three hours ago.","Other than the system notification was a new post half an hour ago.","She even tagged Jiang Li simply and sent two words.","My brother.","It was already trending.","The number of comments that were forwarded on her Weibo now far exceeded 50,000. And it was still rising.","He pressed his fingertips on the phone screen and saw the Weibo post that Qiao Nian had forwarded. He clicked on it and looked at the comments below.","When he saw the comment that was Liked the most, his eyes turned a little cold. He looked at that person’s name again, closed Weibo, searched his contact list, and made a call.","“Hello...” Her voice was extremely cold and protective.","At the same time, Chu Yao had already gone through many connections and was currently calling Weibo.","The phone rang more than ten times.","She picked it up anxiously, her voice light. “Hello, CEO Li. I’m Chu Yao. Here’s the thing, My brother-in-law told you about my situation, right? I hope you can help...”","‘The Chu family had an extraordinary network in Beijing. With the Wei family’s backing, many people in the family had embarked on official careers.","This was also the reason why Chu Yao hadn’t given Jiang Li’s manager face before.","The Jiang family wasn’t bad.","However, it did not concern them.."]},{"number":785,"title":"Chapter 785 - Who Did He Offend?","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","“Can you help me cool down Xue Ziang’s Weibo? Also, can you ban the account of the user ‘Peach No Juice’","Chu Yao knew that deleting the comments would only treat the symptoms, not the illness.","If they deleted the comments, the other party could continue to comment. Only by reporting the account could they shut the other party’s mouth.","She thought that this matter was almost certain, but who knew—","“Well, President Chu, I’m sorry. We can’t help you here.”","Chu Yao was stunned for a moment. She clearly didn’t understand. “Boss Li, my brother-in-law...”","Her brother-in-law had such a relationship. She had never thought that he wouldn’t give her face, so she deliberately mentioned it.","However, before she could finish, the other party interrupted her. “I’ll still say the same thing even if Mr. Wei comes. We can’t help here. President Chu... I can’t say too much. My relationship with Mr. Wei has always been good. I can only say that you’ve offended someone this time.”","“I offended someone? Who?”","“L.. can’t tell you.”","“... What do you mean?” Chu Yao refused to give up. “Who did I offend that you can’t even tell me?”","“really can’t tell you. In short, you shouldn’t struggle anymore. It won’t do you any good if you continue.”","This was the first time Chu Yao had encountered such a situation. She was about to ask again when the other party hung up.","She couldn’t get through when she tried calling again.","It seemed like she had been blacklisted.","Chu Yao was furious. Her face was ashen, and she was unable to recover.","Xue Ziang whispered from the side, “President Chu, how is it?”","Chu Yao put down her phone and slowly looked at him. She frowned and said with frustration, “Other than Jiang Li, who else do you have a grudge with?”","“Uh...” Xue Ziang was confused by her question. He thought about it for a long time before replying, “No, I don’t have a grudge with anyone. If I had to say it, it seems like only... does Zhui Guang count?”","He was a D-list celebrity. Although he was arrogant usually, he only targeted the staff around him. He was still very clear-headed in front of others and knew that his status was not high enough.","He seemed to have only said bad things about Zhui Guang.","The reason was simple. He was also in a rock band, but he didn’t have as many fans as the other party. Furthermore, knowing that the other party was a young girl and had so many female fans, he was unhappy and only spoke nonsense.","Not only did he speak ill of her that day, but he also liked to complain to the people around him.","However, he didn’t expect to be beaten up.","Chu Yao didn’t say anything, but her brows began to furrow.","Zhui Guang?","With such a figure in Beijing, his relationship with her was so strong that Weibo didn’t even give her face.","Before Chu Yao could figure out what was going on, her phone kept receiving messages. They were either informing her that Xue Ziang’s work had been canceled or that they wanted to terminate the contract with Xue Ziang and cancel the endorsement.","She was instantly overwhelmed with work. She began to call home non-stop again to find connections, wanting to figure out what was going on here that she didn’t know about.","Beijing, Jiang family.","Jiang Xianrou had just returned from Qin Si’s side. She had run over just to get a cold shoulder and be rebuked by Qin Si. She felt that she couldn’t maintain her face and did not stay long at Chang’an Club.","“Mom, I’m back.”","‘As soonas she entered, she changed into her slippers.","As soon as she walked in, she heard Tang Wanru ask, “Do you know Zhui Guang?”"]},{"number":786,"title":"Chapter 786 - Sister Nian: I Didn’t Sleep!","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","“Zhui Guang?” Jiang Xianrou’s mind was filled with Zhou Wei. She owed Zhou Hengfeng a favor last time. This time, he came looking for help, but she didn’t succeed. She felt a little embarrassed. Hearing this, her mind couldn’t process it. She took off her scarf and hung it at the side, suppressing the","frustration between her brows. “I know. She’s very popular on the Internet. Mom, why are you asking about her?”","Zhui Guang was comparable to a celebrity on the Internet.","However, this reputation was not worth mentioning in their circle.","Tang Wanru was a rich lady. No matter how popular Zhui Guang was, she was just a plaything in her eyes.","Why did her mother suddenly mention her?","Tang Wanru didn’t say anything else and showed her the phone. “Take a look.”","‘When Jiang Xianrou saw Jiang Li’s name, she looked away as if nothing had happened. Her brother had always been unruly and insisted on entering the entertainment industry. He really treated the entertainment industry as a career. It was not embarrassing, but she had never been proud of it.","Therefore, she rarely paid attention to the entertainment news on the Internet.","“Did my brother cause trouble again?” Jiang Xianrou glanced casually and saw Xue Ziang’s name. The words “fighting” and “being hospitalized” could be seen. She didn’t even read them carefully before mocking him. “He’s getting more and more promising.”","Tang Wanru didn’t like her son, who didn’t come home every day. Their relationship was usually relatively cold.1","It couldn’t compare to her relationship with Jiang Xianrou.","Therefore, she didn’t stop her daughter from talking about her son. She only looked up and let her continue. “Finish reading it first.”","Jiang Xianrou read through it patiently. After understanding the entire situation, she returned the phone to her. “I’m done reading. What’s wrong with this?”","Tang Wanru took the phone from her with an indescribable complicated expression. She suddenly asked, “Do you think this Zhui Guang is... Qiao Nian?”","Jiang Li only had one sister, Jiang Xianrou.","If one had to forcefully calculate, only one person in the Jiang family could also be considered a sister.","Qiao Nian!","Ever since Nie Mi’s birthday party, she had not gone out to eat with her friends or chat with them for a long time. She was afraid that they would look at her differently.","After all, at that time, everyone thought that Jiang Xianrou could successfully take Nie Mi as her master, but she was slapped in the face.","She also felt ashamed.","Not to mention that it was Qiao Nian.","It was also because the Old Master had not reunited with Qiao Nian. If she returned to the family, they would only lose even more face.","Although Tang Wanru didn’t want to think like this, she was still worried. She pulled on her fox coat and frowned. “If it’s her...”","Before she could finish, Jiang Xianrou interrupted her confidently. “It can’t be Qiao Nian. You’re overthinking, This is clearly a public relations method from the entertainment industry. Someone from Xinghao Entertainment must have found a way to woo her and got her to step in to help with this crisis.”","“That’s all?” Tang Wanru didn’t believe it.","Jiang Xianrou was impatient. “That’s all!”","The corners of her mouth curled up again in disdain. “If she’s really Zhui Guang, she would have said so long ago. Why would she need to hide?”","Tang Wanru was convinced by this sentence. The frustration in her eyes faded a little. She didn’t harp on this news and went to talk about Liang Lu and school.","1","The next morning.","Qiao Nian threw seven to eight paper balls on the ground. She had finally finished writing down Master Cheng’s prescription.","She threw down the pen and moved her stiff neck.","It crunched.","She saw her phone light up from the corner of her eye.","She picked it up.","[Ye Wangchuan: Are you awake?}"]},{"number":787,"title":"Chapter 787 - Come Here, I’ll Blow Your Hair","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Qiao Nian placed her legs on the table. Her straight calves were smooth and well-proportioned. She held the phone in her lazy hands and typed a reply on the keyboard.","(QN: Wait for ten minutes.)","After replying to Ye Wangchuan’s message, Qiao Nian did not delay any longer. She lowered her legs and raised her eyes to look at the laptop.","After a moment of hesitation, she opened it.","Her laptop hadn’t been switched off for the entire night and had not been used. She swiped the touchpad to light up the screen and saw that the page was still the Weibo page from yesterday.","Qiao Nian refreshed it and saw?99+@?reminders and 99+comments.","She narrowed her eyes. Her black pupils were extremely beautiful. She didn’t open any of them and only scrolled down to see the Weibo post she had forwarded.","It was still there.","After a day and night of hype.","Now, the number of forwards had exceeded 100,000, and the comments had more than doubled.","Qiao Nian scanned the trending searches and realized that they were also very interesting. There were many trending topics regarding Jiang Li’s fight.","More people were criticizing Xue Ziang.","She switched off her laptop and knocked on it before turning to the bathroom.","After a sleepless night, the nerves in the back of Qiao Nian’s head were tense and her temples were throbbing. She turned on the showerhead; the water temperature was warm.","‘With the warm water running down her face, she was finally more awake.","In less than ten minutes, she turned off the showerhead and casually picked up a bathrobe to wear. Not caring about her wet hair against her shoulder, she walked to the door and opened it.","Sure enough, a man was standing outside. Qiao Nian lowered her eyes and moved aside for him to enter.","“Come in.”","“_.” Ye Wangchuan didn’t expect to see her with her hair draped over her shoulders coming out to open the door for him. Stunned for a second, he quickly came back to his senses and closed the door after he entered.","Then, he saw a pile of paper on the floor and an Ag piece of paper on the desk. The black pen was pressed against the paper, and the pen cap was not covered","He raised his eyebrows and leaned against the desk. He was tall and slender, his eyes deep and noble. “You didn’t sleep?”","“Not really.”","Qiao Nian ignored him and went to the fridge to get a bottle of water. She unscrewed the cap and took a sip. Then, she walked back and placed the bottle on the table. She raised her cold chin slightly and said, “I’ve already written Master Cheng’s prescription. It’s there on the table. You can give it to Bo","Jingxing when the time comes.”","1","Even if she didn’t say anything, Ye Wangchuan had already seen the paper’s contents.","Qiao Nian’s handwriting was messy, but she wrote it very carefully. Other than the number of herbs, she also wrote down the adjustments to each stage.","It could be seen that she had considered all aspects when writing the prescription.","Ye Wangchuan walked over and picked up the towel she had thrown on the chair. He suddenly said, “Come over. I’ll help you dry your hair.”","Qiao Nian had just put down the water bottle. Hearing this, she looked at him in surprise. She paused for a moment and subconsciously rejected it. “No need, Tl...”","Before she could finish, the man forced her to sit on the sofa. His magnetic voice was low and hoarse. “It’s not easy for you. Let me do it.”","With that, he ran his fingers through her hair and wiped the water droplets skillfully.","Qiao Nian was speechless.","His movements were light and slow. He didn’t do anything overt. When his fingers passed through her hair, he would even help her tidy it. At first, Qiao Nian’s back was straightened. She resisted this behavior, but she quickly relaxed and narrowed her eyes, feeling a little tired.."]},{"number":788,"title":"Chapter 788 - Wear Whatever You’re Comfortable With","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Ye Wangchuan looked at the shallow dark circles under the girl’s eyes and subconsciously lowered his voice.","‘ian Nian, do you know where the hairdryer is?”","Qiao Nian hadn’t slept. She was really tired. Furthermore, with him drying her hair now, it made her want to sleep even more.","Forcing herself to stay awake, she pointed to the bathroom. “Over there.”","Afraid that he wouldn’t find it, she added lazily, “In the bathroom drawer.”","Ye Wangchuan quickly went to the bathroom to find the hairdryer. He plugged it in and chose the warmest temperature, then stood behind her again and patiently helped her blow dry her hair.","Qiao Nian was already feeling drowsy. With the warm wind blowing against her hair, she wanted to sleep even more.","In order to prevent herself from really sleeping, she forced herself to stay awake. She thought about it and asked, “By the way, Master Wang, what should I wear to eat later?”","It was getting easier and easier to address him as Master Wang. However, she wasn’t as respectful as Gu San and the others. Every time she called out this name, there was always a hint of interest as if there was a little hook hidden within, making people unaware of it.","Ye Wangchuan’s breathing paused for a moment before he returned to normal. He pushed the black hair that had fallen to her eyebrows away and slowly used the hairdryer to blow her hair at a different angle. He said calmly, “Whatever you’re comfortable with.”","Qiao Nian finally opened her eyes a little and glanced at him arrogantly. She smiled lazily and said, “I’m wearing what I usually wear.”","“A sweater or a hoodie. As long as you don’t think it’s too casual for me to see my elders like this, I don’t care.”","She was only wearing this much, anyway. In the past, Shen Qiongzhi always said that her clothes were boring and not as vibrant as Qiao Chen’s clothes.","She didn’t know what to wear to meet the elders. This was all she knew to wear.","Ye Wangchuan blew on her head silently and ruffled her hair. He said affectionately, “Only a few people having lunch with us this afternoon. They’re all your acquaintances. My aunt Ye Lan, Chen Chen, and the other Old Master. He’s not as serious as you think. You’ll know when you see him. He’s quite easy","to get along with. He doesn’t care about these external things, either. Just treat it as a normal meal.”","“...” Eating with Old Master Ye? If Qiao Nian didn’t know Old Master Ye’s identity, she would have thought that he was talking about books.","That person was someone who appeared on TV when he went out.","Ye Wangchuan was really not worried about this. He continued in a very normal tone, “Besides, I’m also here. If there’s anything, I’ll stand in front of you. You don’t have to worry about anything, Just eat.”","Hearing this, Qiao Nian tured her head and looked at him thoughtfully with her dark eyes. She pursed her lips and did not say anything. Seemingly in a good mood, she turned her head and lowered her eyes. “You said it yourself, I’ll dress normally.”","Ye Wangchuan smiled and gently blow-dried her hair again. “As I said, wear whatever you want. Wear whatever you feel comfortable with.”","In the old residence of the Ye family, Old Master Ye was also conflicted about this.","He had changed into a bright navy blue Chinese tunic suit today. He had meticulously arranged every wrinkle and ironed it neatly. He stood in front of the mirror for a long time and smoothed the creases on his collar. Then, he turned around and asked the butler standing beside him, “How does this look?”","The butler had already seen him change into three sets of clothes. Hearing this, his facial skin, which was hidden under his stoic expression, twitched. He replied respectfully and simply, “Old Master Ye, whatever you wear will fit you..”"]},{"number":789,"title":"Chapter 789 - Who Told You I’m Nervous?","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Old Master Ye moved his gaze away from the mirror and said unhappily, “I’m not asking if it fits. ‘m asking you if I look amiable? Will young people like me? Isn’t this color too serious?”","The old butler looked at his powerful aura and then at his white hair and serious face. He thought about the questions and was a little at a loss for an answer. He whispered tentatively, “If you think the color is too serious, why don’t you change it to red? Red is a celebratory color.”","“I’s not the new year!” Old Master Ye looked at the mirror again. “Forget it. I don’t think I’ll ask you about aesthetic standards anymore.”","The butler: “...”","He couldn’t stand watching him gesture in front of the mirror for the entire morning, He reminded him softly, “Old Master Ye, do you want to ask Young Master? Young Master should know what color Miss Qiao likes.”","Old Master Ye’s eyes lit up. He looked at him in praise and then looked at the living room.","Ye Qichen was playing with his phone on the sofa. It was obvious that he had dressed up seriously today. His hair was combed smooth and coiled at the back of his head, revealing his fair and tender face. He was adorable.","However, his pretty face was quite serious, which greatly reduced his cuteness.","“Chen Chen.”","The little boy nestled on the sofa looked up. His dark and deep eyes were the characteristic of the Ye family. At a young age, his facial features could be seen. Old Master Ye looked at him and coughed, embarrassed to ask him this.","Unexpectedly, the little guy was smart. Seeming to have heard their conversation, he sized him up before saying, “It’s cute.”","Old Master Ye: “??”","“What’s cute?”","Ye Qichen moved his gaze away and placed his phone on his knees. He leaned back and showed his sweater with a picture of a cat on it. A cat brooch was also on the side of the jacket. He raised his chin slightly with the same wooden face. Old Master Ye could see his proud expression. “Sister likes cute","types.”","“..” Old Master Ye’s lips twitched.","Looking at his strange clothes, he finally understood that he usually wore them rigidly. Why did he have to get the auntie who took care of him to find him clothes with cat prints today? It was because of Qiao Nian!","He looked at the little child nestled on the sofa and felt upset.","It was heartbreaking for the older one to not go home on a big day and for the younger one to be like this.","Before Old Master Ye could react, he heard a car stop outside.","The butler whispered from the side, “I think it’s Missy.”","Just as his voice fell.","Ye Lan walked in valiantly. Seeing them, she put down the car key and greeted, “Dad, are you ready? We should be leaving soon.”","Old Master Ye felt that he had more or less prepared himself, but thinking of what Ye Qichen had said earlier, he was not very confident. He looked up and asked her, “Are my clothes too boring? Do I look approachable?”","“Er...” Ye Lan rushed back from the unit in a hurry and did not turn around for a moment. She only looked at him after putting down her car keys. After knowing his intentions, she laughed involuntarily and said, “Dad, you don’t have to be so nervous. Qiao Nian is very easy to get along with. She’s not that","unreasonable.”","“Ahem.” Old Master Ye felt a little embarrassed by her words. He was mainly embarrassed to admit that he cared about this. He even pulled a long face and pretended to be angry. “Who told you I’m nervous? I’m just meeting a junior. Do I have to be nervous?”"]},{"number":790,"title":"Chapter 790 - Wei Ling and the Others Are Stopped Outside","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Despite saying that, he subconsciously tugged at his collar again to maintain his best appearance.","Ye Lan saw that he couldn’t help but tidy up his clothes and smiled. She did not expose him.","She followed his words and said, “Yes, yes, yes. Don’t be nervous. I’m nervous, okay?”","“Speaking of which, I haven’t seen Nian Nian in a long time. I really miss her.”","Old Master Ye glanced at her and did not say anything.","It had been a long time since she last saw her, but what about him? He had never seen her before at all. This was the first time they were meeting! Speaking of which, it was all his unfilial grandson’s fault!","Old Master Ye recalled. “By the way, have you booked a place to eat?”","Ye Lan placed her hands on his shoulders and said in amusement and anger, “How could I not? Don’t worry, I’ve booked the entire venue for you.”","“Where are we eating?”","Ye Lan’s gaze was gentle as she smiled and said, “The Imperial Mansion. Wangchuan said that Nian Nian was afraid that you wouldn’t be used to eating heavy-flavored dishes, so he specially chose the Imperial Mansion. The dishes there are light-flavored and more suitable for people your age.”","“At my age, I can eat anything. There’s no need for her to make things my preference...” Although he said that, he couldn’t help but smile. It was obvious that he was happy inside and was only pretending to argue.","At the Imperial Mansion.","At this moment, Qiao Chen was following behind Wei Ling as they walked in.","She had returned to Beijing half a month ago. After staying in Beijing for a few days, she followed Steven overseas to participate in a competition.","She had just returned the day before yesterday and had even brought back the gold award from the competition.","Before long, Wei Ling would spread this news to the domestic media to help her build momentum.","When she returned this time, her aura had improved a lot. She had also seen a lot of the world with Steven and was much more mature.","Wei Ling invited many friends in the circle to dinner this time, and she also wanted to introduce her to the people in the upper circles.","Qiao Chen knew very well, but she was not as happy as she was in the past.","Even if she was happy, she kept her eyes closed and did not show so much emotion.","“President Wei, this... It might be inconvenient today. Someone booked the entire place.”","Qiao Chen was in a daze as she thought about something. When she came back to her senses, she heard the manager and the others talking to Wei Ling. She looked up in surprise, her eyes filled with shock.","Booked the entire venue?","Who had the ability to book the entire Imperial Mansion?","‘The Imperial Mansion wasn’t an ordinary place. Usually, it was difficult to book a room, let alone the whole place.","This was not something that money could do.","Many people in Beijing did not lack money. Furthermore, everyone knew that the boss behind the Imperial Mansion had a deep background. Who could book the entire place?","Wei Ling had the same reaction. She was stunned for a moment. “You said someone booked the entire place? Who is it?”","“Well...” The manager glanced at her and was polite, but he did not say a word. “It’s not convenient for us to disclose this.”","‘There was always someone stronger in Beijing.","Even if Wei Ling was unhappy, she couldn’t say anything. Compromising, she said, “We’re already here. You can’t let us leave empty-handed. How about this? We don’t want a private room anymore. Can you arrange a seat in the hall for us?”","Elder Wei had been saved from the gates of hell. With him around, the Wei family’s status in Beijing remained the same.","She did not expect the manager to reject her.","Who knew.","“Tm sorry. The Imperial Mansion has been booked for the entire day. Not even the hall is available. President Wei, why don’t you come another day?”"]},{"number":791,"title":"Chapter 791 - Extremely Arrogant Car Plate","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Wei Ling walked out of the Imperial Mansion with an ugly expression. As she walked down the stairs, her anger had not subsided. Her face was dark, and the corners of her mouth drooped.","Qiao Chen followed behind her and turned back to look at the Imperial Mansions door in deep thought. She then caught up to her and said softly, seemingly unintentionally, “I wonder who booked the place. The manager didn’t even give you face.”","“Hmph.” Wei Ling suppressed her anger, but her eyes also lowered as she said calmly, “Beijing is filled with crouching tigers and hidden dragons. I’m not as powerful as you think. I’ll always meet someone who doesn’t give me face.”","“But...” She paused and walked to the car. Then, she stopped and looked back with a complicated gaze. “This is the first time I heard that this place can be booked. I think the person who booked this place has a high status. He’s at least the kind of person who goes on news programs.”","Qiao Chen had seen a lot of things in the past month. Hearing this, she couldn’t help but look in the Imperial Mansion’s direction again.","Those people who could appear on the news in Beijing were all at the top of the pyramid.","Envy and yearning could be seen in her eyes.","“Let’s go. Let’s eat somewhere else.” Wei Ling didn’t notice the yearning and ambition in her eyes as she opened the car door.","Qiao Chen obediently retracted her gaze and opened the car door. “Yes.”","She was about to get into the car when she suddenly saw a black car with a red flag drive over from the corner of her eye.","There were many luxury cars in Beijing. A luxury car could be seen every three to five steps. Many good cars that couldn’t be seen even if one went around Rao City were common here.","However, very few people in Beijing drove with red flags.","This car’s license plate was especially arrogant.","Behind the Beijing car plate was a series of 8s.","Such a car plate was not something that could be bought with money.","Before getting into the car, she couldn’t help but look over. When she did, she saw that the black car was parked at the entrance of the Imperial Mansion.","After a while, a man and a woman got out of the car.","The man was tall and had a straight back. One could see his noble aura from his back. The Imperial Mansion’s manager, who had just rejected them, plastered a smile on his face and bent down to curry favor with them, as he took the car key from the man and talked carefully.","As for what he said, Qiao Chen was too far away to hear.","However, from the manager’s actions, it was obvious that he was extremely respectful to that man and was even very careful.","Was this the person who had booked the entire Imperial Mansion?","He looked very young from the back.","She lowered her eyes, her gaze mainly landing on the girl walking in with the man.","The girl had her back to her and did not turn back from the beginning to the end. However, her insufferable aura reminded Qiao Chen of someone.","Qiao Nian!","Qiao Chen thought of her for no reason. She stared intently at the back of the girl who was about to enter. The more she looked, the more familiar she felt.","In Rao City, she had specially asked around. The people from First High School said that Qiao Nian had not gone back to school.","She wasn’t surprised that Qiao Nian appeared in Beijing.","The strange thing was, didn’t the manager say that the entire place had been booked by someone? Her aunt also said that the person who booked the Imperial Mansion was probably someone who could attend congressional events... How could Qiao Nian be related to such a person?","She immediately became frustrated. She bit her lip and wanted to chase after her to see if it was really Qiao Nian.","Wei Ling had already gotten into the car. Inserting the car key and seeing that she was still standing there in a daze, she couldn’t help but shout, “Hey, hey, what are you doing? Get in..”"]},{"number":792,"title":"Chapter 792 - Sister Nian: Why Should I Be Nervous?","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Qiao Chen’s thoughts were suddenly pulled back. She returned to her senses and looked at Wei Ling. She pursed her lips and said, “I saw a familiar face.”","“Who is it?”","Qiao Chen’s eyes flickered, and she only said after a long time, “Qiao Nian.”","a","“I think I saw her enter the Imperial Mansion with a man.” Qiao Chen placed her hand on the door and looked up. The manager and the couple who had gotten out of the car had already entered. She couldn’t see their figures at all. Hesitating for a moment, she added in a low voice, “I don’t know if I saw","wrongly...”","“You must have seen wrongly!” As soon as she finished speaking, Wei Ling interrupted her casually. “I think you’re just too busy recently. You’re so tired that you’re hallucinating, Qiao Nian definitely won’t appear at such an occasion. I already told you, the people who booked the Imperial Mansion today","are either wealthy or noble. How could she know these people? Hurry up and get into the car. Mr. Steven is still waiting for us. Don’t delay!”","” Qiao Chen pursed her lips and finally looked in the direction of the Imperial Mansion. She retracted her gaze and said softly, “That’s true.”","She stopped thinking about it and got into the car.","In the Imperial Mansion.","‘The manager gently led the two of them through the long corridor and stopped outside a private room. He said softly, “Master Wang, Old Master Ye and the others are already inside.”","“Okay, I understand. I’ll go in myself. Go busy yourself first.” Ye Wangchuan’s eyes were outstanding. He looked especially outstanding today, and he was also in a good mood.","“OK","Before leaving, the manager secretly glanced in Qiao Nian’s direction and then quickly retracted his gaze. As if he was afraid of being discovered, he ran away quickly and disappeared.","Qiao Nian was originally playing with her phone, but his glance earlier was quite obvious.","After replying, Qiao Nian raised her eyes and stuffed her phone back into her pocket. She whispered to the man beside her, “Your grandfather and the others are here?”","“think so.”","“Then let’s go in.”","“Wait.” Ye Wangchuan naturally pulled her back. He lowered his head and raised his hand to brush her hair that was hanging down her forehead. His gaze was as gentle as the galaxy. “Your hair is a little messy. I’ll help you push it away.”","His fingers were a little rough. It was unknown if his fingertips had touched the girl’s fair forehead on purpose or accidentally. After a while, he moved them away like a dragonfly touching the water.","She did not resist.","This time, she did not frown.","Ye Wangchuan smiled and felt even happier. He lowered his arm to his side, looking lazy and casual. “We’re about to enter. Are you nervous?”","“Huh?” Qiao Nian did not notice his small movements. It was also possible that he had been doing small movements non-stop recently, so she was already used to it. She didn’t notice anything wrong and was instead quite interested in his questions. She raised her eyes and asked in a wild manner, “Why","should I be nervous?”","Ye Wangchuan was speechless.","Seeing that he was speechless by her question, Qiao Nian walked in front with a devilish gaze and said lazily, “Aren’t you always around?","“since you’re here, I don’t think I need to be nervous.”","The girl’s voice was slightly hoarse, and it was obvious that she was teasing him. However, Ye Wangchuan’s heart softened for no reason. He opened the door for her and whispered, “That’s true.”","Qiao Nian felt his breath brush past her ear. Before she could recover from his words, she was already looking into the eyes of the people in the private room.","Ye Qichen reacted the fastest. Noticing the person at the door, he immediately threw down his chopsticks and shouted excitedly, “Sister!”"]},{"number":793,"title":"Chapter 793 - Master Wang’s Display of Affection","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","After he called out to Qiao Nian, he seemed to have only just noticed the man beside him. His expression changed from when he was blushing earlier, and his mood instantly dropped by more than one level. He pursed his lips and said reluctantly, “Uncle.”","His differential treatment was too obvious!","Ye Lan also saw the person at the door. She smiled and quickly greeted, “Nian Nian, Wangchuan, you’re here. I’ve been waiting for you for half a day. Come and sit down.”","Ye Wangchuan walked in front and took off the scarf around his neck. He chuckled and said, “We were delayed by a traffic jam.”","He casually placed his scarf on the back of the chair and pulled out the chair beside Ye Qichen. He greeted Old Master Ye, who was sitting upright. “Grandpa.”","“Yes,” Old Master Ye glanced at him and replied calmly.","His burning gaze was mainly focused on Qiao Nian, who was beside him.","The girl was wearing a white thick sweater with a cashmere jacket. She was wearing jeans underneath, which wrapped around her long and straight legs. She looked refreshed and clean, looking extremely exquisite.","She was actually quite compatible with her unfilial grandson!","The more Old Master Ye looked at her, the more he liked her. It wasn’t easy for him to see her, and he couldn’t look away at all. However, he still coughed to hide it and pretended to be calm. He asked, “Is this Nian Nian?”","Seeing his sitting posture, Ye Lan knew that he was curious and embarrassed to take the initiative to greet her. She covered her mouth and smiled. “Ah, this is Nian Nian. I told you about her a few times before.”","She then turned around and introduced him to Qiao Nian. “Nian Nian, this is my father, Wangnhuan’s grandfather.”","Qiao Nian walked to Ye Wangchuan’s side and looked at him with clear eyes. She said politely, “Hello, Grandpa Ye.”","Old Master Ye looked at the girl’s lowered eyelashes. From this angle, he could see that she was obedient and sensible. He was originally serious, but now, he couldn’t suppress the corners of his mouth. He coughed gently again. “Good child, sit quickly.”","“Sit here.”","Ye Wangchuan had just pulled out a chair for her.","Qiao Nian didn’t stand on ceremony with him and sat down.","Ye Wangchuan pulled out the chair beside her and sat down naturally. He then handed her the hot towel to wipe her hands.","“Wipe your hands first before eating.”","“Okay.” Qiao Nian took the towel from him and lowered her eyes. She looked very obedient. She wiped her hands and placed the hot towel beside her.","Ye Wangchuan poured a cup of tea and placed it in front of her. Then, he took her empty cup and used it himself.","“The tea here is good. Want to try it?”","Qiao Nian held the cup and looked at the heavy tea leaves in it. She picked it up and took a sip slowly before putting down the cup.","Ye Lan was overjoyed at their interaction. She smiled and said, “Nian Nian, when did you come to Beijing?”","Qiao Nian had just put down her cup. Hearing this, she looked up and replied politely, “Early in the month.”","“The beginning of the month?” Ye Lan was a little surprised. She calculated the time and then asked, “Then, haven’t you been in Beijing for almost a month?”","He hadn’t told her about Qiao Nian coming to Beijing for a month!","Ye Lan glanced at her nephew bitterly, but she was afraid that Qiao Nian would see through her. She silently retracted her gaze, feeling extremely depressed.","This brat was too biased!","They weren’t wolves. Could she and the old man eat his little girl?","Ye Wangchuan received the accusation in Ye Lan’s eyes. He placed the plates and bowls beside the girl calmly before saying slowly, “Nian Nian is in Beijing for something. She’s not here to play. I’d have definitely told you in advance if she was here to play..”"]},{"number":794,"title":"Chapter 794 - Come to Treat Master Cheng","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","He looked at Ye Lan and Old Master Ye without any intention of hiding anything.","He said simply, “She came over to treat Master Cheng’s migraine. Master Cheng’s migraine has been quite serious recently. He went to look for Liang Lu and realized that the medicine was useless. I wanted him to try Chinese Medicine.”","“Lee.” Ye Lan had seen Qiao Nian use acupuncture to save Elder Wei at the Wei family previously. Thus, she wasn’t surprised to hear this. She then asked, “How is Master Cheng doing now?”","Ye Wangchuan: “Much better.”","“That’s good.” Ye Lan’s expression was extremely calm. Clearly, this answer was within her expectations.","Only Old Master Ye and the butler, who was standing in the comer, heard their conversation as if no one was around. They looked at Ye Lan and Ye Wangchuan and then at Qiao Nian. They did not recover from their shock for a long time.","Especially Old Master Ye. “Nian Nian knows Chinese Medicine?”","Hearing this, Ye Lan turned her head and smiled slightly. She rebuked him. “Dad, didn’t I mention it to you before? Nian Nian wants to study Chinese Medicine in university.”","Old Master Ye: “...” Wasn’t she still not at university?!","Of course, he knew that Qiao Nian had entered the Traditional Chinese Medicine faculty. For this reason, he had specially looked for Liang Conglin to check her results. He knew the moment Qiao Nian’s joint examination results were out.","He then looked at the obedient girl sitting there with a cup of tea in her hand, restraining her banditry aura. He couldn’t hide the surprise in his eyes.","He knew that Qiao Nian majored in Traditional Chinese Medicine, but this was not the college entrance examination. Qiao Nian had not gone to college yet, and she had not gone to Qing University to study.","From the sound of it, his brat meant that Qiao Nian had managed to control Master Cheng’s condition before Liang Lu could.","In other words, Qiao Nian’s medical skills weren’t worse than Liang Lu’s!","This.","Old Master Ye was dizzy and couldn’t snap back to reality.","Ye Lan chatted with Ye Wangchuan and Qiao Nian for a while before getting the waiter to serve the dishes.","Various dishes filled the entire table in the blink of an eye.","Ye Lan was wearing a white shirt and a woman’s cloak jacket, looking valiant and heroic. When the dishes were served, she smiled and said, “Nian Nian, you guys didn’t come on time, so I ordered some random dishes with my dad. I heard from Wangchuan that you like to eat spicy chicken. I got them to","prepare one for you. See if there’s anything else you like. Don’t stand on ceremony with me. Just get them to add it.”","Old Master Ye slowly came back to his senses from his surprise. He coughed and pretended to be serious. “Yes, don’t stand on ceremony. Order whatever you want.”","Qiao Nian leaned back on the chair. Her originally tense back slowly relaxed in this warm atmosphere. “I can eat anything.”","The little guy had been talking to her. One moment, he was handing her a bag of cookies, and the next, he was stuffing candy into her hand. He was so obedient.","Qiao Nian accepted it with a smile. She put away the sweet candies and biscuits Ye Qichen and then looked up at Ye Lan with her dark eyes.","“These are enough.” Then, afraid that she was too casual, she restrained her temper and added politely, “Auntie Ye, Grandpa Ye, these are enough.”","She looked over. Other than the few dishes placed in front of Old Master Ye that were light Suzhou dishes and pigeon soup, many of the dishes were bright red with a layer of chili oil floating on them. It could be seen that they were all her favorites.","Qiao Nian loved spicy food. It was to the point where no level of spice could hinder her from eating it. However, she wasn’t picky with food and could basically eat anything.","Before she came, she had already thought about accompanying Old Master Ye, Ye Lan, and the others to eat light dishes today. She didn’t expect them to order a table of bright red Sichuan dishes for her.."]},{"number":795,"title":"Chapter 795 - Nian Nian, Do You Have a Boyfriend?","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","‘When it was time to eat, the private room was very quiet.","Old Master Ye didn’t speak much.","Ye Wangchuan also kept quiet. Occasionally, he would pick up two dishes that she liked but could not reach.","Qiao Nian wasn’t a talkative person. She usually ate with her head lowered. Only when Ye Lan or Chen Chen spoke to her would she occasionally look up and answer seriously and politely.","It was a hearty and happy meal.","Old Master Ye was the first to put down his chopsticks and take a sip of tea. He cleared his throat and looked at the man and woman sitting opposite him. Then, he looked at the obedient little ancestor sitting beside Qiao Nian. The more he looked at them, the more he felt like they were a family of three.","The harmonious scene was exactly as he had dreamed.","He looked around and then back at Qiao Nian.","The girl sat there eating casually with her eyes lowered slightly. Her eating speed was not fast, but it was very natural. She wasn’t pretentious at all. She seemed to like spicy dishes a lot. Old Master Ye saw her pick up the spicy chicken a few times. She also liked the boiled fish his unfilial grandson picked","for her.","Spicy chicken cubes, boiled fish... Old Master Ye silently remembered these two dishes in his heart. Then, he saw Ye Wangchuan naturally scoop a bowl of silver-eared soup for the girl and place it beside her. He even whispered, “Eat and drink some sugar water.”","Qiao Nian had always been impatient with desserts. From the corner of her eye, she saw the silver-eared soup beside her hand and did not say a word.","“Tsk.” Ye Wangchuan seemed to know what she was thinking. He chuckled and leaned back against the chair lazily. He relaxed and said softly, “Don’t worry. It’s not sweet. It’s very light. You can drink less.”","“Okay.” Hearing that it was not sweet, Qiao Nian’s frown relaxed a little. Despite being a little hesitant about desserts like silver-eared soup, she did not reject his kindness. “Okay.”","As soon as she finished speaking, Ye Qichen handed her his small bowl and looked up at her beautiful and exquisite face, looking like he wanted to fight for her favor. “Sister, pumpkin soup is not sweet.”","There was a bowl of silver-eared soup on her left hand and pumpkin soup on her right. Her mouth twitched as the two of them looked at her.","Her chopsticks paused. She suddenly felt like she couldn’t eat it.","It had to be said that the Imperial Mansion’s chefs were pretty good. One of the spicy chicken cubes was especially outstanding. She was still not full. From the looks of it, these two dishes weren’t something she wanted to eat.","Qiao Nian frowned and wondered if she should put down her chopsticks. After all, she probably wouldn’t be able to eat anything if she ate a bow! of silver-eared porridge and a bowl of pumpkin porridge. Instead of being too full to walk, she might as well not eat and leave some food.","However, Old Master Ye couldn’t sit still. He slowly put down the cup in his hand and pretended to ask casually, “Nian Nian, do you have a boyfriend?”","“Cough, cough, cough!” Beside him, Ye Lan was originally drinking soup. Hearing this, she choked on it. She quickly tuned her head away and covered her mouth with a tissue. However, she couldn’t help but let out a series of coughs.","Finally suppressing her cough, she couldn’t care less that her throat was still itchy. She quickly tried to smooth things over. “My father just loves to worry blindly. Nian Nian, don’t mind...”","Although she also wanted to now if the brat at home had wooed her over, her father was too fierce!!!","He actually asked directly.","She was afraid that Qiao Nian would think too much.","“People his age are like this. They like to gossip..”"]},{"number":796,"title":"Chapter 796 - Why Does He Have Such an Uncle?","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Fortunately, Qiao Nian didn’t care. She was only surprised for a moment. She then put down her chopsticks and replied politely, “No.”","“No?” Ye Lan’s mouth moved subconsciously. It was obvious that she cared about the answer to that question. Her eyes unconsciously floated in her nephew’s direction. It was like she was calling him unreliable.","1","Ye Wangchuan was calm and ignored her gaze. Without hesitation, he helped Qiao Nian turn up the air conditioner in the private room by one degree. He then put down the remote control calmly and relaxedly. Ye Wangchuan felt more at ease.","Old Master Ye didn’t give up. “What’s your type, then?”","Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows in surprise. She wondered why he cared so much about whether she had a boyfriend or not and the type of guys she liked.","She lowered her eyes and thought carefully. She thought for a long time before turning her head and suddenly looked at the little guy next to her. Her black eyes narrowed earnestly as she said, “Someone like Chen Chen?”","Ye Qichen didn’t expect Qiao Nian to say that she liked guys like him. He clasped the corner of his clothes excitedly, and his small face turned crimson in an instant. It was like he was turning into a ripe apple. He turned so red, steam almost came out of his ears.","Even so, his eyes flashed brightly. Unable to control his happiness, he whispered weakly, “I also prefer girls like Sister.”","In the end, he took a brief glance at Qiao Nian, nodded weakly, and said, “I like Sister the most.”","‘As he said that, he lowered his head shyly. The pink blush spread from his face all the way to his neck, showing his shyness.","Haha! Ye Wangchuan squinted his eyes slightly and put his hand on the table. He casually plucked at the beads on his wrist and said carelessly, “I seem to remember you saying that you have no interest in girls?”","“No interest in girls?” Qiao Nian was surprised.","Ye Qichen raised his head abruptly and stared at his uncle with his dark eyes. When Qiao Nian looked at him, he immediately put up a cute expression. His eyebrows moved slightly and he said, “Oh, I was young at that time. I was young and ignorant. I wasn’t as sensible as you, uncle.”","The housekeeper couldn’t help but let out a chuckle.","Ye Lan and Old Master Ye were amused.","Only Ye Wangchuan was not amused. He didn’t answer for a long time. However, he was only stunned for a short while. His eyebrows lifted slightly and he glanced at the boy. He said, “You were indeed young at that time. You were 20 years too young to discuss this topic.”","Ye Qichen was speechless.","Why did he have such an uncle?","After the meal, Ye Lan and Old Master Ye left first.","Qiao Nian followed Ye Wangchuan to the garage to pick up the car.","She had her head lowered the whole way as she played with her cell phone. She refused Qin Si mercilessly when he sent her an invitation to play a game with him.","Then, she decided to check her notifications.","It was rare for Shen Hui to send her a message. She asked her when she would be returning to school.","Qiao Nian lowered her head and replied to Shen Hui’s message. All of a sudden, she was blocked and she became stuck between two cars.","“You like younger guys?”","Qiao Nian suddenly raised her head, and the top of her head almost hit his chin. Although she didn’t hit his chin, she was still stuck between him and the cars.","She seemed to be trapped in his chest. The atmosphere felt cramped and ambiguous.","She narrowed her eyes and put her cell phone down dryly. Squinting her eyes under the man’s gaze, her dark eyes were unabashedly casual. “Huh? What younger guys?”"]},{"number":797,"title":"Chapter 797 - Master Wang, Are You Confessing to Me?","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Ye Wangchuan didn’t plan to get out of her way. He blocked her way out from between the two cars, lowered his head, and looked at her with sultry eyes. He smiled and said, “Did you not say that you liked someone like Chen Chen? Ye Lan just sent me a message saying that you liked young boys.”","“Oh.” Qiao Nian’s mind finally reacted. She subconsciously raised her hand, trying to pull down the brim of her baseball cap. She then remembered that she left it at home. She put her hand down and looked at him with frank eyes. “I do like Chen Chen, Aunty Ye is right.”","She even admitted it?","Ye Wangchuan’s eyes were deep, darkened, and narrowed a little more. The distance between them became even closer. His breath dripped down Qiao Nian’s neck. It felt a little warm and itchy. His breath had the slight smell of wine. It was quite light and not obvious, but his earlobes revealed a little","crimson color. It was sexy and charming,","“What’s wrong with older guys?”","His voice was low and dull.","Taken aback by his question, Qiao Nian pondered his question for a while. “There’s nothing wrong with them.”","Ye Wangchuan stared at the girl trapped between his arms. Her fair face and eyebrows were particularly eye-catching. She looked very delicate. It was just that there was a hint of wildness to her.","She seemed similar to a wolf cub.","If he wasn’t careful, she could just slip away.","He thought he was a patient person, but he lost his patience when he saw Ye Lan’s mocking text message.","He stared at the girl’s face with drooping eyelashes. From his point of view, her eyelashes were long and dense. They curved and drooped downwards. She had clear eyes, and she looked pretty no matter which angle he looked from.","He was also a student once. He understood what kind of girls the boys liked.","A girl like Qiao Nian would be very popular in school.","The school belle for the next three years of Qing University had basically been decided!","He remembered that she was accosted by a boy on the way to Qing University for the examination, and he asked for her WeChat. Although she didn’t give it to him, this might not be the case in the future.","“Since they’re not bad, why don’t you like them?” Ye Wangchuan breathed slightly and tensed up. His eyes grew deeper as he looked at the girl in his arms. He said slowly, “Compared with young boys, the older ones are more mature, stable, and caring. What do you think?”","Just because Qiao Nian did not consider this before, that did not mean she didn’t understand.","She had asked him once before, but someone had told her that they were only good friends. Therefore, she had gotten rid of this thought.","She had always thought that his behavior was that of a friend.","But now.","She looked at the man’s increasingly obvious behavior. Squinting, she asked directly, “Master Wang, are you confessing to me?”","She initially had no intention of asking him this question again. It had embarrassed her too much the previous time.","It would be so embarrassing if she was being too self-indulgent!","However, Qiao Nian wasn’t a shy girl. Since she thought of this, she wouldn’t hide it and would also not be too embarrassed to say it.","Ye Wangchuan didn’t expect her to be so direct. She was looking at him with such clear eyes. It surprised him a little.","However, he didn’t hesitate for too long. He smiled, and his eyes were shining and deep. His charming face was definitely worthy of the title of being the third most beautiful face in Beijing. “If I say yes, how do you plan on answering?”","Qiao Nian couldn’t speak for a long time, a little unprepared to answer his sudden question.","How was she supposed to answer?","If this was someone else, she would have rejected him without much consideration.","However, this was Ye Wangchuan.."]},{"number":798,"title":"Chapter 798 - Master Wang: Use Your Boyfriend’s Authority First","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Qjao Nian pursed her lips and was silent for a moment.","“Tm about to take the college entrance examination.”","In fact, during the few seconds of her silence, the man’s back had already tensed up, and his mood was changing indeterminately. His heart seemed to be in the air. Whether it fell into the clouds or hell depended on her.","Unexpectedly, the answer was not especially good or bad.","“Is the college entrance examination important to you?” Qiao Nian was only participating in the college entrance examination as a formality for the first place of Qing University’s joint examination.","“Huh?” Qiao Nian had never seen him confess in such a way. He was even more proactive and domineering than a person confessing. Restraining her frustration and remaining silent for two seconds before looking at him again, she then said arrogantly, “It’s still quite important. I don’t want to get second","place.","“The college entrance examination is coming up soon, I’ll definitely need time to revise.”","This answer was reasonable and perfunctory.","Young Master Ye was not one easy to fool. He narrowed his eyes and did not give in. “Then, after the college entrance examination. I can wait.”","Qiao Nian paused. “I didn’t say that.” She only said that she wanted to prepare for the college entrance examination. She didn’t say that she would answer him immediately after the college entrance examination.","Ye Wangchuan smiled as smoke swirled around him. He raised his hand to brush away the stray hair that had slipped down from her eyebrows. Then, he ravaged the girl’s hair shamelessly. He smiled and said, “There’s still half a month. Study hard. I’ll wait for your answer after the college entrance","examination.”","Qiao Nian was speechless.","Didn’t she already give her answer? He didn’t even need to listen to her???","Then, why should she think about it? He might as well decide for himself.","Roused, she was about to speak when she suddenly smelled the faint smell of alcohol. She heard the man’s low and hoarse voice lean closer to her.","“Before that, I want to reserve my boyfriend’s power.”","“Huh?”","Before she could react, a hot sensation suddenly pressed down on her lips. It was only for a moment as if she had been electrocuted. Qiao Nian’s mind was blank. She subconsciously clenched her fists and did not react.","1","The man had already moved away. He lowered his arm and did not push her against the car anymore. As if nothing had happened, he returned to his usual noble and lazy expression. He opened the car door and placed his hand on it, looking relaxed. “Qin Si wants to invite you to a drink. He found my","place. Are you going?”","” Qiao Nian didn’t understand how he could be so natural and smooth at being a hooligan. How could he speak to her so calmly?","It could be seen that he was also a beast in human clothing on ordinary days. It was just that his refined skin was too deceptive that no one had realized.","Ina restaurant not far from the Imperial Mansion, a drinking party was taking place in a private room. Wei Ling was chatting with Steven and the others.","Qiao Chen used the excuse of going to the washroom to come out for a breather.","She turned on the tap and rinsed the back of her hand. For some reason, she thought again of the back she saw at the entrance of the Imperial Mansion today.","Although Wei Ling said that it couldn’t be Qiao Nian, she still felt uneasy.","Qiao Chen bit her lips and stared at her gradually calming self in the mirror. She then turned off the tap and took out her phone from her handbag. After searching for a long time, she finally found Xu Xu’s number.","Ever since the joint examination results came out a month ago and Qiao Nian’s results crushed hers, she had not contacted anyone from her previous school.","She only hesitated for a moment before calling.","The call went through, but the other party quickly hung up.","Qiao Chen wasn’t in a hurry. She looked at the time and saw that First High School was probably in class. After waiting patiently for a few minutes, sure enough, Xu Xu returned not long after with a light tone.","“Hey, Chen Chen, I was in class earlier. I didn’t dare to answer the phone during the old witch’s class, so I sneaked out. Is something the matter?”","Qiao Chen lowered her eyes gently and asked in a low voice, “Ku Xu, has Qiao Nian gone back to school?”"]},{"number":799,"title":"Chapter 799 - Was the Person She Saw Qiao Nian?","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","“Qiao Nian?” Xu Xu paused. Passing by the other classes, she secretly covered the receiver with her hand, afraid that someone would hear her. She lowered her voice. “Chen Chen, why are you asking about her?”","Qiao Chen stared at her exquisite eyebrows in the mirror and lowered her eyes. Her voice was gentle as water. “It’s nothing, I was just asking.”","“Oh, I thought she was bullying you again.”","Last time, regarding Wu Jie’s matter, only Xu Xu believed that Qiao Chen had been framed.","After Wu Jie left the school, everyone in the class, including Cai Yan, who had been pretty good with Qiao Chen, stopped contacting her. Only she continued to curry favor with Qiao Chen and felt that she was a friend.","Qiao Chen got into Qing University and went to Beijing. Her future was limitless, so she naturally wanted to hug her thigh.","“Qiao Nian isn’t back yet. When she comes back, people will definitely see her and post about her. She’s a famous person in school now. Many low-grade people treat her as an idol. There are many of her posts on the school forum. The people kneeling and licking her feet are so disgusting. I can’t stand","watching those people praise her every time!”","Xu Xu said in disdain, “If you didn’t transfer schools, she wouldn’t have been able to stand out in First High School.”","Hearing this, Qiao Chen’s heart tightened and she felt inexplicably frustrated. But she couldn’t show it to Xu Xu. Not replying, she only said, “Then, she’s not back yet.”","Qiao Chen recalled. “Didn’t she only apply for half a month’s leave? She should have gone back last week...”","“Last time, I heard someone from Class A leak that she only took half a month of leave,” Xu Xu continued unhappily. “But Chen Chen, you also know that she has never taken the school rules seriously. No one in the school cares about it, either. Now that she has good results, the school will let her do","whatever! Don’t you see that their form teacher, Shen Hui, is usually known as the Devil Teacher? She’s so strict with her class. She has never controlled her! It’s all because of her that she has double standards.”","First High School indeed had two standards.","Qiao Chen couldn’t help but think of Wu Jie’s previous matter. Wu Jie had posted on the forum complaining about her, but First High School actually did not delete the thread and insisted on keeping it there for the entire day. They deleted it the other day, causing the entire school to see it first.","She clenched her fists as her eyes flickered. The person reflected in the mirror was also wooden-faced and did not look good.","According to Xu Xu, Qiao Nian had indeed not returned to school. She was probably still in Beijing.","Could the person she saw at Imperial Mansion be Qiao Nian?","She wasn’t particularly sure.","After all, Nie Mis status in Beijing was not low. He had a wide network and knew many people. However, he was ultimately just a master of an unconventional culture. In a place like Beijing, quite a number of people like were Nie Mi. In a palm-sized territory, there was also Mr. Huang from the","Traditional Chinese Medicine Faculty. In recent times, there were also Liang Lu, Cheng Wu, and others with similar status among the younger generation","These people had high social status and were respected when they went out. However, in reality, they were definitely not as confident as people from big families like Wei Ling.","Since Wei Ling couldn’t eat in the Imperial Mansion, Nie Mi couldn’t book the entire venue either.","Qiao Nian only knew Nie Mi in Beijing.","That was the extent of her connections.","Qiao Chen felt a little relieved at this thought.."]},{"number":800,"title":"Chapter 800 - Sneaking a Look Into Class A.","paragraphs":["I","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","“Chen Chen.”","On the other end of the phone, Xu Xu called her a few times after noticing that she wasn’t talking or hanging up.","“Huh?” Qiao Chen returned to her senses. When she called again, she calmed down a lot. “What is it?”","Xu Xu said awkwardly, “Um... I’m still in class. I sneaked out. I have to go back quickly. Otherwise, if Old Liu finds out that I didn’t go back, he’ll definitely scold me.”","Disdain appeared in Qiao Chen’s eyes. Not taking her situation to heart, she pretended to care about her. “By the way, there’s one more thing I want to ask you. Did you see Weibo yesterday? Zhui Guang’s account was verified. She didn’t forward Xue Ziang’s statement, but she tagged Jiang Li and said that","he was her brother. Did the school leak any news?”","She suspected that Qiao Nian was Zhui Guang, but she only had this thought and did not have direct evidence.","Xu Xu was stunned. “What news?”","Sometimes, Qiao Chen looked down on her stupid head. Controlling her temper, she said gently, “It’s about Zhui Guang.”","“Isn’t Jiang Li Qiao Nian’s brother? He even came to our school. Zhui Guang said that he’s Jiang Li’s sister. Didn’t those people from Class A mention this?”","Xu Xu subconsciously shook her head, but remembering that Qiao Chen couldn’t see it, she quickly said, “No, I didn’t hear anyone mention this. Are you saying that Qiao Nian is Zhui Guang? Uh, no way? Why didn’t she say that?”","Seeing that she knew nothing, Qiao Chen didn’t say anything further. She lowered her eyes, restrained the uneasiness in the depths of her eyes, and changed the topic. “Aren’t you going to class? Go quickly, lest you get scolded by the teacher.”","Xu Xu had been out for a long time and was afraid of being asked by the teacher when she returned. Even if she wanted to talk to her more, she did not dare to delay.","“Then, I’ll go back first.”","Qiao Chen knew how to win people’s hearts. She said softly, “Thank you, Xu Xu. I’ll treat you to a meal when I get back to Rao City.”","“aren’t we friends? What’s wrong with helping you? You don’t have to be polite with me.” The girl’s voice was cheerful and light. After saying that, she was filled with worry. “Okay, I’m going back.”","“Yes.”","Qiao Chen hung up and put down her phone. After arranging her makeup again, she saw the message Xu Xu had sent her.","[Chen Chen, congratulations on getting the gold award. | forgot to tell you on the phone. I knew you were better than that Qiao Nian!]","Qiao Chen expressionlessly replied with a perfunctory “thank you” and threw her phone back into her handbag, She then arrogantly reapplied her lipstick and returned to the private room.","When Xu Xu returned to the classroom, one class had just ended. When the bell rang, she was called to the chemistry teacher’s office.","She walked behind the teacher with her head lowered the entire way. When she passed Class A, she thought of what Qiao Chen had asked her on the phone and couldn’t help but crane her neck to look into the classroom.","The class had just ended.","The teacher held a cup of water and the textbook in one hand as he left the classroom. The class immediately dispersed like birds and beasts. Some went to the toilet while others went to look for their friends.","She tiptoed and looked at the classrooms back. She relaxed when she saw that Qiao Nian’s seat was still empty.","The chemistry teacher happened to turn around and saw her looking around. He said something unhappily.","Xu Xu didn’t dare to look around anymore and quickly followed him into the office.."]}]);
